iven the digestive problem of the title, “Delhi Belly” thumbs its nose at propriety. Delhi belly, the traveler’s curse, afflicts a homegrown son (Kunaal Roy Kapur) in this caper comedy after he eats some particularly nasty street food. (The film lovingly shows just how unhygienic it is.) His stool sample, no less, is the trigger that sets the plot in motion, when it is accidentally switched with a similar-size package of contraband. Not what the gangster ordered ...', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/01/arts/delhi-span/ROUNDUP-3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/01/arts/delhi-span/ROUNDUP-3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/01/arts/delhi-span/ROUNDUP-3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 764, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/01/arts/delhi-span/ROUNDUP-3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/01/arts/delhi-span/ROUNDUP-3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Indian Cinema With an Indie Sensibility', 'kicker': 'Movie Review  ', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Delhi Belly', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Khan, Imran', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-01T02:09:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rachel Saltz', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rachel', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Saltz', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/beba3da9-2f07-51c7-a9c2-4b7caf4a1618', 'word_count': 350, 'uri': 'nyt://article/beba3da9-2f07-51c7-a9c2-4b7caf4a1618'}, {'abstract': 'Big Coal must learn its lesson. A yearlong federal inquiry found a chain of safety neglect. Congress should pass urgently needed legislation to prevent further disasters.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/01/opinion/01fri3.html', 'snippet': 'Big Coal must learn its lesson. A yearlong federal inquiry found a chain of safety neglect. Congress should pass urgently needed legislation to prevent further disasters.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Profits trumped all, including the safety and lives of 29 miners. That is the clear conclusion of a yearlong federal investigation into the Upper Big Branch disaster. Industry must finally learn its lesson. Congress and federal regulators must ensure that it does. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Lies and Truth About Upper Big Branch', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Lies and Truth About Upper Big Branch', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Massey Energy Co', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Upper Big Branch Mine', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mines and Mining', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rockefeller, John D IV', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-01T02:11:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'org