other Area Girds for Revolt as Sudan Approaches a Split', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Another Area Girds for Revolt As Sudan Approaches a Split', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'South Sudan', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'War Crimes, Genocide and Crimes Against Humanity', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Sudan', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Nuba Mountains (Sudan)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-01T02:12:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Africa', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeffrey Gettleman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeffrey', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gettleman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/844464b6-df8f-5557-8404-a5561014e8b3', 'word_count': 1133, 'uri': 'nyt://article/844464b6-df8f-5557-8404-a5561014e8b3'}, {'abstract': 'The struggling economy and the absence of a clear front-runner might be taking a toll on campaign contributions.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/01/us/politics/01donate.html', 'snippet': 'The struggling economy and the absence of a clear front-runner might be taking a toll on campaign contributions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Fund-raising by the Republican presidential candidates appears to be off to a slow start this year, hindered by the struggling economy, the absence of a clear and compelling front-runner, and the desire of many of the party’s biggest donors to wait and see how the race develops.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Fund-Raising Begins Slowly for G.O.P. Candidates', 'ki