of beet foam and Parmesan ice cream.', 'lead_paragraph': '“No, you don’t understand.” It wasn’t the first time I’d heard those words from Ferran Adrià, the chef and driving force behind El Bulli, the oft-proclaimed world’s greatest restaurant, which he recently announced is going to close in July. In my dozen or so visits with him over the last 10 years in northeastern Spain and in New York, it seemed there was always some point I was missing. ', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '40', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/03/magazine/03eat_span/03eat_span-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/03/magazine/03eat_span/03eat_span-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/03/magazine/03eat_span/03eat_span-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 404, 'width': 606, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Gastronomist Gets Real', 'kicker': 'Eat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Gastronomist Gets Real', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'El Bulli', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Spain', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Chefs', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restaurants', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'ADRIA, FERRAN', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-01T10:30:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Magazine', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mark Bittman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mark', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '