ms. They defeated Carla Arnolds, Bep Vriend, Laura Dekkers, Marion Michielsen, Jet Pasman and Anneke Simons from the Netherlands by 89 international match points to 51. The Dutch players have numerous world and European medals; I quickly lost count while trying to add them up. The best previous Turkish result had been fourth in the women’s teams for Babac and Yavas at the first World Mind Sports Games in 2008. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/01/arts/card1/card1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 341, 'width': 190, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Contract Advice for Declarer, Courtesy of the Overcall', 'kicker': 'Bridge', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Contract Advice for Declarer, Courtesy of the Overcall', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bridge (Card Game)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cards and Card Games', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-01T21:11:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Crosswords & Games', 'subsection_name': 'Bridge', 'byline': {'original': 'By Phillip Alder', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Phillip', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Alder', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/11a85031-f4e8-5b7c-8755-3d012a06bb6c', 'word_count': 433, 'uri': 'nyt://article/11a85031-f4e8-5b7c-8755-3d012a06bb6c'}, {'abstract': "PJ Joshi on the rebound in executive compensation, Stephanie Strom on the World Bank's plan to release data, and Damon Darlin on tech companies and urban renewal. Dan Niemi is the host.", 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/audio/2011/07/01/business/economy/01weekendbiz_pod.html', 'snipp