arted-away/', 'snippet': 'Turns out the missing Sing for Hope piano in the Bronx — thought to have been stolen — was thrown out by the Parks Department.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A suspect has been nabbed in the case of the great Bronx Piano Kidnapping. It’s the parks department, which pleads guilty, with an explanation. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Day the Music Was Carted Away', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Vandalism', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Parks and Recreation Department (NYC)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Sing for Hope', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Williamsbridge (Bronx, NYC)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-01T22:50:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Adriane Quinlan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Adriane', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Quinlan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3e71a6dc-1591-55b7-9efd-e4a66c01bd41', 'word_count': 202, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3e71a6dc-1591-55b7-9efd-e4a66c01bd41'}, {'abstract': 'With six more hits, Derek Jeter will become the player to reach 3,000 hits as a Yankee. Meanwhile, Fran Kowalski is hoping to get a hit soon, too. And it all has to do with Jeter.', 'web_url': 'https://bats.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/07/01/a-tribute-to-jeter-in-song/', 'snippet': 'With six more hits, Derek Jeter will become the player to reach 3,000 hits as a Yankee. Meanwhile, Fran Kowalski is hoping to get a hit soon, too. And it all has to do with Jeter.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With six more hits, Derek Jeter will become the first player to reach 3,000 hits as a Yankee.Meanwhi