ne, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-02T04:01:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ginia Bellafante', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ginia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bellafante', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c2d77811-a4f0-5820-8b4c-6f058cd56bad', 'word_count': 717, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c2d77811-a4f0-5820-8b4c-6f058cd56bad'}, {'abstract': 'Sergio Agüero scored on a stunning volley to give Argentina a 1-1 tie with Bolivia in the opening game of the Copa América.', 'web_url': 'https://goal.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/07/02/agueros-volley-saves-argentina-in-copa-america-opener/', 'snippet': 'Sergio Agüero scored on a stunning volley to give Argentina a 1-1 tie with Bolivia in the opening game of the Copa América.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One gets the feeling sometimes that Argentina could start five strikers and still manage to struggle to win big games. (Tip No. 1: stop putting the ball into your own net.)', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Agüero’s Volley Saves Argentina in Copa América Opener', 'kicker': 'Goal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-02T04:47:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Soccer', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Das', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Das', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f4eedfb0-884b-578a-bc9b-881ea2d13f50', 'word_count': 139, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f4eedfb0-884b-578a-bc9b-881ea2d13f50'}, {'abstract': 'Ivan Nova weaved in and out of trouble to secure his eighth win. What happens next for Nova and the rotation is up in the air.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/02/sports/baseball/victory-for-yankees-nova-but-spot-in-rotation-is-uncertain.html', 'snippet': 'Ivan Nova weaved in and out of trouble to secure his eighth win. What happens next for Nova and the rotation is up in the air.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Yankees Manager Joe Girardi said in the interview room Friday afternoon that starting pitcher Ivan Nova did not have anything to prove Friday night against the Mets. Shortly after, General Manager Brian Cashman said something similar, telling reporters that “Nova’s not pitching for anything tonight.”', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Victory for Nova, but Spot Is Not Sure', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Victory For Nova, But Spot Is Not Sure', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nova, Ivan', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-02T04:51:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sam Borden', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Borden', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/17038401-efcf-5de4-a10f-d94fddfff486', 'word_count': 711, 'uri': 'nyt://article/17038401-efcf-5de4-a10f-d94fddfff486'}, {'abstract': 'A five-year legal battle between the actress Celeste Holm, 94, and her sons has drained her trust and has left her 48-year-old husband bitter.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/03/nyregion/love-and-inheritance-celeste-holms-family-feud.html', 'snippet': 'A five-year legal battle between the actress Celeste Holm, 94, and her sons has drained her trust and has left her 48-year-old husband bitter.', 'lead_paragraph': 'IF you could script your life, how would it play out? Make movies, win an Academy Award, own an enormous apartment on Central Park West and then, in your declining years, marry someone half your age? ', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/03/nyregion/03HOLM_SPAN/03HOLM-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/03/nyregion/03HOLM_SPAN/03HOLM-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/03/nyregion/03HOLM_SPAN/03HOLM-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/03/nyregion/03HOLM_SPAN/03HOLM-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/03/nyregion/03HOLM_SPAN/03HOLM-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Love and Inheritance: A Family Feud', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Love and Inheritance: A Family Feud', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nelson, Theodor Holm', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Holm, Celeste', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'v