 to prevent him from persuing his political career in France.', 'lead_paragraph': 'July 2, 2011 - In Paris, the central political issue is whether the case in New York has damaged Dominique Strauss-Kahn enough to prevent him from persuing his political career in France.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/01/multimedia/video-tc-110701-parispolitics/video-tc-110701-parispolitics-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/01/multimedia/video-tc-110701-parispolitics/video-tc-110701-parispolitics-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/01/multimedia/video-tc-110701-parispolitics/video-tc-110701-parispolitics-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/01/multimedia/video-tc-110701-parispolitics/video-tc-110701-parispolitics-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'TimesCast | French Politics', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Strauss-Kahn, Dominique', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-02T16:04:13+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'ContinuousNews', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'Stefania Rousselle|Ben Solomon', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Stefania', 'middlename': 'Rousselle', 'lastname': 'Ben', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Video', '_id': 'nyt://video/e42a8c08-7fc7-5dbc-ae79-b7a747fffe50', 'word_count': 0, '