h “disturbing sea traffic and endangering passengers.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/03/world/europe/03athens.html', 'snippet': 'A judge contended that the boat, The Audacity of Hope, was not carrying proper safety equipment and charged the captain with “disturbing sea traffic and endangering passengers.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'ATHENS — The American captain of a United States-flagged boat in the planned flotilla to Gaza was jailed Saturday, a day after trying to sail out of port, flotilla organizers said.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Greece Jails U.S. Captain in Gaza Flotilla', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Greece Jails U.S. Captain In Gaza Effort', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Athens (Greece)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Palestinians', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Israel', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Gaza Strip', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-02T20:40:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Scott Sayare', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Scott', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sayare', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/20233e2d-6cca-54d9-b09b-475fafb54403', 'word_count': 309, 'uri': 'nyt://article/20233e2d-6cca-54d9-b09b-475fafb54403'}, {'abstract': 'Looking out a window in Mogadishu, Somalia.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/03/opinion/sunday/03Farah.html', 'snippet': 'Looking out a window in Mogadishu, Somalia.', 'lead_paragraph': 'OFTEN I live in one place but write about another place very much unlike it. I wrote my first novel as a student in India, and I wrote my latest while commuting among Newcastle in England, Minneapolis and Cape Town, where I reside. As befits a writer who lives more in the mind than in my physical surroundings, I base my work on memory, which I enrich with my knowledge of Somalia — where my novels are set — and supplement with my imagination. ', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/03/opinion/03windows950/03windows950-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 594, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/03/opinion/03windows950/03windows950-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/03/opinion/03windows950/03windows950-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The City in My Mind', 'kicker': 'Windows on the World', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The City in My Mind', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Writing and Writers', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Mogadishu (Somalia)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-02T20:45:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'subsection_name': 'Sunday Review', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nuruddin Farah and Matteo Pericoli', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nuruddin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Farah', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Matteo', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pericoli', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reporte