-hits.html', 'snippet': 'Derek Jeter’s arrival with Class AA Trenton meant that the Thunder’s meeting with the Altoona Curve on Saturday night took on a different dynamic from the standard Eastern League game.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TRENTON — The account of Derek Jeter’s pursuit of 3,000 hits would be incomplete if it did not include a footnote about Jeter’s two-night detour through this city for the most talked-about minor league rehabilitation appearance in the tristate area.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/03/sports/jeter-floater/jeter-floater-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/03/sports/jeter-floater/jeter-floater-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/03/sports/jeter-floater/jeter-floater-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/03/sports/jeter-floater/jeter-floater-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/03/sports/jeter-floater/jeter-floater-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'In a Journey to 3,000, a Side Trip to Trenton', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'On Journey to 3,000, A Side Trip to Trenton', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sports Injuries', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jeter, Derek'