ract': 'NASA is facing a brain drain that threatens to undermine safety as well as the agency’s future plans.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/04/science/space/04nasa.html', 'snippet': 'NASA is facing a brain drain that threatens to undermine safety as well as the agency’s future plans.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As NASA prepares to launch its last space shuttle — ending 30 years in which large teams of creative scientists and engineers sent winged spaceships into orbit — it is facing what may be a bigger challenge: a brain drain that threatens to undermine safety as well as the agency’s plans.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/04/us/04nasa2_337/04nasa2_337-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 332, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/04/us/04nasa2_337/04nasa2_337-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 332}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/04/us/04nasa2_337/04nasa2_337-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 642, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/04/us/04nasa2_337/04nasa2_337-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/04/us/04nasa2_337/04nasa2_337-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'With the Shuttle Program Ending, Fears of Decline at NASA', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Fears of Decline and Demoralization at NASA as the Shuttle Program Ends', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Space', 'rank': 1