t before they did, they rewarded a vocal crowd at Citi Field with the season’s most exciting installment of their crosstown rivalry.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/04/sports/04mets-2/04mets-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 365, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/04/sports/04mets-2/04mets-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 365}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/04/sports/04mets-2/04mets-2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 870, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/04/sports/04mets-2/04mets-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/04/sports/04mets-2/04mets-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'When All Seems Lost, Mets Rally to Win', 'kicker': 'Mets 3, Yankees 2 (10 Innings)', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'When All Seems Lost, Mets Rally to Win', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rivera, Mariano', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Mets', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bay, Jason', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-03T22:27:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Shpigel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shpigel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6164d822-570c-5e72-8b60-e363d1e87d17', 'word_count': 909, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6164d822-570c-5e72-8b60-e363d1e87d17'}, {'abstract': 'Piazza, a Web site for homework help, builds on classroom community by having peers and educators respond to questions.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/04/technology/04piazza.html', 'snippet': 'Piazza, a Web site for homework help, builds on classroom community by having peers and educators respond to questions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When Pooja Nath was an undergraduate at the Indian Institute of Technology Kanpur, an elite engineering school in India, she felt isolated. She was one of the few women on campus. While her male classmates collaborated on problem sets, Ms. Nath toiled in the computer lab alone.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/04/business/PIAZZA/PIAZZA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 658, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/04/business/PIAZZA/PIAZZA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/04/business/PIAZZA/PIAZZA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Homework Help Site Has a Social Networking Twist', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Homework Help Site Has a Social Networking Twist', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Homework', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Start-ups', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Social Networking (Internet)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Colleges and Universities', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-03T22:29:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Evelyn M. Rusli', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Evelyn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b0dfe70a-5faa-5143-8271-79817bb30ebf', 'word_count': 1014, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b0dfe70a-5faa-5143-8271-79817bb30ebf'}, {'abstract': 'An Exxon Mobil pipeline that spilled crude oil into the Yellowstone River had been temporarily shut down in May because of concerns over the river’s rising waters, the company said.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/04/us/04spill.html', 'snippet': 'An Exxon Mobil pipeline that spilled crude oil into the Yellowstone River had been temporarily shut down in May because of concerns over the river’s rising waters, the company said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'An Exxon Mobil pipeline that ruptured late Friday along the Yellowstone River in south-central Montana, spilling crude oil into the river and forcing evacuations, had been shut down for one day in May because of concerns over the rising waters on the Yellowstone, the company said Sunday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/04/us/04oil1_span/04oil1_span-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/04/us/04oil1_span/04oil1_span-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'cap