ermany and Turkey, said Sandra Ruch, a coordinator for the boat.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Greece Turns Back Canadian Ship Aiming for Gaza', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Greece Turns Back Canadian Ship Aiming for Gaza', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ships and Shipping', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Gaza Strip', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Embargoes and Economic Sanctions', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Greece', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-04T18:29:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Scott Sayare', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Scott', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sayare', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/76e6bec9-4f11-521e-b406-3e88f781d588', 'word_count': 216, 'uri': 'nyt://article/76e6bec9-4f11-521e-b406-3e88f781d588'}, {'abstract': 'Running for president is all about getting on the proverbial soap box. So when Mitt Romney comes to town, he brings one along.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/07/04/romney-has-his-own-traveling-soap-box/', 'snippet': 'Running for president is all about getting on the proverbial soap box. So when Mitt Romney comes to town, he brings one along.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ANDOVER, N.H. —\xa0 Running for president is all about getting on the proverbial soap box. So when Mitt Romney comes to town, he brings one along.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Romney Has His Own Traveling Soap Box', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name'