rst collection of haute couture promised and delivered everything his following of young European monied beauties desire.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/07/04/just-one-look-giambattista-valli-2/', 'snippet': 'Valli’s first collection of haute couture promised and delivered everything his following of young European monied beauties desire.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Giambattista Valli’s first collection of haute couture promised and delivered everything his following of young European monied beauties desire: dollops of feathers, pearls, embroideries, animal prints, flowers, ruffles, and bows. It all worked, even more so than Valli’s ready-to-wear, because for unapologetic prettiness he is unbeatable, especially in the simplest gestures — a draped silk cocktail dress in petal pink, or this coral gown and cape, which made its real-life debut last weekend in “Grace Kelly blue” on her grand-daughter Charlotte at Prince Albert’s wedding supper. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Just One Look | Giambattista Valli', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Paris Fashion Week', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Valli, Giambattista', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-04T19:35:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sally Singer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sally', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Singer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e7f8cd9e-a6d5-52ad-af5d-ed7704e0a9d5', 'word_count': 92, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e7f8cd9e-a6d5-52ad-af5d-ed7704e0a9d5'}, {'abstract': 'Scientists had only 70 days to search an old lake bed in Snowmass, Colo., for remnants of ancient animals, like mammoths, mastodons, supersize bison, camels and horses.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/05/science/05dig.html', 'snippet': 'Scientists had only 70 days to search an old lake bed in Snowmass, Colo., for remnants of ancient animals, like mammoths, mastodons, supersize bison, camels and horses.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SNOWMASS, Colo. — Two different time scales collided in this place. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/05/science/05dig_span/05dig_span-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/05/science/05dig_span/05dig_span-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/05/science/05dig_span/05dig_span-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Pleistocene Treasures, at a Breakneck Pace', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Pleistocene Treasures, at a Breakneck Pace', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ice Age', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Paleontology', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ANIMALS', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fossils', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Snowmass (Colo)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-04T19:41:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Science', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kirk Johnson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kirk', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Johnson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/25c0d32b-fee0-5e0a-997f-4d6233991496', 'word_count': 1491, 'uri': 'nyt://article/25c0d32b-fee0-5e0a-997f-4d6233991496'}, {'abstract': 'Baba Ly, 8, prepared to play the president on a float during the Independence Day parade in Ridgewood, N.J.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/07/04/ridgewood-n-j-940-a-m/', 'snippet': 'Baba Ly, 8, prepared to play the president on a float during the Independence Day parade in Ridgewood, N.J.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Baba Ly, 8, prepared to play the president during the Independence Day parade in Ridgewood, N.J., on a float from his school, Travell Elementary. He was assisted by his mother, Aisha Ly, who made sure his tie was straight and his shirt was tucked in.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Ridgewood, N.J., 9:40 a.m.', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Ridgewood (NJ)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-04T19:44:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c43339d9-4e4c-5025-8e6e-8b89a76ef0d6', 'word_count': 45, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c43339d9-4e4c-5025-8e6e-8b89a76ef0d6'}, {'abstract': 'An interactive timeline of the 135 space shuttle missions.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/science/space/0705-shuttle-30-years.html', 'snippet': 'An interactive timeline of the 135 space shuttle missions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'An interactive timeline of the 135 space shuttle missions.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '30 Years of the Space Shuttle', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'key