ed to political visitors, the excitement surrounding Michele Bachmann rivaled the attention paid to most candidates in recent years.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/05/us/politics/05bachmann.html', 'snippet': 'In Clear Lake, Iowa, a town used to political visitors, the excitement surrounding Michele Bachmann rivaled the attention paid to most candidates in recent years.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CLEAR LAKE, Iowa — Michele Bachmann was already zipping along Main Street at a fast clip, shaking hands, waving and blowing kisses into the air. When she noticed that her entourage had clogged up the parade route on Monday, she began running — in a skirt and heels — and outpaced everyone nearby.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/05/us/PARADEPIX-3/PARADEPIX-3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/05/us/PARADEPIX-3/PARADEPIX-3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/05/us/PARADEPIX-3/PARADEPIX-3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 662, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/05/us/PARADEPIX-3/PARADEPIX-3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/05/us/PARADEPIX-3/PARADEPIX-3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'On Main Street, Cheers for Bachmann', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'G.O.P. Hopefuls Join in Independence Day Revelry: On Main Street, Cheers for Bachmann', 'name': None, 'seo': N