lanned debate on Libya.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With Republicans protesting that the Senate should be concentrating on the debt limit standoff this week, Senator Harry Reid, the Nevada Democrat and majority leader, on Tuesday conceded the point and abruptly called off a planned debate on Libya.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Reid Shifts Senate Attention From Libya to Debt Limit', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'National Debt (US)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McConnell, Mitch', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Reid, Harry', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-05T20:45:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Carl Hulse', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Carl', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hulse', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/493ec144-f17f-58ae-9855-b638a2b8f71d', 'word_count': 413, 'uri': 'nyt://article/493ec144-f17f-58ae-9855-b638a2b8f71d'}, {'abstract': 'Traveling with a smartphone can be great, but can also cost a small fortune, thanks to data-roaming fees and the like. If what you need when on the road is a simple phone, consider these options.', 'web_url': 'https://gadgetwise.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/07/05/when-a-smartphone-is-too-much-for-travel/', 'snippet': 'Traveling with a smartphone can be great, but can also cost a small fortune, thanks to data-roaming fees and the like. If what you need when on the road is a simple phone, consider these options.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With the rise of the iPhone and the Blackberry, it’s hard to imagine hitting the road without a phone that can’t download music, serve up maps or send and receive e-mail. But sometimes a body just needs to make a few calls from the road. Sometimes a body needs a featureless phone.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'When a Smartphone Is Too Much for Travel', 'kicker': 'Gadgetwise', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cellular Telephones', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wireless Communications', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Nokia Oyj', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-05T20:46:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'subsection_name': 'Personal Tech', 'byline': {'original': 'By John Biggs', 'person': [{'firstname': 'John', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Biggs', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b4775126-319e-594c-a357-b1197cbf1a4b', 'word_count': 385, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b4775126-319e-594c-a357-b1197cbf1a4b'}, {'abstract': 'The English National Opera’s production of Britten’s “Midsummer Night’s Dream” expanded the work’s boundaries by jettisoning baggage.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/06/arts/music/english-national-opera-ends-season-with-midsummer-nights-dream.html', 'snippet': 'The English National Opera’s production of Britten’s “Midsummer Night’s Dream” expanded the work’s boundaries by jettisoning baggage.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — “In my life, why do I give valuable time to people who don’t care if I live or die?” That’s the refrain of “Heaven Knows I’m Miserable Now,” the 1984 Smiths song.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New Yo