the open-air market held Saturdays on the Williamsburg waterfront, is like a summer rock festival for food.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SMORGASBURG, the open-air market held every Saturday in an empty lot on the Williamsburg waterfront, is like a summer rock festival for food: exciting, overwhelming, sweaty, hot. You’ll hit your limit, and then you’ll want more.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/06/dining/06under_span/06under_span-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/06/dining/06under_span/06under_span-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/06/dining/06under_span/UNDER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 686, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/06/dining/06under_span/06under_span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/06/dining/06under_span/06under_span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Brooklyn Market: Woodstock of Eating', 'kicker': '$25 and Under', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Brooklyn Market: Woodstock Of Eating', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Williamsburg (NYC)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Brooklyn Flea', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Food', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Flea Markets', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-05T22:14:53+0000