ion were clouds, angels and birds of paradise, the latter reduced to a splattering of pearls on white tulle. Making all this fragile romance signature Tisci were the industrial sporty zippers connecting sleeves to bodices and snaking boldly up backs. Here, a nude dress encrusted exclusively with hand-cut nude tulle pailettes.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Just One Look | Givenchy', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-07-05T23:27:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sally Singer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sally', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Singer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f2f7d503-cee2-576f-889c-0107c5aa1982', 'word_count': 83, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f2f7d503-cee2-576f-889c-0107c5aa1982'}, {'abstract': 'Ben Sargent is the star of a new Cooking Channel series that shows him fishing for and cooking his catch.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/dining/100000000895575/urban-fisherman.html', 'snippet': 'Ben Sargent is the star of a new Cooking Channel series that shows him fishing for and cooking his catch.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ben Sargent is the star of a new Cooking Channel series that shows him fishing for and cooking his catch.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/05/dining/video-sargent-seafood/video-sargent-seafood-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/05/dining/video-sargent-seafood/video-sargent-seafood-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subt