tates national team.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Five players — none of them forwards — have scored goals for the United States national team through two games at the Women’s World Cup in Germany. None were as spectacular as the 25-yard frozen rope that exploded off Heather O’Reilly’s right foot in a 3-0 win against Colombia on Saturday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'O’Reilly ‘Let It Fly’ on Her Spectacular World Cup Goal', 'kicker': 'Goal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': "Women's World Cup (Soccer)", 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'World Cup (Soccer)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': "O'Reilly, Heather", 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-06T00:49:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Soccer', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jack Bell', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jack', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bell', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b1c44f68-a747-5a87-a389-af1f59227ced', 'word_count': 331, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b1c44f68-a747-5a87-a389-af1f59227ced'}, {'abstract': 'Efforts to promote iced coffee consumption at home are beginning to pick up.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/06/business/media/06adco.html', 'snippet': 'Efforts to promote iced coffee consumption at home are beginning to pick up.', 'lead_paragraph': 'IN 2010, Americans ordered 500 million iced coffee drinks in restaurants and cafes, up from 400 million in 2006, according to data from the market research firm NPD Group.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption