selves out of the market, but there’s a bigger danger.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If there is an aspect of running a small business that doesn’t get enough attention, I think it’s pricing. Unfortunately, there’s a good reason for that: pricing is hard to do and easy to ignore. But that’s especially dangerous right now when there’s a good chance your own expenses are changing.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Price of Bad Pricing', 'kicker': 'You&#039;re the Boss', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Customer Relations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prices (Fares, Fees and Rates)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Small Business', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-06T16:00:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Entrepreneurship', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jay Goltz', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jay', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Goltz', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ee47862e-6832-5e8a-bd68-102a16cba181', 'word_count': 1053, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ee47862e-6832-5e8a-bd68-102a16cba181'}, {'abstract': 'Anish Kapoor’s tower, Orbit, under construction at the site of the Olympic park in London, will be the tallest sculpture in Britain.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/07/06/high-above-london-one-can-see-for-miles-and-miles/', 'snippet': 'Anish Kapoor’s tower, Orbit, under construction at the site of the Olympic park in London, will be the tallest sculpture in Britain.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON – Close to the site of the new Olympic stadium here, another much taller landmark designed for next year’s Summer Games is growing into the sky: a giant cherry-red steel 