apher, documented New Yorkers peering into their phones in a photo series called “Texters.”', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/07/06/texters-the-photo-series/', 'snippet': 'Jospeh Holmes, a professional photographer, documented New Yorkers peering into their phones in a photo series called “Texters.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'We’ve all done it. On the street, at the beach, in a coffee shop. Pulling out our phones and texting, Tweeting or\xa0connecting\xa0to something other than the world around us.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Texters, the Photo Series', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-06T18:03:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nick Bilton', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bilton', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c562a115-812b-59ec-801d-a2a481b339c7', 'word_count': 194, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c562a115-812b-59ec-801d-a2a481b339c7'}, {'abstract': 'A view of the day in sports, with joy in South Korea and crashes in France.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2011/07/06/sports/20110706-photoreplay.html', 'snippet': 'A view of the day in sports, with joy in South Korea and crashes in France.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A view of the day in sports, with joy in South Korea and crashes in France.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/06/sports/20110706-photoreplay-slide-CN09/20110706-photoreplay-slide-CN09-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 743, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'le