iscontinued Mercury brand.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Michigan, a Venerable Lincoln Dealer Puts a Lock on the Door', 'kicker': 'Wheels', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Buick Division of General Motors Corp', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Cadillac Division of General Motors Corp', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Ford Motor Company', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Lincoln Division of Ford Motor Co', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Michigan', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-06T19:07:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'byline': {'original': 'By Paul Stenquist', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Paul', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stenquist', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/651077ee-7bb3-513a-947a-0f0fc5f3a14a', 'word_count': 374, 'uri': 'nyt://article/651077ee-7bb3-513a-947a-0f0fc5f3a14a'}, {'abstract': 'Unable to ferry their four-wheel-drive vehicle across a river, scientists studying native fish in Madagascar must make the journey by oxcart.', 'web_url': 'https://scientistatwork.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/07/06/to-lake-tseny-by-oxcart/', 'snippet': 'Unable to ferry their four-wheel-drive vehicle across a river, scientists studying native fish in Madagascar must make the journey by oxcart.', 'lead_paragraph': 'John S. Sparks, curator of ichthyology at the American Museum of Natural History, writes from Madagascar, where he is studying native freshwater fish.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'To Lake Tseny by