-74b2-53a3-a7ec-d7315d31ff9c'}, {'abstract': 'Elie Saab’s haute couture is essentially a red carpet preview — that is, for anyone who doesn’t live in a world where private clients attend balls in fully beaded gowns.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/07/06/just-one-look-elie-saab/', 'snippet': 'Elie Saab’s haute couture is essentially a red carpet preview — that is, for anyone who doesn’t live in a world where private clients attend balls in fully beaded gowns.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Elie Saab’s haute couture is essentially a red carpet preview — that is, for anyone who doesn’t live in a world where private clients attend balls in fully beaded gowns. There is no day here: Elie does evening and consistently beautifully. His best looks this season were more covered up than usual — less cleavage and gams, more sleeves and skirt–and featured some of the other trends of this couture season: pearl embroideries, 30’s silhouettes, and a cool palette of ivories, skin tones and dark inky blues and teals. Here, a lace stunner that shows a lot without exposing anything.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Just One Look | Elie Saab', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-07-06T21:39:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sally Singer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sally', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Singer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d8913822-2072-536f-bbd6-80dfa89f4b38', 'word_count': 105, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d8913822-2072-536f-bbd6-80dfa89f4b38'}, {'abstract': 'Neon-bright rubber accessories, including watches, jewelry and shoes, are appearing everywhere this summer.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/07/fashion/rubber-fashion-accessories-fine-points.html', 'snippet': 'Neon-bright rubber accessories, including watches, jewelry and shoes, are appearing everywhere this summer.', 'lead_paragraph': 'RUBBER crept up on us this summer. Neon-bright rubber accessories, as delectable as ice pops on a steamy day, turned up in fashion collections high and low, and without any of the drippy mess. ', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/07/fashion/Z-FINE-POINTS/Z-FINE-POINTS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 521, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/07/fashion/Z-FINE-POINTS/Z-FINE-POINTS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 521}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/07/fashion/Z-FINE-POINTS/Z-FINE-POINTS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 888, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/07/fashion/Z-FINE-POINTS/Z-FINE-POINTS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/07/fashion/Z-FINE-POINTS/Z-FINE-POINTS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'How High Can You Bounce?', 'kicker': 'Fine Points', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'How High Can You Bounce?', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shoes and Boots', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Rubber', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-06T21:40:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk'