 Sklar’s 1975 book “Movie-Made America: A History of American Movies” was one of the first histories to place Hollywood films in a social and political context.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/07/movies/robert-sklar-film-scholar-dies-at-74.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Sklar’s 1975 book “Movie-Made America: A History of American Movies” was one of the first histories to place Hollywood films in a social and political context.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Robert Sklar, a film scholar whose 1975 book “Movie-Made America” was one of the first histories to place Hollywood films in a social and political context, finding them a key to understanding how modern American values and beliefs have been shaped, died on Saturday in Barcelona. He was 74.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/07/arts/obit-sklar/obit-sklar-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 862, 'width': 597, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/07/arts/obit-sklar/obit-sklar-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/07/arts/obit-sklar/obit-sklar-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Robert Sklar, Film Scholar, Is Dead at 74', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Robert Sklar, 74, Historian Who Put Films in Context', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sklar, Robert', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-06T22:38:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'secti