 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/07/garden/east-hampton-antiques-show-this-weekend.html', 'snippet': 'The annual fund-raiser for the East Hampton Historical Society presents the varied wares of 55 dealers, both local and international.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This weekend marks the fifth year of the East Hampton Antiques Show, an annual fund-raiser for the East Hampton Historical Society. Held under tents at Mulford Farm, the show presents the varied wares of 55 dealers, both local and international.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/07/garden/07events/07events-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/07/garden/07events/07events-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/07/garden/07events/07events-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'East Hampton Antiques Show This Weekend', 'kicker': 'Currents | Events', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'History on Parade Under Tents', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ANTIQUES', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'East Hampton (NY)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-06T22:54:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Home', 'section_name': 'Home & Garden', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tim McKeough', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tim', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'McKeough', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6b8ddd12-b253-5a64-b559-4aa8873c4fcc', 'word_count': 147, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6b8ddd12-b253-5a64-b559-4aa8873c4fcc'}, {'abstract': 'An appraisal of earplugs, white-noise machines and other tools to muffle snoring and other noises.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/07/garden/noise-cancelling-devices-for-a-good-nights-sleep-home-tech.html', 'snippet': 'An appraisal of earplugs, white-noise machines and other tools to muffle snoring and other noises.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BEFORE my son was born last fall, I’d always been puzzled by the idea of “white noise.” Have you seen those CDs and expensive alarm clocks (usually sold in airline catalogs) that offer the sounds of nature: waves crashing, rain drizzling, and so on? The products claim that a flat, featureless, continuous sound somehow encourages slumber. The idea seemed bizarre to me: When I sleep, I want quiet, not noise — not even the pitter-patter of angels dancing in the clouds. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/07/garden/07hometech/07hometech-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 500, 'width': 315, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/07/garden/07hometech/07hometech-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/07/garden/07hometech/07hometech-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Noise-Canceling Devices for a Good Night’s Sleep', 'kicker': 'Home Tech', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'These Audio Devices Are All Hush-Hush', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Noise', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Snoring', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sleep', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Digital Audio Players', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ears and Hearing', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-06T22:54:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Home', 'section_name': 'Home & Garden', 'byline': {'original': 'By Farhad Manjoo', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Farhad', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Manjoo', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/796adfe8-7941-5e1d-8fcb-0e5ebedaa951', 'word_count': 1367, 'uri': 'nyt://article/796adfe8-7941-5e1d-8fcb-0e5ebedaa951'}, {'abstract': 'The latest addition to the Illy artist cup collection offers a glimpse of infinity to go with your espresso.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/07/garden/a-bottomless-cup-of-coffee-by-anish-kapoor.html', 'snippet': 'The latest addition to the Illy artist cup collection offers a glimpse of infinity to go with your espresso.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The latest addition to the Illy artist cup collection offers a glimpse of infinity to go with your espresso.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/07/garden/07goods/07goods-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 807, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/07/garden/07goods/07goods-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/07/garden/07goods/07goods-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Bottomless Cup of Coffee, by Anish Kapoor', 'kicker': 'Currents | Goods', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Bottomless Cup of Coffee, by Anish Kapoor', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tableware', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kapoor, Anish', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-06T22:54:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Home', 'section_name': 'Home & Garden', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tim McKeough', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tim', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'McKeough', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b4a579df-c8da-582a-b79c-82c17e75c36d', 'word_count': 141, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b4a579df-c8da-582a-b79c-82c17e75c36d'}, {'abstract': 'Discounts on pieces by Paola Lenti and Philippe Starck, accessories, antiques and more.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/07/garden/sales-at-kartell-karkula-and-others.html', 'snippet': 'Discounts on pieces by Paola Lenti and Philippe Starck, accessories, antiques and more.', 'lead_paragraph': 'All Kartell products will be 15 percent off from Monday to July 16 at the company’s New York store (the Masters chair, originally $244, will be about $207; the Louis Ghost chair, originally $410, will be about $350; and the Panier table, originally $314, will be about $267); 39 Greene Street (Broome Street); (212) 966-6665 or kartell.com.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/07/garden/07deals-span/07deals-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 358, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/07/garden/07deals-span/07deals-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 358}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': No