tte-bacon-lessons-from-a-year-in-bali.html', 'snippet': 'A writer on the bamboo house in Indonesia that she and her family briefly called home.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THE jungle noise was especially shrill at night. With the geckos, the owls and the insects, the din could sound as if all of them had studied under Philip Glass, then flown off to Bali for a long collaboration. And, even far past sunset, it stayed hot. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/07/garden/07domestic1/Domestic-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 765, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/07/garden/07domestic1/07domestic1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/07/garden/07domestic1/07domestic1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Lessons From a Year in Bali', 'kicker': 'Domestic Lives', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Lessons of a Grass House', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Families and Family Life', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Bali (Indonesia)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-06T22:54:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Home', 'section_name': 'Home & Garden', 'byline': {'original': 'By Charlotte Bacon', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Charlotte', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bacon', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f399a5c0-dc5b-52f6-8cd2-d84cb86d83ef', 'word_count': 1417, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f399a5c0-dc5b-5