ghills, who has devoted much of his life to creating stone walls, on building without mortar.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/07/garden/andrew-pighills-master-of-the-stone-wall-qa.html', 'snippet': 'Andrew Pighills, who has devoted much of his life to creating stone walls, on building without mortar.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Andrew Pighills has devoted much of his life to stone walls. He began building them as a boy, on his father’s farm in the Yorkshire Dales, in north England. Now, at 56, he is the North American representative of the Dry Stone Walling Association of Great Britain, a group dedicated to the art and preservation of dry laid stone.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/07/garden/07qa-span/07qa-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 361, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/07/garden/07qa-span/07qa-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 361}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/07/garden/07qa-span/QA-2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/07/garden/07qa-span/07qa-span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/07/garden/07qa-span/07qa-span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Master of the Stone Wall Discusses the Perfect Fit', 'kicker': 'Currents | Q&A', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Master of the Stone Wall Discusses the Perfect Fit', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject