', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/07/nyregion/one-killed-one-injured-in-east-harlem-shooting.html', 'snippet': 'Laquan Parks, 28, was pronounced dead at the scene, and the other victim, 29, is in stable condition, the police said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A gunman on a bicycle shot two men Wednesday afternoon on a sidewalk in East Harlem, killing one of them, the police said.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'One Dead and One Hurt in East Harlem Shooting', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'One Dead and One Hurt in East Harlem Shooting', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'East Harlem (NYC)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-07T01:49:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/30592432-fec0-5539-aca9-62905b6bc8e1', 'word_count': 149, 'uri': 'nyt://article/30592432-fec0-5539-aca9-62905b6bc8e1'}, {'abstract': 'In just six months in office, Gov. Andrew M. Cuomo has had several major legislative victories, thanks to his ability to work a system that stymied his predecessors.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/07/nyregion/cuomo-triumphs-by-courting-the-capitol-he-ran-against.html', 'snippet': 'In just six months in office, Gov. Andrew M. Cuomo has had several major legislative victories, thanks to his ability to work a system that stymied his predecessors.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A Legislature plagued by corruption. A tradition of secrecy. A phalanx of special interests. Andrew M. Cuomo arrived in Albany confronted by the same obstacles that had stymied his predecessors.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page':