 bills for New York City residents, according to a report commissioned by the city that is circulating among state officials in Albany.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/07/nyregion/INDIAN/INDIAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/07/nyregion/INDIAN/INDIAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/07/nyregion/INDIAN/INDIAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 656, 'width': 984, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/07/nyregion/INDIAN/INDIAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/07/nyregion/INDIAN/INDIAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Dirtier Air and Higher Costs Possible if Indian Point Closes, Report Says', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Dirtier Air and Higher Costs Possible if Indian Point Closes, Report Says', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Environment', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bloomberg, Michael R', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cuomo, Andrew M', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shutdowns (Institutional)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Indian Point Nuclear Power Plant (NY)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-07T02:04:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': 