A study by some of the country’s top health economists aims to estimate the effects of not having health insurance — and the effects are large.', 'web_url': 'https://economix.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/07/07/how-health-insurance-affects-health/', 'snippet': 'A study by some of the country’s top health economists aims to estimate the effects of not having health insurance — and the effects are large.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the nearly year and a half since Congress passed the health care overhaul, one of the main purposes of the bill — to provide health insurance to people who lack it — has often been lost in the debate. Instead, supporters and opponents of the bill have argued over whether the bill is constitutional, and they’ve argued over whether the bill will cut medical costs more or less than the Congressional Budget Office projects.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'How Health Insurance Affects Health', 'kicker': 'Economix', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Health Insurance and Managed Care', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicine and Health', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Preventive Medicine', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-07T04:01:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Economy', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Leonhardt', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Leonhardt', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e8251839-e5a5-502a-a7bd-544a78adc756', 'word_count': 895, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e8251839-e5a5-502a-a7bd-544a78adc756'}, {'abstract': 'At Vermilion, a 200-seat, $4.5 million Indian and Latin fusion restaurant at Lexington Avenue and 46th Street, will have to do swift business to stay open during a chilly economic season.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2009/01/19/nyregion/2008012VERMILLION_index.html', 'snippet': 'At Vermilion, a 200-seat, $4.5 million Indian and Latin fusion restaurant at Lexington Avenue and 46th Street, will have to do swift business to stay open during a chilly economic season.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At Vermilion, a 200-seat, $4.5 million Indian and Latin fusion restaurant at Lexington Avenue and 46th Street, will have to do swift business to stay open during a chilly economic season.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2009/01/19/nyregion/2008012VERMILLION-S.JPG', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2009/01/19/nyregion/2008012VERMILLION-S.JPG', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'At Vermilion, in a Recession', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restaurants', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Recession and Depression', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-07T04:01:55+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'New York', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Slideshow', '_id': 'nyt://slideshow/6aab470a-a34a-5e41-a130-7b81aa2e07b8', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://slideshow/6aab470a-a34a-5e41-a130-7b81aa2e07b8'}, {'abstract': 'This word has appeared in seven New York Times articles in the past year.', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/07/07/word-of-the-day-clime/', 'snippet': 'This word has appeared in seven New York Times articles in