 Americans.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/07/07/white-house-paints-doomsday-default-scenario/', 'snippet': 'The Obama administration is aggressively pushing the message that failure to raise the nation’s debt ceiling would have disastrous consequences for average Americans.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As the high-wire negotiations with the Congressional leadership resume Thursday over raising the nation’s debt ceiling, one message from President Obama and his top aides has remained consistent: The consequences of default would be very, very scary.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'White House Paints Doomsday Default Scenario', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'National Debt (US)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Boehner, John A', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Carney, Jay', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Geithner, Timothy F', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Palin, Sarah', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Reagan, Ronald Wilson', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Treasury Department', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-07T11:36:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael D. Shear', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'orga