/green.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/07/07/blue-marlin-and-tuna-at-grave-risk-group-warns/', 'snippet': 'Overfishing puts species at risk of collapse, an organization reports. Both marlins and tuna species take longer to mature than short-lived species and recover more slowly from population declines.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Some of the mightiest fish in the sea, including the blue marlin and five of the eight species of tuna, are facing serious threats, the International Union for Conservation of Nature warned on Thursday. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Blue Marlin and Tuna at Grave Risk, Group Warns', 'kicker': 'Green', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Endangered and Extinct Species', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fish and Other Marine Life', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fishing, Commercial', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fishing, Sport', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tuna', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-07T20:57:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Science', 'subsection_name': 'Environment', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Jolly', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Jolly', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5e39cc46-1a13-5d3c-b875-203656b7bed9', 'word_count': 598, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5e39cc46-1a13-5d3c-b875-203656b7bed9'}, {'abstract': 'Another day of runway looks, another Scorecard at your service.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/07/07/scorecard-valentino-wins/', 'snippet': 'Another day of runway looks, another Scorecard at your service.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Wednesday, as the sylphs of the front row prepared for Valentino Garavani and Natalia Vodianova’s climactic White Fairy Tale Love Ball, couture fashion week sang its swan song. Scorecard knows the day’s four acts offered more than the usual metaphor for the dichotomy of human desires through the formalized tensions of dance — but in the final reckoning, Maria Grazia Chiuri and Pier Paolo Piccioli’s ethereal creations at Valentino might just have edged Jean Paul Gaultier’s cygnes noirs out.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Scorecard | Valentino Wins!', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-07-07T21:00:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alison S. Cohn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alison', 'middlename': 'S.', 'lastname': 'Cohn', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/896a1afc-b0b5-5b13-8821-75f7db3c67d7', 'word_count': 955, 'uri': 'nyt://article/896a1afc-b0b5-5b13-8821-75f7db3c67d7'}, {'abstract': 'During a guided tour/conceptual walk, people are encouraged to cast interesting, intersecting shadows across the streetscape.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/07/07/at-sundown-a-chance-for-a-long-lingering-look-at-coney-island/', 'snippet': 'During a guided tour/conceptual walk, people are encouraged to cast interesting, intersecting shadows across the streetscape.', 'lead_paragraph': '@import url("http://graphics8.nytimes.com/packages/css/multimedia/bundles/SlidingGallery.css");', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'At Sundown, a Chance for a Long, Lingering Look at Coney Island', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'gloca