n she knew her own mind and her need for freedom, a desire that has been the hallmark of a career that has encompassed a 17-year stint as “principal guest artist” at the Royal Ballet in Britain and collaborations with artists of all kinds.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/08/arts/GUILLEM-span/GUILLEM-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/08/arts/GUILLEM-span/GUILLEM-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/08/arts/GUILLEM-span/GUILLEM-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/08/arts/GUILLEM-span/GUILLEM-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/08/arts/GUILLEM-span/GUILLEM-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Collaborations Bring Cascades of Motion and Emotion', 'kicker': 'Dance Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Collaborations Bring Cascades of Motion and Emotion', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kylian, Jiri', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Guillem, Sylvie', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Sadler's Wells", 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ek, Mats', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Khan, Akram', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dancing', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 