spicion and condemnation came from all directions on Thursday, following the News Corporation’s decision to shut down the British tabloid The News of the World.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/08/world/europe/08newscorp.html', 'snippet': 'An outpouring of suspicion and condemnation came from all directions on Thursday, following the News Corporation’s decision to shut down the British tabloid The News of the World.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The News Corporation’s decision to shut down the British tabloid The News of the World on Thursday did little to silence the growing uproar over revelations that the newspaper had hacked into the voice mails of private citizens.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/08/world/europe/sub-08newscorp/sub-08newscorp-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/08/world/europe/sub-08newscorp/sub-08newscorp-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/08/world/europe/sub-08newscorp/sub-08newscorp-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 646, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/08/world/europe/sub-08newscorp/sub-08newscorp-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/08/world/europe/sub-08newscorp/sub-08newscorp-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Move to Close Newspaper Is Greeted With Suspicion', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Move to Close Newspaper Is Greeted With