 such a fascinating, wide-ranging, eclectic array of stuff. While you’re trying to solve, some of the entries might seem impossible to get, yet when you do get them, you always feel like you should have known those factoids in the first place.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Friday: Plus or Minus', 'kicker': 'Wordplay', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Crossword Puzzles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-08T02:00:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Crosswords & Games', 'byline': {'original': 'By Deb Amlen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Deb', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Amlen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/efabdc55-b08b-53c1-8454-4da1cee2c85d', 'word_count': 493, 'uri': 'nyt://article/efabdc55-b08b-53c1-8454-4da1cee2c85d'}, {'abstract': 'Tyne Daly plays a juiced-up composite of 20th-century divas for her turn as Maria Callas, the character at the center of “Master Class,” a play about the twilight of a goddess of bel canto.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/08/theater/reviews/master-class-with-tyne-daly-at-the-friedman-review.html', 'snippet': 'Tyne Daly plays a juiced-up composite of 20th-century divas for her turn as Maria Callas, the character at the center of “Master Class,” a play about the twilight of a goddess of bel canto.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Towering before us — and tower she does, though she is not particularly tall — the celebrated opera singer is undeniably, overwhelmingly there. And yet she’s not there at all. One of the most daunting presences you’re ever likely to come across is, on some profound level, absent. Which makes it all the more impossible for you to take your eyes off her.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/08/arts/MASTER-1/MASTER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/08/arts/MASTER-1/MASTER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/08/arts/MASTER-1/MASTER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 961, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/08/arts/MASTER-1/MASTER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/08/arts/MASTER-1/MASTER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Enough About You; Let’s Revisit My Glory Days', 'kicker': "Theater Review | 'Master Class'", 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Enough About You; Let’s Revisit My Glory Days', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Manhattan Theater Club', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McNally, Terrence', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Daly, Tyne', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-08T02:02:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Theater', 'subsection_name': 'Theater Reviews', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Brantley', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Brantley', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/203c6614-fc40-56ad-97a1-28659c8f21b8', 'word_count': 1315, 'uri': 'nyt://article/203c6614-fc40-56ad-97a1-28659c8f21b8'}, {'abstract': 'Conditions in the Texas colonias along the Mexican border have improved in recent years, but they remain far below the standards for good health.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/08/us/08ttconditions.html', 'snippet': 'Conditions in the Texas colonias along the Mexican border have improved in recent years, but they remain far below the standards for good health.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HARLINGEN —\xa0Ask many of the officials charged with improving conditions in Texas’ colonias about their progress and you will receive a string of pre-packaged responses: how generous state and federal budget writers have been, how wisely money has been spent, and how cooperatively they have worked together to aid the more than 2,300 impoverished villages on this side of the Mexican border. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19A', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/08/us/08TTCONDITIONS1/08TTCONDITIONS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/08/us/08TTCONDITIONS1/08TTCONDITIONS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/08/us/08TTCONDITIONS1/08TTCONDITIONS1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 580, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/08/us/08TTCONDITIONS1/08TTCONDITIONS1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/08/us/08TTCONDITIONS1/08TTCONDITIONS1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 7