4, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c308c6a1-4d5c-55b8-83ac-68a9040e985a'}, {'abstract': 'The Texas Legislature made quick work of redistricting, but the fight has just begun, as more than a dozen suits have already been filed in various courts.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/08/us/08ttramsey.html', 'snippet': 'The Texas Legislature made quick work of redistricting, but the fight has just begun, as more than a dozen suits have already been filed in various courts.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In a sort of legislative miracle, Texas lawmakers actually finished their redistricting work this year, drawing new political maps for Congress, the Texas House and Senate, and for the State Board of Education. But the fight is just starting, and could last beyond next year’s elections.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19A', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Redistricting Was Done, but Certainty Is Lacking', 'kicker': 'The Texas Tribune', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Redistricting Was Done, But Certainty Is Lacking', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Redistricting and Reapportionment', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'State Legislatures', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Texas', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-08T02:13:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ross Ramsey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ross', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ramsey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/89478204-7c89-57f3-bac6-4f9feb9f3a95', 'word_count': 652, 'uri': 'nyt://article/89478204-7c89-57f3-bac6-4f9feb9f3a95'}, {'abstract': 'Mariano Rivera, who had missed the previous three games with soreness in his right triceps, said he was abl