eter moved within two hits of 3,000 for his career, but the Yankees were feeble on offense and Bartolo Colon struggled through one of his worst starts of the season.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Hours before Thursday night’s game against Tampa Bay, Derek Jeter shared a quiet moment with Dick Groch, the scout who convinced the Yankees to draft him in 1992. Groch is in New York as a guest of General Manager Brian Cashman, and he told Jeter that he would not mind staying the weekend. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/08/sports/YANKEESwebfloater/YANKEESwebfloater-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 410, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/08/sports/YANKEESwebfloater/YANKEESwebfloater-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 410}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/08/sports/YANKEESwebfloater/YANKEESwebfloater-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 710, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/08/sports/YANKEESwebfloater/YANKEESwebfloater-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/08/sports/YANKEESwebfloater/YANKEESwebfloater-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Jeter Moves a Hit Closer as the Yanks Fall Again', 'kicker': 'Rays 5, Yankees 1', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Jeter Moves a Hit Closer As the Yanks Fall Again', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Tampa Bay Rays', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York