ty plays at third base, the Rays’ Sean Rodriguez helped keep Derek Jeter two hits away from 3,000.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Derek Jeter faked a bunt on the first pitch of his at-bat in the fifth inning Thursday against the Tampa Bay Rays. Sean Rodriguez, the Rays’ third baseman, was playing back, well off the line, and he stayed there as Jeff Niemann prepared to deliver the next pitch.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Sean Rodriguez: The New Ken Keltner', 'kicker': 'Bats', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jeter, Derek', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Tampa Bay Rays', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-08T03:13:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tyler Kepner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tyler', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kepner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e9661869-2844-556b-9f7f-c598d5dfaed5', 'word_count': 470, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e9661869-2844-556b-9f7f-c598d5dfaed5'}, {'abstract': 'Rejection makes the heart more likely to seek advice from trusted friends in “Zookeeper,” a movie about relationships of the platonic and romantic kind.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/08/movies/zookeeper-with-kevin-james-review.html', 'snippet': 'Rejection makes the heart more likely to seek advice from trusted friends in “Zookeeper,” a movie about relationships of the platonic and romantic kind.', 'lead_paragraph': 'He ain’t Doctor Dolittle, but he talks to the animals, and that’s because they talk to him. He i