as arrested on Friday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/09/world/europe/09britain.html', 'snippet': 'Andy Coulson, a former editor of The News of the World and a former aide to Prime Minister David Cameron, was arrested on Friday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — The phone hacking scandal that has enmeshed the Murdoch media empire, British politicians and the police accelerated Friday with the arrest of a former aide to Prime Minister David Cameron and new accusations of obstruction of justice against executives of News International, the parent of the disgraced News of the World newspaper.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/09/world/09britain_337/09britain_337-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/09/world/09britain_337/09britain_337-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/09/world/09britain_337/09britain_337-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 691, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/09/world/09britain_337/09britain_337-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/09/world/09britain_337/09britain_337-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Former Aide to Cameron Is Arrested in Tabloid Scandal', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Pressure Mounts on British Premier as Ex-Aide Is Held in Tabloid Inquiry', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 