comes to songs of love and loss, older is better. In Sarah Julia Silverman’s case, 500 years old is ideal.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/10/fashion/weddings/VOWS1/VOWS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/10/fashion/weddings/VOWS1/VOWS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/10/fashion/weddings/VOWS1/VOWS1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/10/fashion/weddings/VOWS1/VOWS1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/10/fashion/weddings/VOWS1/VOWS1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Sarah Silverman and Jeffrey Blaugrund', 'kicker': 'Vows', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Sarah Silverman and Jeffrey Blaugrund', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weddings and Engagements', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-08T18:31:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Society', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'subsection_name': 'Weddings', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sandee Brawarsky', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sandee', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Brawarsky', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6d07d68e-2d24-5bd6-b531-b5948adea10d', 'word_count': 1262, 'uri': 'nyt:/