e', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bruce Feiler', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bruce', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Feiler', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/153e556a-758b-5e7c-9574-05c844cb971a', 'word_count': 1300, 'uri': 'nyt://article/153e556a-758b-5e7c-9574-05c844cb971a'}, {'abstract': 'The jewelry designer keeps things light at the Chanel couture show.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/07/08/look-of-the-moment-gaia-repossi/', 'snippet': 'The jewelry designer keeps things light at the Chanel couture show.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Look: Perfect balance — a tailored jacket and jeans complemented by an effortless approach to hair and makeup.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Look of The Moment | Gaia Repossi', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-07-08T19:15:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Edward Barsamian', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Edward', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barsamian', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/28866da8-e0bd-5246-82ea-065c564ce1e7', 'word_count': 55, 'uri': 'nyt://article/28866da8-e0bd-5246-82ea-065c564ce1e7'}, {'abstract': 'In the midst of the roiling sea of opinion, one commentary that I thought deserved more attention than it got was this one, by Michael J. Petrilli, an education analyst and researcher with the Thomas B. Fordham institute.', 'web_url': 'https://6thfloor.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/07/08/education-reforms-two-month-warning/', 'snippet': 'In the midst of the roiling sea of opinion, one commentary that I thought deserved more attention than it got was this one, by Michael J. Petrilli, an education analyst and researcher with the Thomas B. Fordham institute.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In writing my essay on education reform that appears in this weekend’s magazine, I parachuted myself into an already crowded (and fairly angry) field of pundits reacting to Diane Ravitch’s June 1 Op-Ed column in The Times. In the essay, I mentioned Jonathan Alter’s response and Tim King’s. There was also this retort from David Brooks and a reply to Brooks from the journalist John Merrow.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Education Reform’s Two-Month Warning', 'kicker': 'The 6th Floor', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Education (K-12)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Reform and Reorganization', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Merrow, John', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ravitch, Diane', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rothstein, Richard', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Knowledge Is Power Program', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-08T19:26:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Paul Tough', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Paul', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Tough', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/aca59b59-4928-506f-80ce-1e27f90b7483', 'word_count': 967, 'uri': 'nyt://article/aca59b59-4928-506f-80ce-1e27f90b7483'}, {'abstract': 'The M.L.S. transfer window opens July 15, but do not expect the Red Bulls to contemplate selling tw