s a summer playlist curated by Sean Hanratty. This week’s list comes from the founder of True Panther Sounds, an imprint of Matador Records.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Dean Bein, the founder of True Panther Sounds (home to indie artists like\xa0Girls, Delorean, Glasser and the king of Sierra Leone’s bubu music, Janka Nabay), offers the second installment of Sean Hanratty’s summer playlist. “I chose Dean for his earnest passion for music,” says Hanratty of the 28-year-old label head who attends roughly 300 shows each year. “His taste in music is pretty impeccable.” If you like what you hear, check out the second year of MoMA PS1 Warm Up 2011, which runs every Saturday through Sept. 3. Bein, along with many other record heads, is one of its curators.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Jam | Dean Bein', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-07-08T21:35:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kathryn Branch', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kathryn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Branch', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1f2034f5-d968-5890-93ff-f733be1415e2', 'word_count': 125, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1f2034f5-d968-5890-93ff-f733be1415e2'}, {'abstract': 'A recipe for Crème Fraîche Cheesecake With Sour Cherries.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/13/dining/creme-fraiche-cheesecake-with-sour-cherries-recipe.html', 'snippet': 'A recipe for Crème Fraîche Cheesecake With Sour Cherries.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Time: 11/2 hours, plus cooling', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/13/