tially going miles out of their way, or brave the narrow, crowded transverse roads. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/09/nyregion/jp-PATHS/jp-PATHS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/09/nyregion/jp-PATHS/jp-PATHS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/09/nyregion/jp-PATHS/jp-PATHS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/09/nyregion/jp-PATHS/jp-PATHS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/09/nyregion/jp-PATHS/jp-PATHS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Central Park Cyclists Get Wish to Share Shortcut. But Slowly.', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Central Park Cyclists Get Wish To Share Shortcut. But Slowly.', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Parks and Recreation Department (NYC)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Central Park Conservancy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'CENTRAL PARK (NYC)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bicycles and Bicycling', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-09T01:07:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Joseph Berger', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joseph', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Berg