nd News International, its top executive, Rebekah Brooks, rebuffed numerous calls for her to resign on Friday, raising questions about the strategy of its parent company, the News Corporation, in defending itself against a barrage of police inquiries and lawsuits stemming from phone hacking at one of its British tabloid newspapers.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/09/world/europe/09newscorp/09newscorp-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 682, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/09/world/europe/09newscorp/09newscorp-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/09/world/europe/09newscorp/09newscorp-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Murdoch Loyalist Hangs On, Raising Questions About a Corporate Strategy', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Murdoch Loyalist Hangs On, Raising Questions About a Corporate Strategy', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Newspapers', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'News of the World', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Coulson, Andy', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brooks, Rebekah', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'News International Ltd', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Murdoch, James R', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Murdoch, Rupert', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wiretapping and Other Eavesdropping Devices and Methods', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name