'snippet': 'A confrontation with Officer Ernest M. Rodrigz that began with children playing around an open fire hydrant has led to a man’s arrest on assault charges.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As temperatures hovered in the 80s on Wednesday, a group of children frolicked in the spray of an open fire hydrant in the Bronx. Then someone among them hurled a cup of water or a water-filled balloon at a passing car, the authorities said, setting off a chain of events that left a New York City police officer in critical condition two days later.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Officer in Critical Condition After Punch in Bronx Street Encounter', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Officer in Critical Condition After Punch in Bronx Street Encounter', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Assaults', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Bronx (NYC)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Police Department (NYC)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-09T03:01:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Al Baker', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Al', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Baker', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4a9ddb80-ef05-5aaf-b164-3cc26992f3da', 'word_count': 673, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4a9ddb80-ef05-5aaf-b164-3cc26992f3da'}, {'abstract': 'The 9/11 Memorial in Lower Manhattan will start taking reservations online on Monday morning in preparation for its opening to the public on Sept. 12.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/09/nyregion/911-memorial-reservations-to-be-offered-on-web-site.html', 'snippet': 'The 9/11 Memorial in Lower Manhattan will start taking reserva