he beginning of a cascade into oblivion.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/09/sports/baseball/09metspic/09metspic-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/09/sports/baseball/09metspic/09metspic-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/09/sports/baseball/09metspic/09metspic-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 713, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/09/sports/baseball/09metspic/09metspic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/09/sports/baseball/09metspic/09metspic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Mets Beat Giants with Three Runs in Ninth', 'kicker': 'Mets 5, Giants 2 ', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Mets Beat Giants with Three Runs in Ninth', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Mets', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wilson, Brian', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'San Francisco Giants', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hairston, Scott', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-09T05:42:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Waldstein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Waldstein', 'qu