s April 2001, and I had gone to Oakland Coliseum to see what the big deal was with the new Seattle Mariners outfielder Ichiro Suzuki. ', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/10/sports/subICHIRO/subICHIRO-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 913, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'With Suzuki, There’s Less Than Meets the Eye', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'With Suzuki, There’s Less Than Meets the Eye', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Suzuki, Ichiro', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Seattle Mariners', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-09T15:43:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Benjamin Hoffman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Benjamin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hoffman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Web Log', '_id': 'nyt://article/84912f20-ab74-5306-8642-02983cbcf752', 'word_count': 1083, 'uri': 'nyt://article/84912f20-ab74-5306-8642-02983cbcf752'}, {'abstract': 'Yankees third baseman Alex Rodriguez, who has a torn meniscus in his right knee, will not play in two games this weekend or in Tuesday’s All-Star Game.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/10/sports/baseball/yankees-face-dilemma-on-alex-rodriguez-injury.html', 'snippet': 'Yankees third baseman Alex Rodriguez, who has a torn meniscus in his right knee, will not play in two games this weekend or in Tuesday’s All-Star Game.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Even as a diminished version of himself for the last few weeks, Alex Rodriguez has still gotten hits, reached base and played strong defense at third base. But Rodriguez is paid for his all-around game, including speed and prodigious power. Without those, he is not the same.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Rodriguez Must Decide: Surgery Now or Later', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Rodriguez Must Decide: Surgery Now or Later', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rodriguez, Alex', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sports Injuries', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-09T15:52:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tyler Kepner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tyler', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kepner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7fef2acb-f3d1-5419-a1cd-46d56e9aa6eb', 'word_count': 493, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7fef2acb-f3d1-5419-a1cd-46d56e9aa6eb'}, {'abstract': 'Although the markets ended the second quarter about where they started it, mutual fund investors endured many a zigzag along the way.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/10/business/mutfund/for-mutual-funds-another-volatile-quarter.html', 'snippet': 'Although the markets ended the second quarter about where they started it, mutual fund investors endured many a zigzag along the way.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MARKETS continued to zigzag in the second quarter as investors sought risk, then shunned it, then sought it again — depending on whether they were unnerved by economic and political developments or hopeful for benign resolutions to them. Ultimately, not much was resolved, but there may have been more sleep lost than money, as stocks were little changed and bonds recorded modest gains.', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/10/business/10mf-LEDE/10mf-LEDE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 838, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/10/business/10mf-LEDE/10mf-LEDE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/10/business/10mf-LEDE/10mf-LEDE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Severe Case of Portfolio Whiplash', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Severe Case of Portfolio Whiplash', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mutual Funds', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Credit and Debt', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stocks and Bonds', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Economic Conditions and Trends', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-09T15:52:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'SundayBusiness', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Mutual Funds', 'byline': {'original': 'By Conrad De Aenlle', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Conrad', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'De Aenlle', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6d824f95-5af2-5db9-b9f4-955b9fe48ddf', 'word_count': 1294, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6d824f95-5af2-5db9-b9f4-955b9fe48ddf'},