gh decisions and compromises — both for Greece and the European Union.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/10/business/economy/greeces-choices-in-debt-crisis-are-all-daunting-economic-view.html', 'snippet': 'Solving the Greek debt crisis will require extremely tough decisions and compromises — both for Greece and the European Union.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WITHOUT outside help, Greece is probably insolvent right now. In evaluating the country’s prospects, it’s worth asking what it would take for Greece to pay all of its bills and what kind of damage we might expect along the way. ', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Choices for Greece, All of Them Daunting', 'kicker': 'Economic View', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Choices for Greece, All of Them Daunting', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Credit and Debt', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Euro (Currency)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Economic Conditions and Trends', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Union', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Central Bank', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'European Sovereign Debt Crisis (2010- )', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Greece', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-09T17:27:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'SundayBusiness', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Economy', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tyler Cowen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tyler', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cowen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/72d1a408-f08b-5ac9-a825-b5472844356e', 'word_count': 1074, 'uri': 'nyt://article/72d1a408-f08b-5ac9-a825-b5472844356e'}, {'abstract': 'Lead generation companies are crushing some local merchants in search results, presenting a real challenge for Google.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/10/your-money/lead-gen-sites-pose-challenge-to-google-the-haggler.html', 'snippet': 'Lead generation companies are crushing some local merchants in search results, presenting a real challenge for Google.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BOB STROM is the owner of Ballard Lock & Key, which provides locksmith services in Seattle. If you live in the area and find yourself locked out of your car or home, here is an essential piece of information about Mr. Strom’s company: it really exists.', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/10/business/10sbn-HAGGLER-SUB/10sbn-HAGGLER-SUB-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 265, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/10/business/10sbn-HAGGLER-SUB/10sbn-HAGGLER-SUB-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 265}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/10/business/10sbn-HAGGLER-SUB/10sbn-HAGGLER-SUB-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 452, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Picking the Lock of Google’s Search', 'kicker': 'The Haggler', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Picking the Lock Of Google’s Search', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Search Engines', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Customer Relations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Google Inc', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Locks and Keys', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Comp