strial city. My father, a carpenter, had an accident at work, severing the top of two fingers. With the settlement he received, he bought a grocery store that sold beer and wine, and when I was 10, I helped in the shop after school. Before that I delivered newspapers. I always had money as a kid, but never enough time to spend it.', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/10/business/10sbn-BOSS/10sbn-BOSS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 790, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Energy at an Early Age', 'kicker': 'The Boss', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Energy at an Early Age', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Executives and Management', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Itron Incorporated', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-09T17:37:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'SundayBusiness', 'section_name': 'Job Market', 'byline': {'original': 'By Malcolm Unsworth', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Malcolm', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Unsworth', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/27359155-93ba-5a38-b63f-4652d052c5fc', 'word_count': 630, 'uri': 'nyt://article/27359155-93ba-5a38-b63f-4652d052c5fc'}, {'abstract': 'Japanese high school teams use baseball to try to forget their disaster for at least a little while.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2011/07/10/sports/20110710ofunato.html', 'snippet': 'Japanese high school teams use baseball to try to forget their disaster for at least a little while.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Japanese high school teams use baseball to try to forget their disaster for at least a little while.', 's