organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Letter', '_id': 'nyt://article/d70e8e42-d282-5cfd-ad7d-56c020c94c8e', 'word_count': 164, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d70e8e42-d282-5cfd-ad7d-56c020c94c8e'}, {'abstract': 'As spring gives way to summer, the sailboats return, one by one, taking up their moorings in the Hudson River, anchored against the tide.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/10/opinion/sunday/10sun7.html', 'snippet': 'As spring gives way to summer, the sailboats return, one by one, taking up their moorings in the Hudson River, anchored against the tide.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In winter, they are missing. But as spring gives way to summer, the sailboats return, one by one, taking up their moorings in the Hudson River, anchored against the tide. Traffic on the West Side Highway hurtles past them, tugs and barges make way midstream, their wakes lapping against these hulls at rest. Some days, the sailboats look near enough to be some quiet enclave of the West 80s. But no matter how close they seem, there is always a faraway-ness to them. ', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Sail On, Sailor', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Sail On, Sailor', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sailboats and Sailing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Hudson River', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-09T21:28:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'subsection_name': 'Sunday Review', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/89d5de80-e3d4-544f-9713-da34eaee6361', 'word_count': 312, 'uri': 'nyt://article/89d5de80-e3d4-544f-9713-da34eaee6361'}, {'abstract': 'The gunman — a bodyguard for a high-ranking deputy of Afghanistan’s National Directorate of Security — opened fire on a convoy heading out to train police officers, officials said.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/10/world/asia/10afghan.html', 'snippet': 'The gunman — a bodyguard for a high-ranking deputy of Afghanistan’s National Directorate of Security — opened fire on a convoy heading out to train police officers, officials said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'KABUL, Afghanistan — A bodyguard for Afghanistan’s intelligence service killed two members of the NATO-led coalition on Saturday morning when he opened fire on a convoy heading out to train police officers, Afghan officials said. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/10/world/ALT-10AFGHANISTA/ALT-10AFGHANISTA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/10/world/ALT-10AFGHANISTA/ALT-10AFGHANISTA-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/10/world/ALT-10AFGHANISTA/ALT-10AFGHANISTA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/10/world/ALT-10AFGHANISTA/ALT-10AFGHANISTA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/10/world/ALT-10AFGHANISTA/ALT-10AFGHANISTA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Afghan Bodyguard Kills Two From NATO Coalition', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Afghan Bodyguard Kills Two From NATO Coalition', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mur