ission to let the world know, as best she could, that it must preserve wilderness.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/10/nyregion/obit-la-bastille/obit-la-bastille-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 810, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/10/nyregion/obit-la-bastille/obit-la-bastille-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/10/nyregion/obit-la-bastille/obit-la-bastille-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Anne LaBastille, Advocate, Author and ‘Woodswoman’ of Adirondacks, Dies at 75', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Anne LaBastille, 75, Advocate, Author And ‘Woodswoman’ of Adirondacks', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ADIRONDACK MOUNTAINS (NY)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Writing and Writers', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Endangered and Extinct Species', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'ADIRONDACK PARK AGENCY', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Environment', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-09T21:36:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dennis Hevesi', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dennis', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hevesi', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/4772afd9-0fab-55cb-ae04-0556bfd47ff7', 'word_count': 889, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4772afd9-0fab-55cb-ae04-0556bfd47ff7'}, {'abstract': 'Mayor Rahm Emanuel of Chicago is in a tense dispute with union officials over his demand that city employee unions agree to change some workplace rules or face hundreds of layoffs.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/10/us/10cncworkrules.html', 'snippet': 'Mayor Rahm Emanuel of Chicago is in a tense dispute with union officials over his demand that city employee unions agree to change some workplace rules or face hundreds of layoffs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Over the past five years, the office of City Hall’s inspector general fielded about 200 complaints alleging that city truck drivers were loafing or sleeping at job sites. But the drivers were most likely not shirking any duties, said Inspector General Joseph Ferguson. And that, he said, is the real problem.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21A', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/10/us/10CNCWORKRULES/10CNCWORKRULES-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/10/us/10CNCWORKRULES/10CNCWORKRULES-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/10/us/10CNCWORKRULES/10CNCWORKRULES-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 701, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/10/us/10CNCWORKRULES/10CNCWORKRULES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011