t Peelers, won a division of the $145,208 New York Sires Stakes on Saturday and set a track record at Vernon Downs for 3-year-old fillies.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/11/sports/see-you-at-peelers-sends-unbeaten-streak-to-19.html', 'snippet': 'Harness racing’s biggest star, See You at Peelers, won a division of the $145,208 New York Sires Stakes on Saturday and set a track record at Vernon Downs for 3-year-old fillies.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Harness Racing’s biggest star, See You at Peelers, ran her unbeaten streak to 19 races on Saturday, winning a division of the $145,208 New York Sires Stakes and setting a new track record at Vernon Downs for 3-year-old fillies.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Filly’s Unbeaten Streak Reaches 19 Races', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Filly’s Unbeaten Streak Reaches 19 Races', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Harness Racing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Records and Achievements', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Jockeys, Drivers and Trainers', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Horse Racing', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Takter, Jimmy', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-10T23:35:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Joe Drape', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joe', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Drape', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/12cfb180-4523-55c5-898b-800b300f6c18', 'word_count': 483, 'uri': 'nyt://article/12cfb180-4523-55c5-898b-800b300f6c18'}, {'abstract': 'Readers respond to a recent front page article about new standards proposed by President Obama to increase the mileage of all American cars.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/11/opinion/l11gas.html', 'snippet': 'Readers respond to a recent front page article about new standards proposed by President Obama to increase the mileage of all American cars.', 'lead_paragraph': 'To the Editor:', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/11/opinion/11letters-art/11letters-art-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/11/opinion/11letters-art/11letters-art-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/11/opinion/11letters-art/11letters-art-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'On the Road to Better Gas Mileage', 'kicker': 'Letters', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'On the Road to Better Gas Mileage', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Oil (Petroleum) and Gasoline', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Environment', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fuel Efficiency', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hybrid Vehicles', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-10T23:47:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Letters', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Letter', '_id': 'nyt://article/ea793022-bb7b-5b15-b218-86493d1f9208', 'word_count': 545, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ea793022-bb7b-5b15-b218-86493d1f9208'}, {'abstract': 'As Gen. David H. Petraeus prepared to end his tour as the supreme military commander in Afghanistan, he said that handing over security to Afghans remained “doable” despite setbacks.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/11/world/asia/11petraeus.html', 'snippet': 'As Gen. David H. Petraeus prepared to end his tour as the supreme military commander in Afghanistan, he said that handing over security to Afghans remained “doable” despite setbacks.', 'lead_paragraph': 'KABUL, Afghanistan — Just days away from the end of his tour as the supreme military commander in Afghanistan, and the end of a 37-year military career, Gen. David H. Petraeus said he was leaving in the belief that his plan to turn around the war and hand over security to the Afghans could be achieved.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/11/world/PETRAEUS/PETRAEUS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/11/world/PETRAEUS/PETRAEUS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/11/world/PETRAEUS/PETRAEUS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/11/world/PETRAEUS/PETRAEUS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/11/world/PETRAEUS/PETRAEUS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'ma