f1dc8bd'}, {'abstract': 'Since Minnesota closed its doors on July 1, officials have found themselves facing complicated new questions, and a dispute that threatens to drag on.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/11/us/11shutdown.html', 'snippet': 'Since Minnesota closed its doors on July 1, officials have found themselves facing complicated new questions, and a dispute that threatens to drag on.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ST. PAUL — The shutdown of the State of Minnesota has forced the opening of a new hearing room here, where pleas have flowed forth, one after the next, for a week.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/11/us/SHUTDOWN-2/SHUTDOWN-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/11/us/SHUTDOWN-2/SHUTDOWN-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/11/us/SHUTDOWN-2/SHUTDOWN-2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/11/us/SHUTDOWN-2/SHUTDOWN-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/11/us/SHUTDOWN-2/SHUTDOWN-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Cautionary Lessons From State’s Shutdown', 'kicker': 'News Analysis', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Cautionary Lessons From State’s Shutdown', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Budgets and Budgeting', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics