orts.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BEIRUT, Lebanon — Pro-government demonstrators attacked the American and French embassy compounds in Damascus, Syria, on Monday, angered over visits by the ambassadors to a central Syrian city that has emerged as a flashpoint of the popular uprising against the government.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/12/world/SYRIA-1/SYRIA-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1006, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/12/world/SYRIA-1/SYRIA-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/12/world/SYRIA-1/SYRIA-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Crowds in Syria Attack U.S. and French Embassies', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'U.S. and French Embassies Attacked in Syria', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Diplomatic Service, Embassies and Consulates', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-11T15:24:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nada Bakri', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nada', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bakri', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d29f5114-6b5d-5144-9ac8-43f4d86ef585', 'word_count': 795, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d29f5114-6b5d-5144-9ac8-43f4d86ef585'}, {'abstract': 'A Russian passenger plane caught fire and crash l