ctive/091c79b4-7871-538f-b62b-dc5b555dc349'}, {'abstract': 'The only suspect arrested in the case of a woman mutilated for leaving her husband has been released, in a move that has angered human rights advocates and the woman’s family.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/12/world/asia/12afghanistan.html', 'snippet': 'The only suspect arrested in the case of a woman mutilated for leaving her husband has been released, in a move that has angered human rights advocates and the woman’s family.', 'lead_paragraph': 'KABUL, Afghanistan — The only suspect arrested in the case of a woman mutilated for leaving her husband has been released, local Afghan officials and the woman’s father said Monday, in a move that has angered human rights advocates and the woman’s family.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/12/world/asia/12afghanistan-span/12afghanistan-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/12/world/asia/12afghanistan-span/12afghanistan-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/12/world/asia/12afghanistan-span/12afghanistan-span-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/12/world/asia/12afghanistan-span/12afghanistan-span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/12/world/asia/12afghanistan-span/12afghanistan-span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Suspect in Mutilation