iowa/', 'snippet': 'Michele Bachmann is emerging as the new front-runner in Iowa, where polls show her at the top of the pack among Republican hopefuls, and she has become a target almost as quickly as she became a contender.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Last week Tim Pawlenty was reluctant to criticize Representative Michele Bachmann, a fellow Minnesotan and one of his chief rivals for the Republican presidential nomination, saying in an interview only that “everybody brings different strengths to the table.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Pawlenty Aims to Slow Bachmann in Iowa', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bachmann, Michele M', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pawlenty, Tim', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iowa', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-11T21:27:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael D. Shear', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/141ed929-9454-56b4-927f-0e7d5b96ad92', 'word_count': 729, 'uri': 'nyt://article/141ed929-9454-56b4-927f-0e7d5b96ad92'}, {'abstract': 'Just one day after the last edition of The News of the World was printed, new allegations of misconduct by journalists working at newspapers owned by Rupert Murdoch surfaced.', 'web_url': 'https://thelede.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/07/11/three-murdoch-papers-reportedly-targeted-gordon-brown/', 'snippet': 'Just one day after the last edition of The News of the World was printed, new allegations of misconduct by journalists working at newspapers owned by Rupert Murdoch surfaced.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As my colleagues John F. Burns and Alan Cowell report, on Monday, just one day after the last edition of The News of the World was printed, new allegations of misconduct by journalists working at two other British newspapers owned by Rupert Murdoch surfaced.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Three Murdoch Papers Reportedly Targeted Gordon Brown', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'News and News Media', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wiretapping and Other Eavesdropping Devices and Methods', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brooks, Rebekah', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brown, Gordon', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Murdoch, Rupert', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'British Sky Broadcasting', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Guardian (British Newspaper)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'NEWS CORP', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'News of the World', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Sun, The (British Newspaper)', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Sunday Times (British Newspaper)', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-11T21:29:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Robert Mackey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Robert', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mackey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization':