nd entertainment businesses. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'NCR to Buy Radiant Systems for $1.2 Billion', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mergers, Acquisitions and Divestitures', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'NCR Corp', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-11T22:07:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael J. de la Merced', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'de la Merced', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7fb8f5ba-593d-598a-bdf2-3506356017c4', 'word_count': 293, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7fb8f5ba-593d-598a-bdf2-3506356017c4'}, {'abstract': 'When Derek Jeter of the New York Yankees got his 3,000th hit on Saturday, he set off a celebration on Madison Avenue that shows few signs of petering out.', 'web_url': 'https://mediadecoder.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/07/11/what-will-they-do-when-he-hits-4000/', 'snippet': 'When Derek Jeter of the New York Yankees got his 3,000th hit on Saturday, he set off a celebration on Madison Avenue that shows few signs of petering out.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Here’s a suggestion for a way to stimulate the economy that may pass muster with the Tea Party: have more famous baseball players achieve more career milestones.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What Will They Do When He Hits 4,000?', 'kicker': 'Media Decoder', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADVERTISING AND MARKETING', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jeter, Derek', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'nam