0-3576-5939-943d-6b23786e59eb', 'word_count': 1052, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4abc4510-3576-5939-943d-6b23786e59eb'}, {'abstract': 'A Los Angeles city councilwoman, Janice Hahn, a Democrat, is fighting off a challenge from a Republican businessman, Craig Huey, for a Congressional seat long held by the Democrats.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/12/us/12california.html', 'snippet': 'A Los Angeles city councilwoman, Janice Hahn, a Democrat, is fighting off a challenge from a Republican businessman, Craig Huey, for a Congressional seat long held by the Democrats.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LOS ANGELES — California’s 36th Congressional District has been in Democratic hands for more than a decade. It was never a district Democrats thought they might have to worry about after its longtime representative, Jane Harman, stepped down in February.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/12/us/CALIFORNIA-1/CALIFORNIA-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/12/us/CALIFORNIA-1/CALIFORNIA-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Los Angeles Democrats Pressed to Retain Seat', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Los Angeles Democrats Pressed to Retain Seat', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Los Angeles (Calif)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Harman, Jane', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-12T02:07:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'