c acts, including Follower and the Chilean electro dance smash MKRNI.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/07/12/notes-from-the-underground-phoebe-jean-the-air-force/', 'snippet': 'The group performed at Cakeshop recently, opening a lineup of queer-centric acts, including Follower and the Chilean electro dance smash MKRNI.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Phoebe Jean & the Air Force performed at Cakeshop recently, opening a lineup of queer-centric acts, including Follower and the Chilean electro dance smash MKRNI. Looking like a mischievous, overgrown elf in a floppy hat and XXXL T-shirt that cloaked her like a dress, Phoebe performed her signature mix of classic club breaks, funk and electronic, while her drummer, dressed in skintight animal-print pants, maniacally contorted his face. Collectively, the group brought the low-ceilinged room to a sweat.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Notes From the Underground | Phoebe Jean & the Air Force', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-07-12T15:30:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By IO Tillett Wright', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Io', 'middlename': 'Tillett', 'lastname': 'Wright', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fa4343b9-c06f-5df1-a88d-1abfc874a9b7', 'word_count': 78, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fa4343b9-c06f-5df1-a88d-1abfc874a9b7'}, {'abstract': 'It would seem that the real fight in Washington may be about something something simple: who’s the real leader?', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/07/12/whos-the-real-leader-in-debt-talks/', 'snippet': 'It would seem that the real fight in Washington may be about something something simple: who’s the real leader?', 