in his résumé at 53: he has never won a British Open.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/13/sports/golf/2011-british-open-bernhard-langer-doesnt-lament-ones-that-got-away.html', 'snippet': 'A World Golf Hall of Famer and former No. 1, Bernhard Langer has one hole in his résumé at 53: he has never won a British Open.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SANDWICH, England — Three decades ago, when Bernhard Langer showed up at Royal St. George’s for the British Open, he was a skinny 23-year-old with a pile of thick, curly hair, a thin mustache and two obscure victories on the European Tour.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/13/sports/baseball/13golf-pic2/13golf-pic2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/13/sports/baseball/13golf-pic2/13golf-pic2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/13/sports/baseball/13golf-pic2/13golf-pic2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 597, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/13/sports/baseball/13golf-pic2/13golf-pic2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/13/sports/baseball/13golf-pic2/13golf-pic2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Over the Years, Close Finishes but No Title', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Over the Years, Close Finishes but No Title', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Golf', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'British Open (Golf)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Langer, Bernhard', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-12T20:10:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Golf', 'byline': {'original': 'By Larry Dorman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Larry', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Dorman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d848aa8a-5990-53df-9102-56a95c2a2024', 'word_count': 1058, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d848aa8a-5990-53df-9102-56a95c2a2024'}, {'abstract': 'The Met no longer puts on full operas in the parks, but it does maintain a presence with live recitals.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/13/arts/music/met-opera-recital-at-summerstage-in-central-park-review.html', 'snippet': 'The Met no longer puts on full operas in the parks, but it does maintain a presence with live recitals.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It has been four years since the Metropolitan Opera decided to stop presenting full operas in its summertime concerts in New York City’s parks, a decision that was difficult to understand, given the popularity of these free performances, and the likelihood that they were winning the company new listeners. Now, presumably, the Met’s high-definition opera screenings are expected to be its audience builders: It is presenting free screenings of 10 of them in its Met Summer HD Festival, at Lincoln Center from Aug. 27 to Sept. 5. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/13/arts/MET2/MET2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 't