'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Video', '_id': 'nyt://video/834f5d31-a3e1-5af2-a809-e1e8312d885f', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/834f5d31-a3e1-5af2-a809-e1e8312d885f'}, {'abstract': 'Christine Lagarde, the new head of the International Monetary Fund, named an American official as her chief deputy and added a Chinese official to the ranks of her senior advisers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/13/business/us-and-chinese-officials-named-to-imf-posts.html', 'snippet': 'Christine Lagarde, the new head of the International Monetary Fund, named an American official as her chief deputy and added a Chinese official to the ranks of her senior advisers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Christine Lagarde, the new head of the International Monetary Fund, named an American official as her chief deputy Tuesday and, in a move that reflects China’s rising influence, added a Chinese official to the ranks of her senior advisers.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/13/business/FUND/FUND-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'U.S. and Chinese Officials Named to I.M.F. Posts', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Fulfilling Vow, I.M.F.’s New Chief Names American and Chinese Deputies', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'International Monetary Fund', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lagarde, Christine', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Appointments and Executive Changes', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-12T20:58:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Binyamin Appelbaum', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bin