ce3-b9be-75cd49f46f64'}, {'abstract': 'The likely candidates in the 2013 mayoral election are stepping up fund-raising efforts for their primary campaigns, and the City Council speaker, Christine C. Quinn, leads them all.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/13/nyregion/nyc-mayoral-hopefuls-post-early-fund-raising-totals.html', 'snippet': 'The likely candidates in the 2013 mayoral election are stepping up fund-raising efforts for their primary campaigns, and the City Council speaker, Christine C. Quinn, leads them all.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Eying a bid for New York mayor in 2013, the City Council speaker, Christine C. Quinn, raised a robust $1.3 million in the first half of this year, outpacing all of her likely rivals, according to campaign finance estimates released Tuesday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/13/nyregion/mayor1/mayor1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 481, 'width': 722, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/13/nyregion/mayor1/mayor1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/13/nyregion/mayor1/mayor1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Mayoral Election Still Two Years Off, but Fund-Raising Is Already Well Under Way', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Mayoral Election Still Two Years Off, but Fund-Raising Is Already Well Under Way', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Liu, John C', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'de Blasio, Bill', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Quinn, Christine C', 'rank': 3, 'major'