roups Dislike Proposals', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Some Rare Agreement on Debt Talks: Health Groups Dislike Proposals', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicaid', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicare', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicine and Health', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Health Insurance and Managed Care', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Federal Budget (US)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-13T02:16:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Robert Pear', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Robert', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pear', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bc654402-6269-5598-bc1f-f25033382f98', 'word_count': 779, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bc654402-6269-5598-bc1f-f25033382f98'}, {'abstract': 'Jirik was a Czech hockey star who played a role in his national team’s emotional victory over the Soviets in 1969.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/13/sports/hockey/jaroslav-jirik-71-dies-1st-eastern-bloc-player-in-nhl.html', 'snippet': 'Jirik was a Czech hockey star who played a role in his national team’s emotional victory over the Soviets in 1969.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jaroslav Jirik, a Czech hockey star who played a role in his national team’s emotional victory over the Soviets in 1969 after the Soviet invasion of his homeland and who later became the first Eastern-bloc player to appear in the National Hockey League, died Monday when the small plane he was piloting crashed in the Czech Republic near Brno. He was 71.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/13/sports/13jirik/13jirik-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 693, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/13/sports/13jirik/13jirik-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/13/sports/13jirik/13jirik-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Jaroslav Jirik, 71, Dies; 1st Eastern-Bloc Player in N.H.L.', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Jaroslav Jirik, 71, Dies; 1st Eastern-Bloc Player in N.H.L.', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hockey, Ice', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Hockey League', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Czech Republic', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'USSR (Former Soviet Union)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-13T02:18:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Hockey', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeff Z. Klein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeff', 'middlename': 'Z.', 'lastname': 'Klein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/cd81bc5a-bae5-502f-bfeb-342357e23076', 'word_count': 367, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cd81bc5a-bae5-502f-bfeb-342357e23076'}, {'abstract': 'Prime Minister David Cameron has found himself a step behind in reacting to the phone-hacking revelations and his own associations with the press.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/13/world/europe/13cameron.html', 'snippet': 'Prime Minister David Cameron has found himself a step behind in reacting to the phone-hacking revelations and his own associations with the press.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — Prime Minister David Cameron is usually the nimblest of politicians, radiating self-assurance and blessed with an almost Reaganesque ability to deflect criticism. But as the phone hacking scandal spreads, Mr. Cameron has been placed in the unaccustomed position of appearing vulnerable and behind the curve.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/14/world/europe/14cameron2/14cameron2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 568, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/14/world/europe/14cameron2/14cameron2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/14/world/europe/14cameron2/14cameron2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Connections to Murdoch Start to Chafe British Leader', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Murdoch Ties Start to Chafe British Leader', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'News of the World', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Katz, Ian', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cameron, David', 'rank': 3, 'ma