s young. The two men had a falling out in 2004.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/14/sports/baseball/2011-all-star-game-for-fielder-game-of-fathers-and-sons-is-complicated.html', 'snippet': 'Prince Fielder’s two young sons shadowed him at the All-Star Game the way he used to shadow his father, Cecil, when he was young. The two men had a falling out in 2004.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PHOENIX — Prince Fielder walked into the interview room at Chase Field late Tuesday night behind his two young sons, Jadyn and Haven. They had watched their father hit a three-run homer to power the National League to a 5-1 victory over the American League in the 82nd All-Star Game and now they were going to sit beside him at the news conference as he discussed being named the game’s most valuable player.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/14/sports/baseball/14fielder-pic/14fielder-pic-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 969, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/14/sports/baseball/14fielder-pic/14fielder-pic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/14/sports/baseball/14fielder-pic/14fielder-pic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Game of Fathers and Sons Is Complicated for Fielder', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Game of Fathers and Sons Is Complicated for Fielder', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fielder, Prince', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fielder, Cecil', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ALL STAR GAMES', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations