ncludes $500,000 of improper gains and $40,535 of interest. Ms. Chiesi, a central figure in the prosecution of Raj Rajaratnam, is scheduled to be sentenced in Federal District Court in Manhattan on July 20. Read more »', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Danielle Chiesi Settles S.E.C. Action', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-07-13T15:44:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dealbook', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dealbook', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7e435832-7a2e-5242-9403-406ca37fdc2a', 'word_count': 72, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7e435832-7a2e-5242-9403-406ca37fdc2a'}, {'abstract': 'Interviews with neighbors of the Kletzky family after the discovery of what is believed to be the body of their missing son.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/nyregion/100000000943325/reaction-to-the-leibby-kletzky-killing.html', 'snippet': 'Interviews with neighbors of the Kletzky family after the discovery of what is believed to be the body of their missing son.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Interviews with neighbors of the Kletzky family after the discovery of what is believed to be the body of their missing son.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/13/nyregion/video-childreaction/video-childreaction-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/13/nyregion/video-childreaction/video-childreaction-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'capti