eartening ruling says candidates cannot solicit large-scale donations for the new Super PACs.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/14/opinion/14thurs4.html', 'snippet': 'A heartening ruling says candidates cannot solicit large-scale donations for the new Super PACs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It is heartening that the usually dysfunctional Federal Election Commission has now ruled that candidates cannot solicit large-scale donations for the new “Super PACs” intent on raising hundreds of millions for the 2012 elections. For too long the F.E.C. has spent much of its time creating loopholes for party machines and declining to punish even egregious violators. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The F.E.C. Awakes', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The F.E.C. Awakes', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Political Action Committees', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Campaign Finance', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Election Commission', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-14T02:27:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/6b312b58-af23-55ae-8ea3-ff9104215f95', 'word_count': 252, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6b312b58-af23-55ae-8ea3-ff9104215f95'}, {'abstract': 'Several outposts of Morse code blazed to life again, if only for a night, with the help of a group of enthusiasts bent on preserving what they call “the music of Morse,” one key-tap at a time.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2011/07/13/us/MORSE.html', 'snippet': 'Several outposts of Morse code blazed to life again, if only