mmy, now hip Shoreditch. Put these two things together and it should come as no surprise that the park will host a series of high-decibel events through the summer, keeping residents and visitors creatively entertained. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'London Park Hosts Summer Festival Lineup', 'kicker': 'In Transit', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Festivals', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parks and Other Recreation Areas', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Rock Music', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'London (England)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-14T10:00:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By Claudia Barbieri', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Claudia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barbieri', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/725c627b-dd38-54a7-b53a-f1368ac8612f', 'word_count': 446, 'uri': 'nyt://article/725c627b-dd38-54a7-b53a-f1368ac8612f'}, {'abstract': 'Political news from today’s Times and around the Web, plus a look at what’s happening in Washington.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/07/14/the-early-word-tension-2/', 'snippet': 'Political news from today’s Times and around the Web, plus a look at what’s happening in Washington.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Today’s Times', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Early Word: Tension', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-07-14T10:00:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'by