 wrong of the last four years, Emmy voters gave a nod to “Friday Night Lights,” which in its fifth and final season was one of the handful of best shows on television — as it has been every season. I won’t hold my brea...', 'lead_paragraph': 'You win a few, you lose a few. At the top of the list, in the best drama category, the Emmy nominators righted their most egregious wrong of the last four years and gave a nod to “Friday Night Lights,” which in its fifth and final season was one of the handful of best shows on television — as it has been every season. I won’t hold my breath for an Emmy, but a little recognition was still nice.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Emmy Nominators Do Right by ‘Friday Night Lights’', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Home Box Office', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-14T13:31:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mike Hale', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mike', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hale', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/abfd4390-65dd-5242-93b1-50cfd7edf56c', 'word_count': 198, 'uri': 'nyt://article/abfd4390-65dd-5242-93b1-50cfd7edf56c'}, {'abstract': 'JPMorgan Chase named Larry Slaughter, a senior European banker, as a new co-head of investment banking for North America.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2011/07/14/jpmorgan-names-co-head-of-north-america-investment-banking/', 'snippet': 'JPMorgan Chase named Larry Slaughter, a senior European banker, as a new co-head of investment banking for North America.', 'lead_paragraph': 'JPMorgan Chase on Thursday named Larry Slaughter, a se