ts. If my parents took the family out for pizza or Chinese food, it was usually a special occasion of some kind. On a few really special occasions, we ventured out to Helmand, an Afghan restaurant in East Cambridge. To a teenager’s eyes, the restaurant was romantic, not to say exotic: flatbread fresh from the oven! Pumpkin appearing in dishes other than pumpkin pie!', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Dining With the Karzais', 'kicker': 'The 6th Floor', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Karzai, Ahmed Wali', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AFGHANISTAN', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Cambridge (Mass)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-14T15:59:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rachel Nolan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rachel', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Nolan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/868b4242-14eb-5028-8af0-e5af3aeb756f', 'word_count': 429, 'uri': 'nyt://article/868b4242-14eb-5028-8af0-e5af3aeb756f'}, {'abstract': 'You won’t be able to buy paper savings bonds at banks after the end of this year.', 'web_url': 'https://bucks.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/07/14/goodbye-paper-savings-bonds/', 'snippet': 'You won’t be able to buy paper savings bonds at banks after the end of this year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Updated to add data on volume of savings bonds sold/11:27 a.m.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Goodbye, Paper Savings Bonds', 'kicker': 'Bucks', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 1, 'major':