t it would begin tests of electronic crash-avoidance warning systems in August. The Connected Vehicle Safety Pilot Program is designed to determine how test participants, all ordinary drivers, respond to hazard alerts, how accepting they are of the technology and how effective the systems are in different driving environments.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Transportation Department to Test Collision Warning Systems', 'kicker': 'Wheels', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Roads and Traffic', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Transportation Department (NYC)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-14T18:12:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'byline': {'original': 'By Paul Stenquist', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Paul', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stenquist', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cbe45da2-7379-5aaf-b063-9904539c18fc', 'word_count': 243, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cbe45da2-7379-5aaf-b063-9904539c18fc'}, {'abstract': 'Ballet classes combine the traditional barre work of ballet with exercises more commonly seen in pilates and yoga classes.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/07/14/gym-class-ballet-aerobics/', 'snippet': 'Ballet classes combine the traditional barre work of ballet with exercises more commonly seen in pilates and yoga classes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'What does it take to become a ballerina? Equal parts strength, flexibility and grace — all qualities in which I am seriously lacking.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Gym Class: Ballet Workout', 'kicker': 'Well', 'content_kicker': None