hat is now being scrutinized.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/15/us/15ttperry.html', 'snippet': 'Governor Perry may be a no-apologies conservative Republican now, but he spent his first six years in politics as a Democrat, a period that is now being scrutinized.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Gov. Rick Perry, a no-apologies conservative known for slashing government spending and opposing all tax increases, is about as Republican as you can get.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19A', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/15/us/15TTPERRY2/15TTPERRY2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 628, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/15/us/15TTPERRY2/15TTPERRY2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/15/us/15TTPERRY2/15TTPERRY2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Taking a Look at the Governor, Back When He Was a Democrat', 'kicker': 'The Texas Tribune', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Taking a Look at the Governor, Back When He Was a Democrat', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Perry, Rick', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Texas', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Democratic Party', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-14T22:02:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jay Root', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jay', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Root', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, '