over sovereign debt, they look noble.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/15/business/global/europe-makes-rating-agencies-look-good.html', 'snippet': 'When the housing market crumbled, the agencies looked incompetent, conflict-ridden and craven, but as politicians criticize them over sovereign debt, they look noble.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mortgage securities destroyed the reputations of credit rating agencies. Could sovereign debt restore them?', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2010/04/19/business/norris-75/norris-75-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2010/04/19/business/norris-75/norris-75-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Making Rating Shops Look Good', 'kicker': 'High & Low Finance', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Making Rating Shops Look Good', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Credit Ratings and Credit Rating Agencies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'European Sovereign Debt Crisis (2010- )', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Subprime Mortgage Crisis', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Standard & Poor's Corp", 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Moody's Corporation", 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Fitch Ratings', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-14T23:44:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Global Business', 'byline': {'original': 'By Floyd Norris', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Floyd', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Norris', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'r