ew York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Friday: Dark Time For Bards', 'kicker': 'Wordplay', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Crossword Puzzles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-15T02:00:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Crosswords & Games', 'byline': {'original': 'By Deb Amlen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Deb', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Amlen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/982ad61f-ad3d-5dfe-a05e-e379d2e03ed5', 'word_count': 368, 'uri': 'nyt://article/982ad61f-ad3d-5dfe-a05e-e379d2e03ed5'}, {'abstract': 'The Mets’ ability to make a run for a playoff spot rests on how they play during a crucial stretch of games over the next two weeks.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/15/sports/baseball/mets-face-crucial-stretch-at-start-of-second-half.html', 'snippet': 'The Mets’ ability to make a run for a playoff spot rests on how they play during a crucial stretch of games over the next two weeks.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If the theme of the first half of the season for the Mets was injuries, the theme for the second half — at least the start of it — will be uncertainty.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/15/sports/mets/mets-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/15/sports/mets/mets-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/15/sports/mets/mets-thumbSta