d he felt obligated to make sure his leg was healthy heading into the second half, adding that he was “surprised” that his absence caused such a stir.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TORONTO — Responding to criticism from some of his peers and the voting public, Derek Jeter defended his decision to not attend Tuesday’s All-Star Game in Arizona in order to rest his right calf. Jeter said Thursday that he felt obligated to make sure his leg was healthy heading into the second half, adding that he was “surprised” that his absence caused such a stir.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Jeter on His Decision: Team Before All-Stars', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Jeter on His Decision: Team Before All-Stars', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jeter, Derek', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ALL STAR GAMES', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sports Injuries', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-15T02:19:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Shpigel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shpigel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9a9d9627-e3ed-5168-b974-e1b6374b8a8f', 'word_count': 725, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9a9d9627-e3ed-5168-b974-e1b6374b8a8f'}, {'abstract': 'Add to Rupert Murdoch’s list of potential headaches a blast from the past: the Bancroft family.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/15/business/murdochs-woes-could-include-bancrofts.html', 'snippet': 