ed leg wound. It looked as if she might lose her leg, lose her baby, and lose her life, from some combination of the infection and hunger (she hadn’t eaten for 24 hours). The win-a-trip student winner, Saumya Dave, a medical student, quite properly became distraught and asked: Is there anything we can do?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Follow-Up on Miero', 'kicker': 'Nicholas Kristof', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-07-15T04:37:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nicholas Kristof', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nicholas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kristof', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/54f728ce-5bb8-5bea-a89f-e95bc915b000', 'word_count': 626, 'uri': 'nyt://article/54f728ce-5bb8-5bea-a89f-e95bc915b000'}, {'abstract': 'NYT: Front Page for 07/15/2011', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/audio/2011/07/15/multimedia/15frontpage.html', 'snippet': 'NYT: Front Page for 07/15/2011', 'lead_paragraph': 'NYT: Front Page for 07/15/2011', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'NYT: Front Page for 07/15/2011', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-07-15T04:46:21+0000', 'document_type': 'audio', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Multimedia/Photos', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://audio/de5dad6d-5e28-544d-a620-c8b2ff794c41', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://audio/de5dad6d-5e28-544d-a620-c8b2ff794c41'}, {'abstract': 'Moviegoers came out in droves to watch the final addition to the Harry Potter film canon, “Harry Potter and the Deathly Hallows: Part 2.