money comes from the Andrew W. Mellon Foundation.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/07/15/newark-museum-gets-1-million-grant-for-african-art-collection/', 'snippet': 'The money comes from the Andrew W. Mellon Foundation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Newark Museum has received a $1 million grant from the Andrew W. Mellon Foundation to support initiatives related to its African art collection. The grant will allow the museum to hire a new assistant curator, doubling the size of its African art department, and to engage additional scholars for research, the museum’s director, Mary Sue Sweeney Price, said in a telephone interview. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Newark Museum Gets $1 Million Grant for African Art Collection', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Finances', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Grants (Corporate and Foundation)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Museums', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Mellon Foundation', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Newark Museum', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AFRICA', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-15T18:07:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kate Taylor', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kate', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Taylor', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f3ad92b2-4b97-5a50-9c05-def142c92110', 'word_count': 241, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f3ad92b2-4b97-5a50-9c05-def142c92110'}, {'abstract': 'Once a Wall Street lawyer, Elizabeth Warren was selected by President Obama to set up the Consumer Financial Protection Bureau. She talks about her work to organize the bureau amid heavy opposition.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/business/100000000947790/dealbook-portraits-elizabeth-warren.html', 'snippet': 'Once a Wall Street lawyer, Elizabeth Warren was selected by President Obama to set up the Consumer Financial Protection Bureau. She talks about her work to organize the bureau amid heavy opposition.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Once a Wall Street lawyer, Elizabeth Warren was selected by President Obama to set up the Consumer Financial Protection Bureau. She talks about her work to organize the bureau amid heavy opposition.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/15/business/video-db-portraits-warren/video-db-portraits-warren-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/15/business/video-db-portraits-warren/video-db-portraits-warren-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/15/business/video-db-portraits-warren/video-db-portraits-warren-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/15/business/video-db-portraits-warren/video-db-portraits-warren-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'DealBook Portraits: Elizabeth Warren', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Warren, Elizabeth', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Consumer Financial Protection Bureau', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': '