his campaign, he had $322,000 in the bank.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/07/15/gingrich-campaign-is-1-million-in-debt/', 'snippet': 'At the end of the June, after most of his senior advisers abandoned his campaign, he had $322,000 in the bank.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Newt Gingrich’s presidential campaign is $1 million in debt, after raising only $2 million during the last three months, according to a campaign finance report to be filed Friday with the Federal Election Commission.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Gingrich Campaign Is $1 Million in Debt', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Campaign Finance', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gingrich, Newt', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-15T19:14:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeff Zeleny', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeff', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Zeleny', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/836ea2e3-1b0c-518c-bdca-0f837e60cb7c', 'word_count': 98, 'uri': 'nyt://article/836ea2e3-1b0c-518c-bdca-0f837e60cb7c'}, {'abstract': 'The singer Jade Williams is print happy in Dolce & Gabbana.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/07/15/look-of-the-moment-jade-williams/', 'snippet': 'The singer Jade Williams is print happy in Dolce & Gabbana.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Look: Print happy — a graphic mix of stars and animal spots looks equally polished and playful.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Look of the Moment | Jade Williams', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'c