ensive. It would take an owner years to recoup the extra cost.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/17/automobiles/paying-the-dealer-to-save-at-the-pump.html', 'snippet': 'The Ford Focus with the SFE option makes the car more fuel efficient, but also more expensive. It would take an owner years to recoup the extra cost.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ALTHOUGH the 40 miles per gallon highway rating of the Ford Focus with the SFE (Super Fuel Economy) option seems alluring, the economics don’t work for penny pinchers: it could take 13 years to get your money back.', 'print_section': 'AU', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/17/automobiles/MILE/MILE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 546, 'width': 819, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/17/automobiles/MILE/MILE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/17/automobiles/MILE/MILE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Paying the Dealer to Save at the Pump', 'kicker': 'Greentech', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Paying the Dealer to Save at the Pump', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fuel Efficiency', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Ford Motor Company', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-15T19:23:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Automobiles', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'byline': {'original': 'By Christopher Jensen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Christopher', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Jensen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role