'abstract': 'At least seven people were killed, including a high-ranking security official, in another sign of the breakdown in stability that has been pushing Yemen to the brink of chaos.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/16/world/middleeast/16yemen.html', 'snippet': 'At least seven people were killed, including a high-ranking security official, in another sign of the breakdown in stability that has been pushing Yemen to the brink of chaos.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SANA, Yemen — Fighting between security forces and armed opposition tribesmen intensified on Friday in the city of Taiz. At least seven people were killed, including a high-ranking security official, in yet another sign of the breakdown in stability that has been pushing Yemen to the brink of chaos. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Clashes, Some Deadly, Intensify in a Tumultuous City in Central Yemen', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Clashes, Some Deadly, Intensify in a Tumultuous City in Central Yemen', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Middle East and North Africa Unrest (2010- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Yemen', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ahmar, Ali Mohsin al-', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-15T23:51:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nasser Arrabyee and Laura Kasinof', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nasser', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Arrabyee', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Laura', 'middlename': None, 'lastn