tists makes for grim reading. It concludes that the oceans are approaching irreversible, potentially catastrophic change. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Look Into the Ocean’s Future', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Look Into the Ocean’s Future', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Oceans and Seas', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Greenhouse Gas Emissions', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Carbon Dioxide', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Environment', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Water Pollution', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-16T00:59:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/45682327-50b0-56b3-bf2b-de2f9bccf3b4', 'word_count': 292, 'uri': 'nyt://article/45682327-50b0-56b3-bf2b-de2f9bccf3b4'}, {'abstract': 'New regulations for cribs took effect on June 28, but some makers had not had all of their cribs certified by testing laboratories, frustrating retailers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/16/business/with-new-safety-rules-for-cribs-makers-scramble-and-retailers-fume.html', 'snippet': 'New regulations for cribs took effect on June 28, but some makers had not had all of their cribs certified by testing laboratories, frustrating retailers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BAYONNE, N.J. — At the back of a cavernous warehouse along a rough-and-tumble waterfront here, an area has been swept clean of boxes and forklifts to make way for baby safety.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'ur