ract with the restricted free-agent center Brian Boyle.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/16/sports/hockey/rangers-re-sign-boyle.html', 'snippet': 'The Rangers announced that they agreed to terms on a contract with the restricted free-agent center Brian Boyle.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Rangers announced that they agreed to terms on a contract with the restricted free-agent center Brian Boyle. Re-signing the 6-foot-7 Boyle, who scored 21 goals last season, leaves the Rangers with two restricted free agents still to sign, the top-six forwards Ryan Callahan and Brandon Dubinsky. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/16/sports/briefs/briefs-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/16/sports/briefs/briefs-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/16/sports/briefs/briefs-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Rangers Re-Sign Boyle', 'kicker': 'Sports Briefing | Hockey', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Rangers Re-Sign Boyle', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Rangers', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Free Agents (Sports)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hockey, Ice', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Boyle, Brian', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-16T01:51:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Hockey', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeff Z. Klein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeff', 'middl