ich mashes up disco-era pop and Greek mythology, plays at the Carousel House in Asbury Park through July 24.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/17/nyregion/xanadu-at-the-asbury-park-carousel-house-review.html', 'snippet': 'The musical “Xanadu,” which mashes up disco-era pop and Greek mythology, plays at the Carousel House in Asbury Park through July 24.', 'lead_paragraph': 'An old pleasure dome known as the Carousel House on the Asbury Park boardwalk is currently home to the New Jersey premiere of “Xanadu,” the daffy, delectably tuneful musical drawn from one of the worst movies ever made.', 'print_section': 'NJ', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/17/nyregion/17artsnj_span/17artsnj_span-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/17/nyregion/17artsnj_span/17artsnj_span-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/17/nyregion/17artsnj_span/17ARTSNJ-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 695, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/17/nyregion/17artsnj_span/17artsnj_span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/17/nyregion/17artsnj_span/17artsnj_span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Greek Gods Under Disco Lights', 'kicker': 'Theater Review | New Jersey', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Greek Gods Under Disco Lights', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 1, 'majo