d by a few hundred feet, and the smallest at the opposite end.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Animal Collective’s Music Fills the Space at Pitchfork', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'ANIMAL COLLECTIVE', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pitchfork Media', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-16T03:43:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jon Caramanica', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jon', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Caramanica', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/85d264c0-a23c-590d-8345-a9062b3e984f', 'word_count': 204, 'uri': 'nyt://article/85d264c0-a23c-590d-8345-a9062b3e984f'}, {'abstract': 'Julie Glassberg spent more than a year with the New York chapter of the Black Label Bike Club, capturing the postindustrial landscapes its members inhabit.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2011/07/17/nyregion/20110717Visualss.html', 'snippet': 'Julie Glassberg spent more than a year with the New York chapter of the Black Label Bike Club, capturing the postindustrial landscapes its members inhabit.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Julie Glassberg spent more than a year with the New York chapter of the Black Label Bike Club, capturing the postindustrial landscapes its members inhabit.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/17/nyregion/20110717Visualss-slide-2N7C/20110717Visualss-slide-2N7C-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subty