ess/boris-gelfand-gets-first-shot-at-world-title-at-age-43.html', 'snippet': 'Now in his 40s, Boris Gelfand will plays for the World Championship next year for the first time.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Players usually reach their peak in their 20s, so how is it that the grandmaster Boris Gelfand is getting his first crack at becoming world champion when he is 43?', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'After Decades in Top Ranks, a Shot at the Title, Finally', 'kicker': 'Chess', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'After Decades in Top Ranks, A Shot at the Title, Finally', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Chess', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-17T01:40:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'Crosswords & Games', 'subsection_name': 'Chess', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dylan Loeb McClain', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dylan', 'middlename': 'Loeb', 'lastname': 'McClain', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a50bbea9-f5c0-5cb9-ab6d-c04d9450f38c', 'word_count': 493, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a50bbea9-f5c0-5cb9-ab6d-c04d9450f38c'}, {'abstract': 'Mrs. James and her husband, Robert, established what has become the world’s largest public collection of quilts, at the University of Nebraska, Lincoln.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/17/arts/ardis-butler-james-quilt-collector-dies-at-85.html', 'snippet': 'Mrs. James and her husband, Robert, established what has become the world’s largest public collection of quilts, at the University of Nebraska, Lincoln.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ardis Butler James, a Nebraska-born philanthropist who with her husband established what is now the largest public collection of quilts in the world, encompassing humbly elegant bed coverings by anonymous 18th-century hands and avant-garde wall hangings by celebrated 21st-century artists, died on July 7 in Stamford, Conn. She was 85.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/17/arts/dogJAMES1-obit/dogJAMES1-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/17/arts/dogJAMES1-obit/dogJAMES1-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/17/arts/dogJAMES1-obit/dogJAMES1-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/17/arts/dogJAMES1-obit/dogJAMES1-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/17/arts/dogJAMES1-obit/dogJAMES1-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Ardis James, Who Established Center on Quilts, Is Dead at 85', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Ardis James Dies at 85; Established Center on Quilts', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'James, Ardis', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Quilts', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Nebraska', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Collectors and Collections', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-17T01:55:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'origi