nment bonds of Greece, Portugal, Spain and Italy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/18/business/global/sovereign-debt-weakens-european-banks.html', 'snippet': 'The latest bank stress test revealed how exposed banks are to the government bonds of Greece, Portugal, Spain and Italy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — European banks for years bolstered their balance sheets with assets considered safe and secure: the sovereign debt of European countries.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/18/business/18euro-inline1/18euro-inline1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 636, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/18/business/18euro-inline1/18euro-inline1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/18/business/18euro-inline1/18euro-inline1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Pain Builds in Europe’s Sovereign Debt Risk', 'kicker': 'News Analysis', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Pain Builds In Europe’s Sovereign Debt Risk', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'European Sovereign Debt Crisis (2010- )', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Credit and Debt', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Government Bonds', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Economic Conditions and Trends', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-17T22:15:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsect