al what he will do.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/18/nyregion/cuomo-still-silent-on-expansion-of-taxi-service.html', 'snippet': 'Nearly a month after the State Legislature passed a bill drastically expanding taxi access throughout New York City, the governor has yet to signal what he will do.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Nearly a month after the State Legislature passed a bill drastically expanding access to taxi service in New York City, Gov. Andrew M. Cuomo has yet to signal whether he will sign the measure — providing hope to the city’s larger taxi fleet operators who oppose it.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Cuomo, Under Pressure, Is Still Silent on Intentions for Bill to Expand Taxi Service', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Cuomo, Under Pressure, Is Still Silent on Intentions for Bill to Expand Taxi Service', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Taxicabs and Taxicab Drivers', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Metropolitan Taxicab Board of Trade', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Taxi and Limousine Commission', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cuomo, Andrew M', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-18T01:03:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Christine Haughney', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Christine', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Haughney', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a8cadc1a-9488-5bbe-a6af-da562c8de776', 'word_count': 538, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a8c