finish at New Hampshire Motor Speedway, with the team principal Tony Stewart following Ryan Newman across the finish line.', 'web_url': 'https://wheels.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/07/18/monday-motorsports-stewart-hass-strengthens-case-for-nascar-chase/', 'snippet': 'The team logged a one-two finish at New Hampshire Motor Speedway, with the team principal Tony Stewart following Ryan Newman across the finish line.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Chase for the Cup does not begin in earnest until mid-September, yet with only the top 12 Nascar Sprint Cup drivers allowed to move on to the race series’ de facto postseason, every strong finish is critical. The teammates Ryan Newman and Tony Stewart did all they could to strengthen their Chase prospects on Sunday, finishing first and second, respectively, at New Hampshire Motor Speedway for Stewart-Hass Racing.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Monday Motorsports: Stewart-Hass Strengthens Case for Nascar Chase', 'kicker': 'Wheels', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobile Racing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nascar Sprint Cup Series', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Barnes, John', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Edwards, Carl', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hamilton, Lewis', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Johnson, Jimmie', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Newman, Ryan', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Stewart, Tony', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Stoner, Casey', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Webber, Mark', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wheldon, Dan', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'na