 me get through airport security with my shoes on and my personal dignity relatively intact.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/19/business/Road/Road-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 870, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/19/business/Road/Road-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/19/business/Road/Road-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Trying to Revive Trusted Traveler Program', 'kicker': 'On the Road', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Trying to Revive Trusted Traveler Program', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Transportation Security Administration', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'AIRPORTS', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Business Travel', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Security and Warning Systems', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'AIRLINES AND AIRPLANES', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-19T00:38:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Joe Sharkey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joe', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sharkey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9c8cac7d-70d1-594b-bd92-acfd7f05e87a', 'word_count': 694, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9c8cac7d-70d1-594b-bd92-acfd7f05e87a'}, {'abstract': 'Leaving Stony Brook after overseeing its transition to a major research institution, Mr. Toll oversaw a comparable expansion at the University of Maryland.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/19/nyregion/john-s-toll-dies-at-87-led-stony-brook-university.html', 'snippet': 'Leaving Stony Brook after overseeing its transition to a major research institution, Mr. Toll oversaw a comparable expansion at the University of Maryland.', 'lead_paragraph': 'John S. Toll, a physicist and educator who was president of Stony Brook University on Long Island during the public university building boom of the Rockefeller years, overseeing its transition from a state college with 1,700 students to a major research institution with an enrollment of 17,000, died on Friday in Bethesda, Md. He was 87.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/19/nyregion/TOLL-obit/TOLL-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 614, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/19/nyregion/TOLL-obit/TOLL-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/19/nyregion/TOLL-obit/TOLL-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'John S. Toll Dies at 87; Led Stony Brook University', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'John S. Toll, 87, Shaper Of Stony Brook University', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of Maryland', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'State University of New York at Stony Brook', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-19T0