oman shot people he believed were Arabs. A survivor of the attack, Rais Bhuiyan, is now petitioning to spare Mr. Stroman’s life.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/19/us/19questions.html', 'snippet': 'Enraged by the terrorist attacks of Sept. 11, 2001, Mark Anthony Stroman shot people he believed were Arabs. A survivor of the attack, Rais Bhuiyan, is now petitioning to spare Mr. Stroman’s life.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mark Anthony Stroman, 41, a stonecutter from Dallas, shot people he believed were Arabs, saying he was enraged by the terrorist attacks of Sept. 11, 2001. He killed at least two: Vasudev Patel, an Indian immigrant who was Hindu, and Waqar Hasan, a Muslim born in Pakistan.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/19/us/QUESTIONS/QUESTIONS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 737, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/19/us/QUESTIONS/QUESTIONS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/19/us/QUESTIONS/QUESTIONS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Hated and the Hater, Both Touched by Crime', 'kicker': 'Asked and Answered | Mark Anthony Stroman and Rais Bhuiyan', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Hated and the Hater, Both Touched by Crime', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'September 11 (2001)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Muslims and Islam', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Texas', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_da