 derivatives — long after the battle has subsided.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Remember the epic battle between CSX, the big railroad company, and the Children’s Investment Fund Management, a British hedge fund? If you do not, you are not alone. The United States Court of Appeals for the Second Circuit appears to have forgotten it as well. It took the federal court two years to give out its opinion deciding the litigation fight between the parties, in a ruling that came down on Monday that left some issues unsettled long after the battle subsided.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Anticlimax in Long-Running CSX Railroad Court Case', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Decisions and Verdicts', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Derivatives (Financial Instruments)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hedge Funds', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Children's Investment Fund", 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'CSX Corporation', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-19T19:22:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Steven Davidoff Solomon', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Steven', 'middlename': 'Davidoff', 'lastname': 'Solomon', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/835b306b-6c82-5402-bdf1-11ca6dca1403', 'word_count': 1353, 'uri': 'nyt://article/835b306b-6c82-5402-bdf1-11ca6dca1403'}, {'abstract': 'Eleven years after the documentary “Dark Days” was released, the film’s director Marc Singer revisits the train tunnel that once hosted a homeless community.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2011/07/19/movies/dark-days.html