'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/20/nyregion/columbia-university-student-admits-selling-drugs-on-campus.html', 'snippet': 'The main target of an undercover investigation on campus is expected to get jail, but his co-defendants face lesser charges and may not.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A Columbia University student who was the main target of an undercover investigation of a ring that sold drugs from the campus will be sentenced to six months in jail after pleading guilty Tuesday to selling cocaine.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/20/nyregion/columbia1/columbia1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/20/nyregion/columbia1/columbia1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/20/nyregion/columbia1/columbia1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 760, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/20/nyregion/columbia1/columbia1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/20/nyregion/columbia1/columbia1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Columbia Student Admits Selling Cocaine on Campus', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Columbia Student Admits Selling Cocaine on Campus', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drug Abuse and Traffic', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Columbia University', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'p