'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/42e25baf-6b36-58f5-b2e3-e798d2186a24', 'word_count': 864, 'uri': 'nyt://article/42e25baf-6b36-58f5-b2e3-e798d2186a24'}, {'abstract': 'After 18 months as Bank of America’s chief, Brian Moynihan hasn’t convinced investors that he is turning the bank around.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/20/business/time-running-out-for-bank-of-americas-chief.html', 'snippet': 'After 18 months as Bank of America’s chief, Brian Moynihan hasn’t convinced investors that he is turning the bank around.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Brian Moynihan, the chief of Bank of America, needs to kick it up a notch or two. He has spent much of his 18 months in the corner office cleaning up the mess left by his predecessor, Ken Lewis. But despite the yeoman efforts, he has failed to convince investors that he is turning the company around.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/20/business/Views/Views-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 973, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Time Running Out for a Bank Chief', 'kicker': 'Reuters Breakingviews', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Time Running Out For a Bank Chief', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bank of America Corporation', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Recession and Depression', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Moynihan, Brian T', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stocks and Bonds', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-20T01:44:30+0000', 'document_type': 'ar