l bus drivers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/20/nyregion/nyc-asks-cuomo-to-veto-job-seniority-bill.html', 'snippet': 'After years of support in court, the city now opposes extending certain hiring and seniority protections for school bus drivers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For the last three years, lawyers for the Bloomberg administration have argued in court alongside transportation union lawyers for the extension of unusual job protections for school bus drivers and other employees that can amount to lifetime job guarantees. But now that unlikely alliance is heading toward an abrupt end. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'City Asking Cuomo to Veto a Measure It Helped Write', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'City Asking Cuomo to Veto A Measure It Helped Write', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Organized Labor', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AMALGAMATED TRANSIT UNION', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bloomberg, Michael R', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cuomo, Andrew M', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Buses', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-20T02:11:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sharon Otterman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sharon', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Otterman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5ba722dd-935c-556a-be55-91faf313cd61', 'word_count': 912, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5ba722dd-935c-556a-be55-91faf313cd61'}, {'abstract': 'A Republican House member from Florida attacks a Democratic co