s, an Army scientist, prepared the deadly powder in his Army laboratory.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'U.S. Revises Its Response to Lawsuit on Anthrax', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'U.S. Revises Its Response To Lawsuit On Anthrax', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ANTHRAX', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Justice Department', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Bureau of Investigation', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ivins, Bruce E', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Laboratories and Scientific Equipment', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-20T02:19:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Scott Shane', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Scott', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shane', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f6511752-0d23-5aff-83d7-c74fe8ba31c4', 'word_count': 502, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f6511752-0d23-5aff-83d7-c74fe8ba31c4'}, {'abstract': 'The City Council rejects a recovery plan in an act of rebellion against state and county officials who repeatedly pushed its acceptance.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/20/us/20harrisburg.html', 'snippet': 'The City Council rejects a recovery plan in an act of rebellion against state and county officials who repeatedly pushed its acceptance.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HARRISBURG, Pa. — The City Council in this financially struggling city rejected a statesponsored recovery program on Tuesday, in an act of rebellion against state and county officials who had repeatedly pressured the city to accept it. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1