0c04'}, {'abstract': 'In testing, a first-of-its-kind diabetes drug raised safety concerns, including a possible increased risk of breast and bladder cancers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/20/business/diabetes-drug-dapagliflozin-rejected-by-fda-panel.html', 'snippet': 'In testing, a first-of-its-kind diabetes drug raised safety concerns, including a possible increased risk of breast and bladder cancers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A federal advisory committee voted 9 to 6 on Tuesday that a first-of-its-kind diabetes drug should not be approved for use because of safety concerns, including a possible increased risk of breast and bladder cancers.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Diabetes Drug Dapagliflozin Rejected by F.D.A. Panel', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Novel Diabetes Drug Is Rejected by an F.D.A. Panel', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Diabetes', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drugs (Pharmaceuticals)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bristol Myers Squibb Company', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AstraZeneca PLC', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Food and Drug Administration', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-20T02:35:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Pollack', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pollack', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b99d09cd-fcc2-5fc1-8a7a-d2a6b3a6bef5', 'word_count': 850, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b99d09cd-fcc2-5fc1-8a7a-d2a6b3a6bef5'}, {'abstract': 'A Pennsylvania homeowner and an Indiana golf course company filed a class-action lawsuit against DuPont saying the company was reckless in putting a new weed killer on the market.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/20/us/20brfs-SUITFILEDOVE_BRF.html', 'snippet': 'A Pennsylvania homeowner and an Indiana golf course company filed a class-action lawsuit against DuPont saying the company was reckless in putting a new weed killer on the market.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A Pennsylvania homeowner and an Indiana golf course company have filed a class-action lawsuit against DuPont charging that the company was negligent or reckless in putting a new weed killer on the market. The suit, filed Monday in federal court in Delaware, asserts that the herbicide, Imprelis, is killing trees, shrubs and ornamental plants across the country. It seeks compensation for all damage suffered as a result of applications of Imprelis, an injunction barring DuPont from selling the product and unspecified punitive damages. In a statement, DuPont said it was “confident that this purported class-action lawsuit is unfounded, and we will oppose it vigorously.” ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Delaware: Suit Filed Over Herbicide', 'kicker': 'National Briefing | MID-ATLANTIC', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Delaware: DuPont Is Sued Over Herbicide', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defoliants and Herbicides', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suits and Litigation', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Delaware', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-20T02:35:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Joanna M. Foster', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joanna', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/6d125adc-4e3f-5768-9445-acd6c9e9e03c', 'word_count': 105, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6d125adc-4e3f-5768-9445-acd6c9e9e03c'}, {'abstract': 'The Murdoch empire pandered to the lowest common denominator, but its tactics turned out to be too low for a repulsed British public.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/20/opinion/20dowd.html', 'snippet': 'The Murdoch empire pandered to the lowest common denominator, but its tactics turned out to be too low for a repulsed British public.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Right before a clown threw blue shaving cream on Rupert Murdoch and Murdoch’s pink-clad wife threw a roundhouse at the clown, the most powerful media mogul in history was reminiscing about his father.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '27', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/02/opinion/maureen-dowd/maureen-dowd-articleLarge.png', 'height': 300, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/02/opinion/maureen-dowd/maureen-dowd-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 300}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/02/opinion/maureen-dowd/maureen-dowd-jumbo.png', 'height': 512, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/02/opinion/maureen-dowd/maureen-dowd-superJumbo.png', 'height': 1000, 'width': 2000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/02/opinion/maureen-dowd/maureen-dowd-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', '