ar testimony on the time that the Boston crime boss James (Whitey) Bulger and his girlfriend, Catherine Greig, spent evading the authorities, living under aliases.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/20/us/20brfs-INQUIRYINTOL_BRF.html', 'snippet': 'A federal grand jury is to hear testimony on the time that the Boston crime boss James (Whitey) Bulger and his girlfriend, Catherine Greig, spent evading the authorities, living under aliases.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A federal grand jury is to hear testimony on the time that the Boston crime boss James (Whitey) Bulger and his girlfriend, Catherine Greig, spent evading the authorities, living under aliases in a Santa Monica apartment a few blocks from the beach. Joshua Bond, the property manager of the building where Mr. Bulger and Ms. Greig lived since the late 1990s, said he received a subpoena last week asking him to appear in federal court in Boston next week. Mr. Bulger and Ms. Greig used the aliases Charles and Carol Gasko while they lived in Santa Monica, paying their $1,165 rent for their two-bedroom, rent-controlled apartment in cash. A tip led the F.B.I. to their apartment, and agents said they found guns, a hand grenade, handcuffs and $822,000 in cash hidden inside the walls. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'California: Inquiry Into Life on the Run', 'kicker': 'National Briefing | WEST', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'California: Inquiry Into Life on the Run', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Greig, Catherine Elizabeth', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bulger, James J', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-20T02:38:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jennifer Medina', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jennifer', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Medina', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'rep