pe_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e4cb90b9-e9c0-57ca-9720-b82f4451a055', 'word_count': 631, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e4cb90b9-e9c0-57ca-9720-b82f4451a055'}, {'abstract': 'In a follow-up to their “History of Rap,” Mr. Fallon and Mr. Timberlake rhyme their way through a medley of hip-hop hits by Kurtis Blow, Biz Markie, Lil Wayne and more.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/07/20/a-second-helping-of-hip-hop-history-from-justin-timberlake-and-jimmy-fallon/', 'snippet': 'In a follow-up to their “History of Rap,” Mr. Fallon and Mr. Timberlake rhyme their way through a medley of hip-hop hits by Kurtis Blow, Biz Markie, Lil Wayne and more.', 'lead_paragraph': '“It’s not going to happen — we can’t do it again,” Justin Timberlake told the audience at “Late Night With Jimmy Fallon,” who at Tuesday’s show were perhaps expecting a reprise of “The History of Rap,” a 2010 performance in which he and Mr. Fallon rhymed their way from the Sugarhill Gang to Jay-Z and Alicia Keys, and in the process created a popular viral video.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Second Helping of Hip-Hop History From Justin Timberlake and Jimmy Fallon', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Rap and Hip-Hop', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fallon, Jimmy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Timberlake, Justin', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-20T11:16:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dave Itzkoff', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dave', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Itzkoff', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d9086d9b-b036-52f5-92b9-1cc3672449f8', 'word_count': 124, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d9086d9b-b036-52f5-92b9-1cc3672449f8'}, {'abstract': 'While other financial firms got weighed down by mortgage liabilities, trading misses and other problems, BlackRock produced double-digit gains in both revenue and profit.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2011/07/20/blackrock-profit-rises-25-to-578-million/', 'snippet': 'While other financial firms got weighed down by mortgage liabilities, trading misses and other problems, BlackRock produced double-digit gains in both revenue and profit.', 'lead_paragraph': '8:38 p.m. | Updated ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'BlackRock Profit Rises 25%, to $578 Million', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Company Reports', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fink, Laurence D', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'BlackRock Inc', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-20T11:27:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Susanne Craig', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Susanne', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Craig', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6397dfff-6387-524e-a8e9-007676ec265e', 'word_count': 577, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6397dfff-6387-524e-a8e9-007676ec265e'}, {'abstract': 'The deal, which values Nalco Holding at $38.80 a share, is about 32 above the water treatment company’s closing price on Tuesday.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2011/07/20/ecolab-to-buy-nalco-for-5-4-billion/', 'snippet': 'The deal, which values Nalco Holding at $38.80 a share, is about 32 above the water treatment company’s closing price on Tuesday.', 'lead_paragraph': '10:18 a.m. | Updated ', 'source': 'The New Y