 for treating multiple sclerosis about 10 times more than what would be considered cost-effective.', 'web_url': 'https://prescriptions.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/07/20/study-examines-high-drug-costs-vs-benefits-for-m-s-patients/', 'snippet': 'A new study finds the costs of bio-tech drugs for treating multiple sclerosis about 10 times more than what would be considered cost-effective.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The biotech drugs used to treat multiple sclerosis produce health benefits that come at an exorbitant cost, according to a new study published on Wednesday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Study Examines High Drug Costs vs. Benefits for M.S. Patients', 'kicker': 'Prescriptions', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drugs (Pharmaceuticals)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Multiple Sclerosis', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prices (Fares, Fees and Rates)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-20T20:34:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Pollack', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pollack', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/972ff491-c6cf-5221-a5ad-c1b21005a2e1', 'word_count': 769, 'uri': 'nyt://article/972ff491-c6cf-5221-a5ad-c1b21005a2e1'}, {'abstract': 'N.Y. See: Daniel Webster gets a good cleaning in Central Park.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/07/20/central-park-915-a-m/', 'snippet': 'N.Y. See: Daniel Webster gets a good cleaning in Central Park.', 'lead_paragraph': '', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Central Park, 9:15 A.M.', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_