y steps they took were based on their own beliefs about the need for a peaceful resolution of the conflict in Kashmir.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/21/us/politics/21agent.html', 'snippet': 'Some members of Congress said they were unaware of the plot, and said any steps they took were based on their own beliefs about the need for a peaceful resolution of the conflict in Kashmir.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Last summer, half a dozen lawmakers met on Capitol Hill with a group of Pakistani-Americans and foreign visitors to discuss long-stalled efforts to negotiate peace in Kashmir, the border region claimed by both Pakistan and India. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Lawmakers Say Pakistani Plot Did Not Influence Actions', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Lawmakers Say Pakistani Plot Did Not Influence Actions', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Kashmiri American Council', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Kashmir and Jammu (India)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Inter-Services Intelligence', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fai, Syed Ghulam Nabi', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Pakistan', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'India', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Relations', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-21T02:06:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Eric Lipton', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Eric', 'middlename':