n-homers-in-mets-victory-over-cardinals.html', 'snippet': 'Carlos Beltran, who has drawn interest as the trade deadline approaches, hit his 15th homer in the fifth, and Angel Pagan’s homer in the 10th won the game.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With a full count and two outs in the fifth inning Wednesday night, Carlos Beltran walloped a pitch from the St. Louis right-hander Kyle McClellan. The ball soared far over the head of right fielder Jon Jay and dropped halfway into the second deck at Citi Field.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/21/sports/Mets-2/Mets-2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 922, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/21/sports/Mets-2/Mets-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/21/sports/Mets-2/Mets-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Beltran’s Homer Earns Cheers; Pagan’s Wins Game', 'kicker': 'Mets 6, Cardinals 5 (10 Innings)', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Amid Trade Rumors, Beltran Continues Hot Hitting', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pagan, Angel', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Mets', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Beltran, Carlos', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'St Louis Cardinals', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-21T03:33:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dave Caldwell', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dave', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Caldwell', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fd1512ff-e9b3-5a93-8e97-475ea9a4c88a', 'word_count': 856, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fd1512ff-e9b3-5a93-8e97-475ea9a4c88a'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Orsini cultivated an atmosphere of dolce vita that made his restaurant Orsini’s, on East 56th Street, a famous hangout in the 1960s.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/21/nyregion/armando-orsini-a-new-york-restaurateur-dies-at-88.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Orsini cultivated an atmosphere of dolce vita that made his restaurant Orsini’s, on East 56th Street, a famous hangout in the 1960s.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Armando Orsini, a New York restaurant owner whose good looks and Continental courtliness defined the atmosphere of dolce vita that made Orsini’s, on West 56th Street, a favorite hangout in the 1960s of movie stars, society people and diners willing to pay dearly to sit near them in velvety darkness, died on July 13 in Asheville, N.C. He was 88.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '25', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/21/nyregion/ORSINI-obit/ORSINI-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/21/nyregion/ORSINI-obit/ORSINI-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/21/nyregion/ORSINI-obit/ORSINI-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/21/nyregion/ORSINI-obit/ORSINI