 Web:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Wheelies: The Charge-Level Edition', 'kicker': 'Wheels', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AMERICAN AUTOMOBILE ASSN', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Chrysler LLC', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Energy Department', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'General Motors', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Mercedes-Benz', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Nissan Motor Co', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Toyota Motor Corp', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United Automobile Workers', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'ZipCar', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-21T16:37:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cea78322-8c38-59a6-88f4-ec079d9c9d9f', 'word_count': 465, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cea78322-8c38-59a6-88f4-ec079d9c9d9f'}, {'abstract': 'The awe of discovering the human body. The honor of being trusted to give advice. The gratitude for helping someone through a difficult illness. These things never grow old.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/07/21/why-would-anyone-choose-to-become-a-doctor/', 'snippet': 'The awe of discovering the human body. The honor of being trusted to give advice. The gratitude for helping someone through a difficult illness. These things never grow old.', 'lead_paragraph': 'You hear it all the time from doctors — they would never choose medicine if the