tml', 'snippet': 'N.F.L. owners ratified a 10-year proposal that will end the four-month-long lockout next Wednesday, with one big condition: the players have to re-form their union and approve the deal themselves.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ATLANTA — N.F.L. owners ratified a 10-year proposal on Thursday afternoon that would end the four-month-long lockout next Wednesday, with one big condition: the players have to re-form their union in coming days and approve the deal themselves. The players have until Tuesday to vote.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/22/sports/y-jp-nfl/y-jp-nfl-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 369, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/22/sports/y-jp-nfl/y-jp-nfl-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 369}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/22/sports/y-jp-nfl/y-jp-nfl-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'N.F.L. Owners Vote for Tentative Labor Deal', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Owners Vote in Favor of Tentative Labor Deal', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Collective Bargaining', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Football League Players Assn', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Lockouts', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Smith, DeMaurice', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Organized Labor', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Football League', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '