unt': 1395, 'uri': 'nyt://article/45630049-2368-57dc-87a1-d180a0f4f3ee'}, {'abstract': 'As an economic boom continues in the Turkish capital, inventive local cooking is on the rise.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/07/21/eurofile-istanbuls-latest-hot-table/', 'snippet': 'As an economic boom continues in the Turkish capital, inventive local cooking is on the rise.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Among the world’s great kitchens, Turkish cooking may be more mauled than even Mexican when cooked off its home turf. Nearly every major city in the world has a mediocre kebab stand that is a sad substitute for the brilliantly regional cuisines of Turkey. This is why I always show up in Istanbul with a carefully plotted meal plan — the dearth of really good Turkish restaurants outside of Turkey means there are just so many dishes I don’t want to miss eating again before I go home.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Eurofile | Istanbul’s Latest Hot Table', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-07-21T19:04:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alexander Lobrano', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alexander', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lobrano', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f09f5ad9-4cbc-5939-9859-6c9cf3340a16', 'word_count': 586, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f09f5ad9-4cbc-5939-9859-6c9cf3340a16'}, {'abstract': "Patrick Healy on London's culture of pub theaters, and Brian Stelter discusses Nickelodeon's rebroadcasting hits from the 90s.", 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/arts/100000000958567/artsbeat-july-21-2011.html', 'snippet': "Patrick Healy on London's culture of pub theaters, and Brian Stelter discusses Nickelodeon's 