: 'nyt://article/cf9b0096-1404-54ce-9d4e-4b50d1c47464'}, {'abstract': 'Luckily for aspiring musical theater performers in New York, some big Broadway names offer encouraging, tough-love-based 10-minute apprenticeships.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/22/theater/master-classes-with-masters-like-raul-esparza.html', 'snippet': 'Luckily for aspiring musical theater performers in New York, some big Broadway names offer encouraging, tough-love-based 10-minute apprenticeships.', 'lead_paragraph': 'IN the Terrence McNally play “Master Class,” the opera diva Maria Callas (played by Tyne Daly) understands pedagogy to mean wiping the floor with young students’ ambitions.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '28', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/22/arts/22MASTERspan/22MASTERspan-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/22/arts/22MASTERspan/22MASTERspan-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/22/arts/22MASTERspan/22MASTER2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 658, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/22/arts/22MASTERspan/22MASTERspan-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/22/arts/22MASTERspan/22MASTERspan-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Inside a Master Class: Breathe, Punctuate, Forget Led Zeppelin', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Inside a Master Class: Breathe, Punctuate, Forget Led Zeppelin', 'name': None, 'seo': No