s Confrontation on West Bank', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Palestinians', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "B'Tselem", 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'YouTube.com', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Israel', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'West Bank', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-21T22:06:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Elizabeth A. Harris', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Elizabeth', 'middlename': 'A.', 'lastname': 'Harris', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e00316d9-cdf5-5b07-b45b-70d49a0e2718', 'word_count': 436, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e00316d9-cdf5-5b07-b45b-70d49a0e2718'}, {'abstract': 'In “The Captains,” a documentary making its debut on Friday on Epix, William Shatner interviews the five actors who succeeded him on “Star Trek” and its spinoffs.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/22/arts/television/william-shatner-in-the-captains-review.html', 'snippet': 'In “The Captains,” a documentary making its debut on Friday on Epix, William Shatner interviews the five actors who succeeded him on “Star Trek” and its spinoffs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Sitting in a starship captain’s chair is a big job. Making a documentary about the actors whose posteriors have occupied that hallowed space through four decades of “Star Trek” and its spin-offs takes a big man. Thank the Vulcan gods that William Shatner was available.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/22/arts/TREK-1/TR