arrish, might stymie a calculus expert.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SOUTHAMPTON, N.Y. — “Throughout my life I have been able to see in my mind’s eye the painting I want to paint and the path I need to take to get there,” the artist Dorothea Rockburne has said. At 78, she is having her first full-dress retrospective, “Dorothea Rockburne: In My Mind’s Eye,” at the Parrish Art Museum here. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/22/arts/22galleriesspan/22galleriesspan-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/22/arts/22galleriesspan/22galleriesspan-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/22/arts/22galleriesspan/22galleriesspan-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/22/arts/22galleriesspan/22galleriesspan-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/22/arts/22galleriesspan/22galleriesspan-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'From Theorems and Numbers, the Geometry of a Diverse Career', 'kicker': 'Art Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'From Theorems and Numbers, the Geometry of a Diverse Career', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rockburne, Dorothea', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Parrish Art Museum', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': '