ays after being dropped to accommodate Brett Gardner, whose .621 on-base percentage since the All-Star break earned him a promotion to the top of the order. Manager Joe Girardi hinted at such a change Wednesday, and on Thursday he suggested that he might maintain that configuration against right-handed pitching.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Change at the Top Has Jeter Following Gardner in the Yanks’ Lineup', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Jeter Leaves Leadoff Spot For Gardner', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Girardi, Joe', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gardner, Brett', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Tampa Bay Rays', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jeter, Derek', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-22T01:24:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Shpigel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shpigel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/34cf114b-0bc7-5b41-83d1-779610f376c0', 'word_count': 758, 'uri': 'nyt://article/34cf114b-0bc7-5b41-83d1-779610f376c0'}, {'abstract': 'The parents of Leiby Kletzky set up a memorial fund and released a statement urging people to give to charity in the memory of their son.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/22/nyregion/kletzky-family-sets-up-fund-to-honor-slain-son.html', 'snippet': 'The parents of Leiby Kletzky set up a memorial fund and released a statement urging