 turn to Dialogue Books, a new English-language book store from Sharmaine Lovegrove. At Dialogue (Schonleinstrasse 31; 49-30-627-35111; www.dialoguebooks.org), which opened in May in Berlin’s Kreuzberg neighborhood, you may be greeted by Ms. Lovegrove’s smile and charming British accent. And as her self-proclaimed title of “book doctor” indicates, she’s happy to help you find exactly the book you are looking for. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '‘Book Doctor’ Opens English-Language Book Store in Berlin', 'kicker': 'In Transit', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Book Trade and Publishing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Berlin (Germany)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-22T10:00:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By Veronica Zaragovia', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Veronica', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Zaragovia', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4dc4d6c4-8071-50dc-9346-b7117ed317f3', 'word_count': 175, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4dc4d6c4-8071-50dc-9346-b7117ed317f3'}, {'abstract': 'The sports-car manufacturer selected a team from Seoul as the winner of its long-running design competition.', 'web_url': 'https://wheels.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/07/22/for-its-future-shape-ferrari-turns-the-reins-over-to-design-students/', 'snippet': 'The sports-car manufacturer selected a team from Seoul as the winner of its long-running design competition.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ferrari’s long-running and highly competitive World Design Contest came to an end this week, as winners were named at the automaker’s headquarters in Maranello, Italy