ole': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b4f99286-b942-5818-8d3c-9ba2bd025fae', 'word_count': 1029, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b4f99286-b942-5818-8d3c-9ba2bd025fae'}, {'abstract': 'Desktop shortcuts can save time and the Google Chrome browser includes a feature to quickly create shortcuts for your most frequently used Web sites and apps.', 'web_url': 'https://gadgetwise.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/07/22/tip-of-the-week-making-shortcuts-in-chrome/', 'snippet': 'Desktop shortcuts can save time and the Google Chrome browser includes a feature to quickly create shortcuts for your most frequently used Web sites and apps.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Desktop shortcuts can save time, and the Google Chrome browser includes a feature to quickly create shortcuts for your most frequently used Web sites and apps. To make one for a site or an app in the Chrome window, click the wrench icon in the toolbar, go to the Tools menu and choose the “Create application shortcuts” option. Select where on the computer you want to store the shortcut (like the desktop, Start menu or taskbar) and click the Create button.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Tip of the Week: Making Shortcuts in Chrome', 'kicker': 'Gadgetwise', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Chrome (Browser)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Google Inc', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-22T10:25:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'subsection_name': 'Personal Tech', 'byline': {'original': 'By J.d. Biersdorfer', 'person': [{'firstname': '', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ad4bee