abstract': 'A surfer can hit the waves and camp in high style on state beaches.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/24/travel/a-surfers-tour-of-california-beaches.html', 'snippet': 'A surfer can hit the waves and camp in high style on state beaches.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THE freeway was dark. Wisps of sea mist obscured the moon. At 2 a.m. there wasn’t another car on Highway 101, the southern extension of the Pacific Coast Highway that traces the edge of the continent from Orange County in California almost to the Oregon border. On the left side of the road as I drove south, miles of tract housing reached into the hills. Somewhere on the right, between the guardrail and the great void of the Pacific, was the entrance to the San Elijo campground.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/24/travel/24EXPLORER1_span/24EXPLORER1_span-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/24/travel/24EXPLORER1_span/24EXPLORER1_span-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/24/travel/24EXPLORER1_span/explorer-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/24/travel/24EXPLORER1_span/24EXPLORER1_span-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/24/travel/24EXPLORER1_span/24EXPLORER1_span-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Surfing and ‘Roughing It’ on Southern California Beaches', 'kicker': 'Explorer', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Where Campfire Smoke Meets the Surf', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Surfing', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Camps and Camping', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'California', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-22T18:55:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Travel', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By Porter Fox', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Porter', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fox', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/62671c48-b0c5-5b6f-a181-ae499d94a351', 'word_count': 1674, 'uri': 'nyt://article/62671c48-b0c5-5b6f-a181-ae499d94a351'}, {'abstract': 'The 21-room hotel in a 1938 nautical Art Deco building is a new boutique choice in town.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/24/travel/hotel-review-don-hotel-in-montevideo-uruguay.html', 'snippet': 'The 21-room hotel in a 1938 nautical Art Deco building is a new boutique choice in town.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THE UPSHOT', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/24/travel/24SUBCHECK-IN_SPAN/24SUBCHECK-IN_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/24/travel/24SUBCHECK-IN_SPAN/24SUBCHECK-IN_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/24/travel/24SUBCHECK-IN_SPAN/24SUBCHECK-IN_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 680, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_n