or of Attack Leads Nuclear Effort in Iran', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Survivor of Attack Accelerates Iran’s Effort to Produce Nuclear Material', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iran', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Abbasi, Fereydoon', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nuclear Weapons', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Uranium', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-22T20:03:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By David E. Sanger and William J. Broad', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': 'E.', 'lastname': 'Sanger', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'William', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'Broad', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/979487b7-c680-57b7-ba2f-f38514b29015', 'word_count': 1089, 'uri': 'nyt://article/979487b7-c680-57b7-ba2f-f38514b29015'}, {'abstract': 'Mark Bittman makes his favorite easy summer jam, which is fruitier, and less cloying, that its grocery-store counterparts.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/dining/100000000773810/blueberry-jam.html', 'snippet': 'Mark Bittman makes his favorite easy summer jam, which is fruitier, and less cloying, that its grocery-store counterparts.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mark Bittman makes his favorite easy summer jam, which is fruitier, and less cloying, that its grocery-store counterparts.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/04/fashion/video-summerjams/video-summerjams-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subTyp