e their family structure and the status of their children.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/24/fashion/weddings/gay-marriage-for-the-sake-of-the-children.html', 'snippet': 'Some gay couples with children are getting married to validate their family structure and the status of their children.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WHEN Douglas Robinson and Michael Elsasser moved in together 25 years ago, they bought matching bands, layered in white, rose and yellow gold, and said private, personal vows.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/24/fashion/24MOTHERLODE/24MOTHERLODE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 681, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/24/fashion/24MOTHERLODE/24MOTHERLODE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/24/fashion/24MOTHERLODE/24MOTHERLODE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'For the Sake of the Children', 'kicker': 'Motherlode', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'For the Sake of the Children', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Same-Sex Marriage, Civil Unions and Domestic Partnerships', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Marriages', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Families and Family Life', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-22T21:20:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'subsection_name': 'Weddings', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lisa Belkin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lisa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Belkin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9f6abf5b-138a-5132-881c-7d775c836558', 'word_count': 1429, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9f6abf5b-138a-5132-881c-7d775c836558'}, {'abstract': 'What does marriage change when you have raised children together for so many years?', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/07/22/gay-and-married-with-children/', 'snippet': 'What does marriage change when you have raised children together for so many years?', 'lead_paragraph': 'Among the 823 couples who plan to marry in New York City on Sunday are many with children. Odds are they have filled out a lot of legal documents already — to adopt and provide health care for their children, to establish guardianship, to smooth inheritance. What does this additional legal step mean, or not, when you have been raising children together for years, even decades? ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Gay and Married with Children', 'kicker': 'Motherlode', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Children and Youth', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Homosexuality', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Marriages', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Same-Sex Marriage, Civil Unions and Domestic Partnerships', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-22T21:21:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lisa Belkin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lisa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Belkin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f9253943-b77f-59be-8680-5628278f9e6f', 'word_count': 217, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f9253943-b77f-59be-8680-5628278f9e6f'}, {'abstract': 'Camera crews for the Smithsonian Channel’s series “Aerial America” go to great lengths (and heights) for the perfect shot.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/24/arts/television/aerial-america-on-smithsonian-channel.html', 'snippet': 'Camera crews for the Smithsonian Channel’s series “Aerial America” go to great lengths (and heights) for the perfect shot.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PASS CHRISTIAN, Miss.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/24/arts/24AIR1/24AIR1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 335, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/24/arts/24AIR1/24AIR1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 335}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/24/arts/24AIR1/24AIR1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 575, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Amber Waves, From Spacious Skies', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Amber Waves, From Spacious Skies', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Smithsonian Channel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-22T21:24:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Arts&Leisure', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brian Stelter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stelter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/87eb4912-dad9-5add-b132-285287465a51', 'word_count': 1267, 'uri': 'nyt://article/87eb4912-dad9-5add-b132-285287465a51'}, {'abstract': 'Last night, Helmut Lang’s Michael and Nicole Colovos and T’s Sally Singer launched the annual Prospect Park Summer Soirée.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/07/22/fete-accompli-soiree-from-outer-space/', 'snippet': 'Last night, Helmut Lang’s Michael and Nicole Colovos and T’s Sally Singer launched the annual Prospect Park Summer Soirée.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Organizers of the annual Prospect Park Summer Soirée could not have picked a better night to throw a retro space-themed party. The landing of the Atlantis early Thursday morning, which marked the end of NASA’s shuttle program, and by extension, the end of an era in space exploration, had everyone thinking about starships and galaxies. If entering the event’s space, a charming 1905 Beaux Arts-style boathouse, to music from “2001: A Space Odyssey” felt a bit kitschy, well, so was the ’70s space-age-inspired look that prompted the party. Call it cosmic, but it worked.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Fête Accompli | Soirée From Outer Space', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-07-22T21:26:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jane Herman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jane', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Herman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f78d97aa-f78f-58c6-b281-7bb844dde1b9', 'word_count': 220, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f78d97aa-f78f-58c6-b281-7bb844dde1b9'}, {'abstract': 'A San Francisco ceremony for Simon Doonan and Jonathan Adler defies expectations: It’s low-key.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/24/fashion/weddings/for-simon-doonan-and-jonathan-adler-skipping-the-sequins-at-a-gay-wedding.html', 'snippet': 'A San Francisco ceremony for Simon Doonan and Jonathan Adler defies expectations: It’s low-key.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MY parents, Betty and Terry Doonan, met in a Royal Air Force soup kitchen at the end of World War II. They had both run away from home a few years prior and were disinclined to return to their respective birthplaces. ', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/24/fashion/24DOONAN_SPAN/24DOONAN_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/24/fashion/24DOONAN_SPAN/24DOONAN_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/24/fashion/24DOONAN_SPAN/24DOONAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/24/fashion/24DOONAN_SPAN/24DOONAN_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/24/fashion/24DOONAN_SPAN/24DOONAN_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Wedding? Oh, Yes, We Did That, Too', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Wedding? Oh, Yes, We Did That, Too', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weddings and Engagements', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Same-Sex Marriage, Civil Unions and Domestic Partnerships', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Marriages', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {