ings/a-lesbian-couple-looking-for-a-place-to-settle-state-of-the-unions.html', 'snippet': 'Leslie Klotz and Mary McBride had a commitment ceremony but plan to marry.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WHEN Mary McBride met Leslie Klotz at a Christmas party in 2005, Ms. McBride was 37 and living in Brooklyn in an unrenovated and mostly unfurnished loft. She had a picnic table, a bed, a guitar, some blue jeans and an enormous poster of Dolly Parton on the wall. That was enough. ', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/24/fashion/24UNIONSRINGS/24UNIONSRINGS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 977, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/24/fashion/24UNIONSRINGS/24UNIONSRINGS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/24/fashion/24UNIONSRINGS/24UNIONSRINGS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Seeking a Place to Settle, Without Being Too Settled', 'kicker': 'State of the Unions', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Seeking a Place to Settle, Without Being Too Settled', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Same-Sex Marriage, Civil Unions and Domestic Partnerships', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weddings and Engagements', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-22T21:37:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Society', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'subsection_name': 'Weddings', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lois Smith Brady', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lois', 'middlename': 'Smith', 'lastname': 'Brady', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b19d4fd2-9055-5352-8646-79a0a3130b52', 'word_count': 1162, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b19d4fd2-9055-5352-8646-79a0a3130b52'}, {'abstract': 'He said he’ll be cooking the sort of food that’s made him famous at LudoBites.', 'web_url': 'https://dinersjournal.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/07/22/ludovic-lefebvre-hopes-to-open-in-new-york-as-early-as-fall/', 'snippet': 'He said he’ll be cooking the sort of food that’s made him famous at LudoBites.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ludovic Lefebvre, whose LudoBites is the most acclaimed rootless restaurant in Los Angeles, has told the Feast that he is hoping to open a place in New York as early as November. He said he and his wife, Kristine, have looked throughout the city.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Ludovic Lefebvre Hopes to Open in New York as Early as Fall', 'kicker': 'Diner&#039;s Journal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-07-22T21:42:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c8350a03-0dac-5859-b137-c3568bfd08c5', 'word_count': 258, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c8350a03-0dac-5859-b137-c3568bfd08c5'}, {'abstract': 'The brown butter cobbler/cake can be made with any summer fruit.', 'web_url': 'https://dinersjournal.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/07/22/a-great-way-to-eat-your-fruit/', 'snippet': 'The brown butter cobbler/cake can be made with any summer fruit.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This brown butter cake is a happy landing pad for almost any summer fruit. Try it with apricots, sweet cherries, berries (a mix would be perfect) or plums. As long as the fruit is juicy and soft, it will work. The juicy factor, however, does rule out apples and most pears unless you poach or sauté them first\xa0— a good thing to keep in mind if you’re saving this recipe for fall.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Great Way to Eat Your Fruit', 'kicker': 'Diner&#039;s Journal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cakes', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fruit', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-22T21:45:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Melissa Clark', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Melissa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Clark', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ec02eaf4-a815-5009-a607-171794b198b6', 'word_count': 114, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ec02eaf4-a815-5009-a607-171794b198b6'}, {'abstract': 'A wedding, years later, for a couple who met as high school students.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/24/fashion/weddings/deborah-hetrick-matthew-groff-weddings.html', 'snippet': 'A wedding, years later, for a couple who met as high school students.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Deborah Marie Hetrick and Matthew Lawrence Groff were married Friday in Fort Tryon Park in New York. Philip B. Jones, a friend of the bride, who became a Universal Life minister for the occasion, officiated.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Deborah Hetrick, Matthew Groff', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Deborah Hetrick, Matthew Groff', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weddings and Engagements', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-22T21:46:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Society', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'subsection_name': 'Weddings', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/06458cbd-f5a8-55ad-bff7-fb5db60f0e96', 'word_count': 144, 'uri': 'nyt://article/06458cbd-f5a8-55ad-bff7-fb5db60f0e96'}, {'abstract': 'The bride is a freelance travel writer; the bridegroom is an account management associate at a hedge fund.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/24/fashion/weddings/rebecca-bergman-whitney-bull-weddings.html', 'snippet': 'The bride is a freelance travel writer; the bridegroom is an account management associate at a hedge fund.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Rebecca Sophia Bergman, a daughter of Ann B. Bergman of Seattle and Dr. Abraham B. Bergman of Vashon Island, Wash., was married Saturday to Whitney Allard Bull, the son of Peggy Risom Bull and Dr. Sherman M. Bull of New Canaan, Conn. Dr. Raleigh Bowden, a friend of the family and a Universal Life minister, officiated at the Sleeping Lady, a resort in Leavenworth, Wash.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/24/fashion/weddings/24BERGMANjpg/24BERGMANjpg-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 515, 'width': 816, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/24/fashion/weddings/24BERGMANjpg/24BERGMANjpg-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/24/fashion/weddings/24BERGMANjpg/24BERGMANjpg-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Rebecca Bergman, Whitney Bull', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Rebecca Bergman, Whitney Bull', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weddings and Engagements', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-22T21:46:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Society', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'subsection_name': 'Weddings', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2bc4be89-4070-52a4-8260-62ea808cd39a', 'word_count': 220, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2bc4be89-4070-52a4-8260-62ea808cd39a'}, {'abstract': 'The couple are married on the campus of the University of Illinois at Urbana, where they met.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/24/fashion/weddings/ashley-mitek-travis-mcdade-weddings.html', 'snippet': 'The couple are married on the campus of the University of Illinois at Urbana, where they met.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Dr. Ashley Elaine Mitek, the daughter of Shelley E. Mitek and Mark M. Mitek of Derwood, Md., was married Saturday to Travis Wesley McDade, a son of Bonnie Kay McDade and Richard L. McDade of Arcola, Ill. The bride’s father, who became a Universal Life minister for the occasion, officiated at Smith Hall on the campus of the University of Illinois at Urbana. ', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Ashley Mitek, Travis McDade', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Ashley Mitek, Travis McDade', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weddings and Engagements', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-22T21:46:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Society', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'subsection_name': 'Weddings', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f6f685c2-4c97-59bf-9735-a7395f449ad1', 'word_count': 167, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f6f685c2-4c97-59bf-9735-a7395f449ad1'}, {'abstr