 to nursing duty in Queens and the security workers and European tourists off to Kennedy Airport: young men with bagged surfboards dangling from their shoulders. Out to the Rockaways in Queens they ride, mostly getting off at Broad Channel, changing for the shuttle to the main break at Beach 90th Street, where new waterfront condominiums overlook rows of Dutch Colonials and enormous apartment complexes jut out to the shoreline far into the distance. ', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Riding the Rails to Ride the Waves', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Riding the Rails To Ride the Waves', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Surfing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Rockaway Beach (NYC)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-23T01:06:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Diane Cardwell', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Diane', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cardwell', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ee9c0436-4d2e-5996-8867-c66989c2df79', 'word_count': 307, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ee9c0436-4d2e-5996-8867-c66989c2df79'}, {'abstract': 'The power of Fitch, Standard & Poor’s or Moody’s Investors Service to cut a government’s debt rating has given the agencies a pivotal role in the worldwide financial drama.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/23/business/global/in-the-debt-drama-ratings-agencies-play-starring-role.html', 'snippet': 'The power of Fitch, Standard & Poor’s or Moody’s Investors Service to cut a government’s debt rating has given the agencies a pivotal role in the worldwide financial drama.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This summer, David Riley is one of the world’s most po