y/dodd-frank-backers-clash-with-currency-chief-walsh.html', 'snippet': 'Consumer advocates criticize John Walsh, acting comptroller of the currency, for trying to soften a wide range of provisions of the financial regulatory overhaul.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — John Walsh voiced the frustrations of many bankers when he warned in a speech last month that federal regulators were not paying attention to the cumulative impact of new rules and restrictions, jeopardizing the ability of banks to support economic growth.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/23/business/Bank/Bank-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 833, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/23/business/Bank/Bank-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/23/business/Bank/Bank-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Dodd-Frank Backers Clash With Regulator', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Dodd-Frank Backers Clash With Regulator', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dodd-Frank Wall Street Reform and Consumer Protection Act (2010)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Office of the Comptroller of the Currency', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Walsh, John Edward', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Regulation and Deregulation of Industry', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 6,