bstract': 'The Yankees’ 17-7 victory over Oakland on Friday will probably be best remembered for the oven-like setting, and all that came with it.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/23/sports/baseball/yankees-struggle-through-heat-to-beat-athletics.html', 'snippet': 'The Yankees’ 17-7 victory over Oakland on Friday will probably be best remembered for the oven-like setting, and all that came with it.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As humidity enveloped commuters and the sun baked the city’s sidewalks, the Yankees struggled through the heat like other New Yorkers on Friday afternoon while they prepared to go to work in their return to Yankee Stadium.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/23/sports/yankees-floater/yankees-floater-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 830, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/23/sports/yankees-floater/yankees-floater-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/23/sports/yankees-floater/yankees-floater-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Heat, Humidity and Concern for Hughes, but the Yankees’ Offense Rolls', 'kicker': 'Yankees 17, Athletics 7', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Heat, Humidity and Concern for Hughes, but the Yankees’ Offense Rolls', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weather', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Teixeira, Mark', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Swisher, Nick', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Oakland Athletics', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': '