ate.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/23/us/23sundlun.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Sundlun cut a larger-than-life figure that seemed inversely proportional to the size of his state.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Bruce G. Sundlun, a former Democratic governor of Rhode Island whose tenure was marked by dramatic events both public and private, including a statewide banking crisis on his first day in office and a lawsuit — happily resolved — by a Midwestern teenager who said she was his daughter, died on Thursday at his home in Jamestown, R.I. He was 91.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/23/us/SUNDLUN-obit/SUNDLUN-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 956, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/23/us/SUNDLUN-obit/SUNDLUN-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/23/us/SUNDLUN-obit/SUNDLUN-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Bruce Sundlun, Rhode Island Governor With Flair, Dies at 91', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Bruce Sundlun, 91, Rhode Island Governor With Flair', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Governors (US)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Rhode Island', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-23T03:50:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Margalit Fox', 'person': [{'first