ively simple. His career has followed a similar arc, but does he still have his finishing kick?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/24/sports/searching-for-phelpss-finishing-kick-ahead-of-world-championships.html', 'snippet': 'Michael Phelps’s strategy in the 200 butterfly is deceptively simple. His career has followed a similar arc, but does he still have his finishing kick?', 'lead_paragraph': 'Michael Phelps’s strategy in the 200-meter butterfly, his signature event, is deceptively simple for such a grueling race: establish an easy rhythm on the first lap, build momentum on the second, break loose on the third and finish strong. ', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/24/sports/24phelps/24phelps-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1001, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/24/sports/24phelps/24phelps-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/24/sports/24phelps/24phelps-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Phelps Seeks Strong Finishing Kick to His Career', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Phelps Seeks Strong Finishing Kick to His Career', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Swimming', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'USA Swimming', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Phelps, Michael', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-23T14:59:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Karen Crouse', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Karen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Crouse', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b47740c4-8456-5110-a4e0-d838153cd9b0', 'word_count': 760, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b47740c4-8456-5110-a4e0-d838153cd9b0'}, {'abstract': 'Detroit’s Don Kelly is the only active major leaguer who has played all nine defensive positions.', 'web_url': 'https://bats.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/07/23/roaming-the-field-for-detroit-a-jack-of-all-trades/', 'snippet': 'Detroit’s Don Kelly is the only active major leaguer who has played all nine defensive positions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MINNEAPOLIS — In the late 1990s at Mount Lebanon High School in Pittsburgh, the baseball team included two future major league shortstops. One day, Josh Wilson would pitch and Don Kelly would play short. When Wilson did not pitch, he and Kelly alternated between middle infield spots.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Roaming the Field for Detroit: A Jack-of-All-Trades', 'kicker': 'Bats', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Detroit Tigers', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-23T15:30:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tyler Kepner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tyler', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kepner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d9fe398a-459e-5806-9fa3-f521ba581d4d', 'word_count': 692, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d9fe398a-459e-5806-9fa3-f521ba581d4d'}, {'abstract': 'A collection of photos by Kate Orlinsky.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2011