 time trial putting him in position to become the first Australian to win the race.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/24/sports/cadel-evans-speeds-past-andy-schleck-in-tour-de-france.html', 'snippet': 'Evans overcame a 57-second deficit in the final time trial putting him in position to become the first Australian to win the race.', 'lead_paragraph': 'GRENOBLE, France — Cadel Evans rocketed past the finish line Saturday, all but certain of his triumph in the Tour de France. As fellow Australians everywhere burst into celebration, Evans presented them with the portrait of a champion: body bent, muscles bulging, vigilant until the end.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/24/sports/cycling-1/cycling-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 883, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/24/sports/cycling-1/cycling-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/24/sports/cycling-1/cycling-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Cadel Evans Set to Win First Tour de France', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Victory for Australia, and for Pure Speed', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Contador, Alberto', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tour de France (Bicycle Race)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schleck, Andy', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Evans, Cadel', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Martin, Tony', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schleck, F