ng in central Oslo and a shooting attack on a nearby island that killed at least 92 people.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Online, Clues to a Suspected Attacker’s Motives', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Breivik, Anders Behring', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Norway', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Oslo (Norway)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-23T17:36:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Robert Mackey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Robert', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mackey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/991f06ba-f5fb-563d-8fda-5d641783ae70', 'word_count': 1752, 'uri': 'nyt://article/991f06ba-f5fb-563d-8fda-5d641783ae70'}, {'abstract': 'Ralph Nader, who waged a successful battle almost 40 years ago over flight overbooking, tells the Haggler about a new airline ticket problem — and how he solved it.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/24/your-money/ralph-nader-and-the-airline-refund-the-haggler.html', 'snippet': 'Ralph Nader, who waged a successful battle almost 40 years ago over flight overbooking, tells the Haggler about a new airline ticket problem — and how he solved it.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A FEW weeks ago, Ralph Nader rang.', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/24/business/Haggler/Haggler-jumbo.jpg', 'heigh