ly in tournaments. As I grew older, playing doubles taught me about collaboration, and playing one-on-one taught me how to outthink and outsmart an opponent. I was also a television buff, especially when it came to commercials. ', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/24/business/Boss/Boss-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/24/business/Boss/Boss-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Collaborate and Compete', 'kicker': 'The Boss', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Collaborate and Compete', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADVERTISING AND MARKETING', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Labor and Jobs', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Executives and Management', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Careers and Professions', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Horizon Media', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-23T17:47:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'NAT', 'section_name': 'Job Market', 'byline': {'original': 'By BILL KOENIGSBERG', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bill', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'KOENIGSBERG', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e2b08fea-e8b7-55a0-a622-8339dfd3261c', 'word_count': 634, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e2b08fea-e8b7-55a0-a622-8339dfd3261c'}, {'abstract': 'Hundreds of gay and lesbian couples began marrying on Sunday — the first taking their vows just after midnight — in a new milestone for gay rights advocates.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/24/nyregion/across-new-york-hundreds-of-gay-couples-to-marry-on-sunday.html', 'snippet': 'Hundreds of gay and lesbian couples began marrying on Sunday — the first taking their vows just after midnight — in a new milestone for gay rights advocates.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Hundreds of gay and lesbian couples across New York State began marrying on Sunday — the first taking their vows just after midnight — in the culmination of a long battle in the Legislature and a new milestone for gay rights advocates seeking to legalize same-sex marriage across the nation.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/24/nyregion/24marriage1/24marriage1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/24/nyregion/24marriage1/24marriage1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/24/nyregion/24marriage1/24marriage1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 718, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/24/nyregion/24marriage1/24marriage1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/24/nyregion/24marriage1/24marriage1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'After Long Wait, Gay Couples Marry in New York', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'After Long Wait, Same-Sex Couples Marry in New York', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Same-Sex Marriage, Civil Unions and Domestic Partnerships