 None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/8afd93bb-650d-5abf-8065-2c299b0587e4', 'word_count': 1035, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8afd93bb-650d-5abf-8065-2c299b0587e4'}, {'abstract': 'The Pirates won 18 of the first 25 games started by Mike McKenry, who had just six games of prior major league experience, with Colorado last September.', 'web_url': 'https://bats.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/07/23/mckenrys-big-break-comes-after-trade-to-pirates/', 'snippet': 'The Pirates won 18 of the first 25 games started by Mike McKenry, who had just six games of prior major league experience, with Colorado last September.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On the night of June 12, Mike McKenry was scanning his groceries at the supermarket checkout line in Pawtucket, R.I., when his cellphone rang. McKenry, then a part-time catcher for the Boston Red Sox’ Class AAA team, had no reason to expect what he was about to hear.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'McKenry’s Big Break Comes After Trade to Pirates', 'kicker': 'Bats', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pittsburgh Pirates', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-23T19:52:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tyler Kepner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tyler', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kepner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9b8a3a4d-966d-54e5-8bce-8f13d1b864d9', 'word_count': 267, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9b8a3a4d-966d-54e5-8bce-8f13d1b864d9'}, {'abstract': 'Heat and humidity continued their hold over a large part of the country, raising the toll of heat-related deaths.', 'web_url': 'https: