 a video made for arguments about a lethal injection drug cocktail may change that.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/24/us/24video.html', 'snippet': 'For many years, executions in the United States were private, but a video made for arguments about a lethal injection drug cocktail may change that.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As Andrew Grant DeYoung died by lethal injection in a prison in Jackson, Ga., on Thursday night, a video camera watched silently.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/24/us/VIDEO/VIDEO-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 728, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Video of a Lethal Injection Reopens Questions on the Privacy of Executions', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Video of a Lethal Injection Reopens Questions on the Privacy of Executions', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Capital Punishment', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Recordings and Downloads (Video)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Privacy', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-23T21:11:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Erica Goode', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Erica', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Goode', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e99b1587-50b4-5baf-ae50-e695da894201', 'word_count': 1119, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e99b1587-50b4-5baf-ae50-e695da894201'}, {'abstract': 'A.J. Burnett failed to make it through the sixth inning for the third straight start and never found a rhythm on a very hot day at Yankee Stadium.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/24/sports/baseball/aj-burnett-works-hard-to-no-avail-in-yankees-loss.html', 'snippet': 'A.J. Burnett failed to make it through the sixth inning for the third straight start and never found a rhythm on a very hot day at Yankee Stadium.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The powder-blue shirt of the home-plate umpire Bill Welke was soaked through by the sixth inning Saturday, probably because it was sunny and close to 100 degrees at Yankee Stadium. A. J. Burnett was also grinding through another start, making Welke’s and everyone else’s day longer.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/24/sports/24yankees1/24yankees1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/24/sports/24yankees1/24yankees1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/24/sports/24yankees1/24yankees1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 696, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/24/sports/24yankees1/24yankees1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/24/sports/24yankees1/24yankees1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Burnett Works Hard, to No Avail, in Yankees’ Loss', 'kicker': 'Athletics 4, Yankees 3', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Burnett Works Hard, To No Avail, in Yankees’ Loss', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}