revented him from being besieged after a young man’s death in a police chase.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/24/us/24bcbayview.html', 'snippet': 'Chief Greg Suhr of the San Francisco Police Department has a reputation for openness, but that has not prevented him from being besieged after a young man’s death in a police chase.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As a police captain in San Francisco’s violent Bayview neighborhood, Greg Suhr operated from the streets. The stocky veteran schmoozed small-business owners and community leaders and prided himself on a culture of transparency. By the time he left this year, homicides in the Bayview had dropped by 50 percent.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21A', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/24/us/24BCBAYVIEW1/24BCBAYVIEW1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 669, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/24/us/24BCBAYVIEW1/24BCBAYVIEW1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/24/us/24BCBAYVIEW1/24BCBAYVIEW1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Shooting Death Presents Test for a New Police Chief', 'kicker': 'The Bay Citizen', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Shooting Death Presents Test for a New Police Chief', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'San Francisco (Calif)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Fatalities)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-23T21:57:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'ori