ts ready to make city-payroll job cuts, union leaders are prepared with a report that says it’s the bosses, not the workers, who ought to go.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/24/us/24cnccity.html', 'snippet': 'When Mayor Rahm Emanuel of Chicago gets ready to make city-payroll job cuts, union leaders are prepared with a report that says it’s the bosses, not the workers, who ought to go.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In City Hall’s Department of Family and Support Services, the relatively small band of employees receive supervision from no less than one commissioner, 14 deputy commissioners, 4 assistant commissioners, 6 assistants to the commissioner and 17 others with the word “director” in their titles.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21A', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/24/us/24CNCCITY2/24CNCCITY2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/24/us/24CNCCITY2/24CNCCITY2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/24/us/24CNCCITY2/24CNCCITY2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 669, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/24/us/24CNCCITY2/24CNCCITY2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/24/us/24CNCCITY2/24CNCCITY2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The City Payroll May Include a Few Too Many Bosses', 'kicker': 'Chicago News Cooperative | The Bottom Line', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The City Payroll May Include a Few Too Many Bosses',