, beer) and less so (mummy-wrappings of wet paper) to beat the stadium heat.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/24/sports/baseball-fans-find-ways-to-endure-heat-wave.html', 'snippet': 'As temperatures soared around the country, baseball fans used a variety of ways traditional (hats, fans, water, beer) and less so (mummy-wrappings of wet paper) to beat the stadium heat.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It was high noon on Saturday, about an hour before the first pitch at Yankee Stadium, where fans were anticipating several scorching hours and the possibility of the temperature reaching triple digits for the second day in a row.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/24/sports/hot-4/hot-4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 492, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/24/sports/hot-4/hot-4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/24/sports/hot-4/hot-4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Fans Needed Fans, Too', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Fans Needed Fans, Too', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weather', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Oakland Athletics', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Yankee Stadium (NYC)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-24T01:02:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports