lationship.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/07/24/gay-marriage-a-tribute-to-two-moms-in-the-bronx/', 'snippet': 'After more than 17 years of coupledom, John Sullivan, 40, and Robert Lane, 42, were married. The men were extremely close to their mothers, who supported their relationship.', 'lead_paragraph': 'John Sullivan, 40, carried the rings: one gold, one silver, but otherwise identical and studded with minute diamonds from the wedding ring of his mother, Maryann. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Gay Marriage | A Tribute to Two Moms in the Bronx', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Marriages', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Same-Sex Marriage, Civil Unions and Domestic Partnerships', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weddings and Engagements', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Bronx (NYC)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-24T16:25:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Adriane Quinlan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Adriane', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Quinlan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ceabc67a-ccf4-5ecc-86ba-9d9344c63c2e', 'word_count': 282, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ceabc67a-ccf4-5ecc-86ba-9d9344c63c2e'}, {'abstract': 'A same-sex couple received the first marriage license Sunday in Woodstock, N.Y.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/07/24/gay-marriage-making-it-official/', 'snippet': 'A same-sex couple received the first marriage license Sunday in Woodstock, N.Y.', 'lead_paragraph': '', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Gay Marriage | Woodsto