 an air of thoughtful, chummy competition. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/25/arts/JAZZ/JAZZ-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 948, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Four Pianists, Teaming and Competing', 'kicker': 'Music Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Four Pianists, Teaming and Competing', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Barron, Kenny', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Jazz', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Charlap, Bill', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Barth, Bruce', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-24T22:28:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nate Chinen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nate', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Chinen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/ee266617-38d9-5fc5-bd53-823c78dcdee4', 'word_count': 640, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ee266617-38d9-5fc5-bd53-823c78dcdee4'}, {'abstract': 'Del McCoury’s bluegrass group and the Preservation Hall Jazz Band did the proper adult thing on Wednesday night: they resolved their differences.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/25/arts/music/del-mccoury-band-at-city-winery-review.html', 'snippet': 'Del McCoury’s bluegrass group and the Preservation Hall Jazz Band did the proper adult thing on Wednesday night: they resolved their differences.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Del McCoury’s bluegrass group and the Preservation Hall Jazz Band did the proper adult thi