anges Proposed For Research on Humans', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Research', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicine and Health', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Health and Human Services Department', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-24T23:56:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'Health', 'subsection_name': 'Research', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Pollack', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pollack', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e1150de8-0c63-594a-b975-e1248ce226e7', 'word_count': 625, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e1150de8-0c63-594a-b975-e1248ce226e7'}, {'abstract': 'When those who pride themselves on their freedoms fail to live up to their ideals, there can be consequences in other places.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/31/magazine/why-tyrants-love-the-murdoch-scandal.html', 'snippet': 'When those who pride themselves on their freedoms fail to live up to their ideals, there can be consequences in other places.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Whether the scandal afflicting News Corp. represents the beginning of the fall of the House of Murdoch or just another thrilling episode in the career of the Teflon tycoon, I can’t say. There is plenty enough spectacle without speculation.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/24/magazine/mag-31-lede/mag-31-lede-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 262, 'width': 404, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/24/magazine/mag-31-lede/mag