ar, and the fine was the largest the board has levied against an elected official.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Markowitz Fined $20,000 for Wife’s Free Overseas Trips', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Conflicts of Interest', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Markowitz, Marty', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Conflicts of Interest Board (NYC)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Brooklyn (NYC)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Turkey', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-25T17:06:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Liz Robbins', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Liz', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Robbins', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/508ff83f-0c41-5ca9-a00d-7f1a2fe4ac80', 'word_count': 846, 'uri': 'nyt://article/508ff83f-0c41-5ca9-a00d-7f1a2fe4ac80'}, {'abstract': 'Lucas Benini joined Buddy Media, New York, in a new post, managing director for Europe. Mr. Benini had been vice president and commercial director at comScore Europe, part of comScore.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/25/business/media/accounts-and-people-of-note-in-the-ad-industry.html', 'snippet': 'Lucas Benini joined Buddy Media, New York, in a new post, managing director for Europe. Mr. Benini had been vice president and commercial director at comScore Europe, part of comScore.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Lucas Benini joined Buddy Media, New York, in a new post, managing director for Europe, as the company opens a European operation, based in London. Mr. Benini had been vice president and commercial director at comScore Eu