 thing America’s job-seekers need are policies that require them to have a job in order to get a job.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It is hard to recall a time when it was tougher to find a job. Fully two years after the official end of the recession, unemployment is at 9.2 percent. Job creation has stalled. Making things even more difficult, many employers, staffing agencies and online job-posting firms are expressly screening out applicants who are unemployed, apparently as an expedient to cull résumés, or on the presumption that the unemployed are poor performers. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'One Way to Help the Jobless', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'One Way to Help the Jobless', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Unemployment', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Labor and Jobs', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hiring and Promotion', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'DeLauro, Rosa', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Johnson, Henry', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-26T01:45:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/8539028b-4111-5638-8a76-e5b6f7092cee', 'word_count': 339, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8539028b-4111-5638-8a76-e5b6f7092cee'}, {'abstract': 'Mourners gathered on Monday in Oslo to pay tribute to the victims of Saturday’s bombing in Oslo and shooting on Utoya Island.', 'web