ou will ever make.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Temporary Vegetarian, a fickle creature, took a leave of absence for the past few months, biding her time until the full onslaught of summer produce. It’s here, and the column is back. This week’s installment is the first of three to celebrate the corn season, now in full swing.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Temporary Vegetarian: The Simplest Corn Pudding', 'kicker': 'Diner&#039;s Journal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Corn', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Recipes', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Vegetarianism', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-26T18:53:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Elaine Louie', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Elaine', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Louie', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5eccf96b-5dc1-578f-8474-a362ac2a4b85', 'word_count': 450, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5eccf96b-5dc1-578f-8474-a362ac2a4b85'}, {'abstract': 'On the final stop of his 10-week Mediterranean tour, Seth Kugel decided to stay with families and to check out summer music festivals and souks.', 'web_url': 'https://frugaltraveler.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/07/26/in-lebanon-in-search-of-music-souks-and-home/', 'snippet': 'On the final stop of his 10-week Mediterranean tour, Seth Kugel decided to stay with families and to check out summer music festivals and souks.', 'lead_paragraph': '\xa0', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Lebanon, in Search of Music, Souks and Home', 'kicker': 'Frugal Traveler', 'content_kicker'