9775-d6b2231b9823'}, {'abstract': 'Conservative House Republicans voiced opposition to the debt-ceiling bill proposed by their party’s leader.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/07/26/for-boehner-pushback-from-conservatives-over-debt-plan/', 'snippet': 'Conservative House Republicans voiced opposition to the debt-ceiling bill proposed by their party’s leader.', 'lead_paragraph': 'John A. Boehner, the House speaker, faced opposition Tuesday from some conservatives to his two-step plan for raising the debt ceiling even as he proceeded toward a vote on the proposal that could come as early as Wednesday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'For Boehner, Pushback From Conservatives  Over Debt Plan', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'National Debt (US)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Boehner, John A', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cantor, Eric', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jordan, Jim', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'West, Allen B', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-26T20:08:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael D. Shear', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1351e089-cf13-5ab9-b8f2-98a0ad12223d', 'word_count': 539, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1351e089-cf13-5ab9-b8f2-98a0ad12223d'}, {'abstract': 'In 1971, Charles Rangel was a freshman congressman and his wife had an incident while entering the White House for a luncheon. His letter details “a rather unfortunate incident.”', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/07/26/in-nixon-papers-a-complaint-over-treatment-of-mrs-rangel/', 'snippet': 'In 1971, Charles Rangel was a freshman congressman and his wife had an incident while entering the White House for a luncheon. His letter details “a rather unfortunate incident.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'After toppling Representative Adam Clayton Powell Jr. in 1970, serving 20 terms in Congress and surviving censure last year to nimbly gain his 21st, Charles B. Rangel is no pushover. But don’t mess with his wife, Alma, er, Mrs. Rangel, either.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Nixon Papers, a Complaint Over Treatment of Mrs. Rangel', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Customs, Etiquette and Manners', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nixon, Richard Milhous', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rangel, Charles B', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Nixon, Richard, Library and Birthplace', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-26T20:10:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sam Roberts', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Roberts', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/97568dc0-a05f-50c7-bb7d-ebd8ef74a87a', 'word_count': 381, 'uri': 'nyt://article/97568dc0-a05f-