gymkhana.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Hear “hybrid” and the mind naturally wanders into the Prius patch. But for Ken Block, a champion in the drifting-challenge motorsport known as gymkhana and an established driver on the World Rally Championship circuit, “hybrid” carries very different connotations.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Ken Block Gets Fitted for a 600-Horsepower Fiesta', 'kicker': 'Wheels', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-26T21:08:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sam Schembari', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schembari', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8039e348-f02f-5fcb-919a-cadcc5502237', 'word_count': 173, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8039e348-f02f-5fcb-919a-cadcc5502237'}, {'abstract': 'Action Bronson was fresh from the Meatopia festival when he took the stage at the Gramercy Theater on Saturday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/27/arts/music/action-bronson-at-the-gramercy-theater-review.html', 'snippet': 'Action Bronson was fresh from the Meatopia festival when he took the stage at the Gramercy Theater on Saturday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Action Bronson has no shortage of songs about, and inspired by, food — “Roasted Bone Marrow,” “Brunch,” “Ceviche,” “Dabble in Truffles”; the list goes on — but one of his best tackles the flip side of the gourmand style: weight loss.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/27/arts/ACTION/ACTION-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, '