 season for caroling … or does he?', 'lead_paragraph': 'WEDNESDAY’S PUZZLE — There are those who believe that there are only a limited number of original ideas left for crossword themes and there are those who believe that original ideas are limitless and can come from anywhere. I tend to fall somewhere along the middle of that spectrum. Even if the way an idea is presented is not entirely original, I still appreciate and admire a theme that is solidly constructed and has some great entry/cluing combinations.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Wednesday: The Problem With These Clue', 'kicker': 'Wordplay', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Crossword Puzzles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-27T02:00:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Crosswords & Games', 'byline': {'original': 'By Deb Amlen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Deb', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Amlen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cc214cc5-abd7-539f-aa73-d4ee7a1e2f51', 'word_count': 368, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cc214cc5-abd7-539f-aa73-d4ee7a1e2f51'}, {'abstract': 'After the attacks in Oslo and on Utoya, Norway will never be the same.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/27/opinion/27nesbo.html', 'snippet': 'After the attacks in Oslo and on Utoya, Norway will never be the same.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Oslo ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Past Is a Foreign Country', 'kicker': 'Op-Ed Contributor', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Past Is a Foreign Country', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Utoya (Norway)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'nam