'}, {'abstract': 'Mayor Ghulam Haider Hamidi, who held dual citizenship in Afghanistan and the United States, was killed by an insurgent hiding explosives in his turban.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/28/world/asia/28afghanistan.html', 'snippet': 'Mayor Ghulam Haider Hamidi, who held dual citizenship in Afghanistan and the United States, was killed by an insurgent hiding explosives in his turban.', 'lead_paragraph': 'KANDAHAR, Afghanistan — An insurgent suicide bomber hiding explosives in his turban assassinated the mayor of Kandahar on Wednesday, the third killing of a high-profile official in the country this month. The Taliban claimed responsibility for the attack on the mayor, who held dual citizenship in Afghanistan and the United States.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/world/28afghanistan/28afghanistan-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/28/world/28afghanistan/28afghanistan-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/world/28afghanistan/28afghanistan-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 697, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/world/28afghanistan/28afghanistan-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/28/world/28afghanistan/28afghanistan-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Suicide Bomber Sent by Taliban Assassinates Kandahar’s Mayor', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print