ers seemed to be warming up to him as a person, with 64 percent saying they liked him.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After enduring a brutal spring in the public opinion polls, Mayor Michael R. Bloomberg seems to be making some inroads with the public, according to the latest poll by Quinnipiac University.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Good News for Bloomberg and Kelly in Quinnipiac Poll', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mayors', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Polls and Public Opinion', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bloomberg, Michael R', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Carroll, Maurice', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'de Blasio, Bill', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kelly, Raymond W', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Liu, John C', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Markowitz, Marty', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Quinn, Christine C', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Stringer, Scott M', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Thompson, William C Jr', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Walcott, Dennis M', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Quinnipiac University', 'rank': 14, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 15, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-27T15:17:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Javier C. Hernández', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Javier', 'middlename': 'C.', 'lastname': 'Hernández', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organizati