 Indians and leading Los Angeles to a 3-1 win Wednesday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Angels’ Ervin Santana Throws No-Hitter Against Indians', 'kicker': 'Bats', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Santana, Ervin', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Cleveland Indians', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Los Angeles Angels of Anaheim', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-27T18:47:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Associated Press', 'person': [], 'organization': 'Associated Press'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ec4501aa-00cd-5bc2-9b40-1cca4ad166c4', 'word_count': 933, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ec4501aa-00cd-5bc2-9b40-1cca4ad166c4'}, {'abstract': 'Michael Dweck’s new book of photographs includes the creative types who may shape the new Cuba.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/28/fashion/habana-libre-looks-at-cubas-boldface-names.html', 'snippet': 'Michael Dweck’s new book of photographs includes the creative types who may shape the new Cuba.', 'lead_paragraph': 'OF beautiful people Cuba has many. Any visitor to the island or its satellite country, Miami, knows that.', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/28noticed/28NOTICED1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 500, 'width': 190, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/28noticed/28noticed-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'sub