 allover prints and simple silhouettes are everywhere.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/07/27/summer-styles-great-lengths/', 'snippet': 'Maxi dresses with allover prints and simple silhouettes are everywhere.', 'lead_paragraph': 'We have yet to see separates make a significant comeback, even though we’re a month into summer. Maxi dresses with allover prints and simple silhouettes are everywhere, and women are opting to wear them most often with shoes that disappear behind the longer hemlines. The actress Halle Berry, with her daughter Nahla, pairs a graphic ikat with a fringed bag and barely there sandals, while the breakout star of the summer, Rosie Huntington-Whiteley, puts a casual spin on wallpaper print and the “Gossip Girl” actress Jessica Szohr accessorizes a strapless with long gold chains.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Summer Styles | Great Lengths', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-07-27T21:00:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Edward Barsamian', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Edward', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barsamian', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/33df2e2a-9f5b-5db7-8df9-6e029ecd3562', 'word_count': 98, 'uri': 'nyt://article/33df2e2a-9f5b-5db7-8df9-6e029ecd3562'}, {'abstract': 'Photographs from Afghanistan, Libya, Korea and China.', 'web_url': 'https://lens.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/07/27/pictures-of-the-day-afghanistan-and-elsewhere-16/', 'snippet': 'Photographs from Afghanistan, Libya, Korea and China.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Photographs from Afghanistan, Libya, South Korea and China.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Pictures of the Da