perience of an arbitration hearing is a high priority for N.H.L. clubs as well as for players and their agents.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Rangers and Ryan Callahan, their linchpin player of the future, agreed to terms for a contract extension Wednesday afternoon, only hours before a scheduled salary-arbitration meeting in Toronto on Thursday.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/sports/Y-ARBITRATION/Y-ARBITRATION-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 662, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/sports/Y-ARBITRATION/Y-ARBITRATION-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/28/sports/Y-ARBITRATION/Y-ARBITRATION-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Ryan Callahan and Rangers Avoid Unpleasantness of Arbitration', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Callahan Avoids Bitterness of Arbitration', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hockey, Ice', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Rangers', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ARBITRATION, CONCILIATION AND MEDIATION', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wages and Salaries', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Callahan, Ryan', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-28T00:12:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Hockey', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeff Z. Klein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeff', 'middlename': 'Z.', 'lastname': 'Klein', 'qualifier': None, 'tit