eld.html', 'snippet': 'Luke Babcock Keller, 25, aspired to act and produce videos when he joined his girlfriend in New York, but now sees opportunities in his job with a manufacturer.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When Luke Babcock Keller, 25, left Chicago to join his girlfriend in New York last August, he had aspirations to act and to produce videos and a bachelor’s degree in communications from DePaul University, but he didn’t have a job. With his nest egg running on empty, he contacted a temp agency and was sent to IceStone, a manufacturer of countertop slabs made from recycled glass in a cement matrix. In January, IceStone hired him for its operations team. He lives in Bushwick with his girlfriend, Ayisha Jaffer, and two roommates.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/nyregion/28ENTRY/28ENTRY-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/28/nyregion/28ENTRY/28ENTRY-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/nyregion/28ENTRY/28ENTRY-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/nyregion/28ENTRY/28ENTRY-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/28/nyregion/28ENTRY/28ENTRY-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'After Dreams of Acting, an Unexpected Role', 'kicker': 'Entry Level', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'After Dreams of Acting, an Unexpected Role', 'name': None