 New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/110ff9a2-965b-5c7a-be43-a213591bc2c2', 'word_count': 287, 'uri': 'nyt://article/110ff9a2-965b-5c7a-be43-a213591bc2c2'}, {'abstract': 'Chemists and biologists are trying to generate the Frankensteinian spark that will jump the gap separating the inanimate and the animate.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/28/science/28life.html', 'snippet': 'Chemists and biologists are trying to generate the Frankensteinian spark that will jump the gap separating the inanimate and the animate.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SAN DIEGO — Here in a laboratory perched on the edge of the continent, researchers are trying to construct Life As We Don’t Know It in a thimbleful of liquid.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/science/LIFE1/LIFE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/28/science/LIFE1/LIFE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/science/LIFE1/LIFE1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 714, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/science/LIFE1/LIFE1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/28/science/LIFE1/LIFE1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': '‘It’s Alive! It’s Alive!’ Maybe Right Here on Earth', 'kicker': 'Life Out There', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '‘It’s Alive! It’s Alive!’ Maybe Right Here on Earth', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 