ch, Judi', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hill, Conleth', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': "O'Neill, Eugene", 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Upton, Andrew', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Winehouse, Amy', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Theater Co', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'London (England)', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-28T16:30:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Brantley', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Brantley', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/65d01fb5-8d5b-50a3-ad30-fe37c16aa65a', 'word_count': 619, 'uri': 'nyt://article/65d01fb5-8d5b-50a3-ad30-fe37c16aa65a'}, {'abstract': 'A’s reliever Joey Devine struggled with his control last weekend at Yankee Stadium, throwing behind hitters in each of his appearances.', 'web_url': 'https://bats.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/07/28/as-demote-reliever-after-wildness-at-stadium/', 'snippet': 'A’s reliever Joey Devine struggled with his control last weekend at Yankee Stadium, throwing behind hitters in each of his appearances.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The A’s optioned relief pitcher Joey Devine, whose wildness last weekend at Yankee Stadium was morbidly fascinating but led to some breath-holding moments, to their Class AAA affiliate in Sacramento on Wednesday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A’s Demote Reliever After Wildness at Stadium', 'kicker': 'Bats', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Laird, Brandon', 'rank': 2,