hway in billionaire-studded Sagaponack, as if protected by squatters’ rights. The driving range popped up on the horizon in 1957, one step ahead of the zoning czars. A 1961 variance grandfathered the beginner-tolerant nine-hole, par-3 public golf course into the picture.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/31/nyregion/31JOINT1_SPAN/31JOINT1_SPAN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 410, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/31/nyregion/31JOINT1_SPAN/31JOINT1_SPAN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 410}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/31/nyregion/31JOINT1_SPAN/31JOINT1_SPAN-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/31/nyregion/31JOINT1_SPAN/31JOINT1_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/31/nyregion/31JOINT1_SPAN/31JOINT1_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Haven for Golf, or Fried Eggs', 'kicker': 'Neighborhood Joint', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Haven For Golf, Or Fried Eggs', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Golf', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Hamptons (NY)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pancakes', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-28T20:50:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Robin Finn', 'person': [{'firstn