isn’t letting medical problems sideline her anymore. At Jones Beach Theater on Wednesday night she let fly a voice with its power, range and improvisational spirit fully alive. Her songs were about the strength and the value of a good woman’s love, freely given, and about the healing powers of faith. She sang about earthly and divine ecstasy, and she sang simply to exult in her voice.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/29/world/29ARETHA/29ARETHA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/29/world/29ARETHA/29ARETHA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/29/world/29ARETHA/29ARETHA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Fount of Soul, Full Throttle and Unbowed', 'kicker': 'Music Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Fount of Soul, Full Throttle and Unbowed', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Franklin, Aretha', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-28T21:02:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jon Pareles', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jon', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pareles', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/4462104c-1dbf-5fa9-b376-48b5b8731c1d', 'word_count': 549, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4462104c-1dbf-5fa9-b376-48b5b8731c1d'}, {'abstract': 'Bob Bradley was fired Thursday as coach of the United States men’s national team. Who should replace him?', 'web_url': 'https://goal.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/07/28/a-b-after-bradley-who/', 'snippet': 'Bob Bradley was fired Thursday as coach of the United States men’s national team. Who should replace him?', 'lead_paragraph': 'Four weeks ago, the Goal blog asked Sunil Gulati, the president of the United States Soccer Federation, about the status of the national team coach, Bob Bradley, after the American team’s uneven showing in the Concacaf Gold Cup. The e-mail response was that there would be something at the end of the week, that being the end of June.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A.B.: After Bradley, Who?', 'kicker': 'Goal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coaches and Managers', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bradley, Bob', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gulati, Sunil', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United States Soccer Federation', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Philadelphia (Pa)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-28T21:05:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Soccer', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jack Bell', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jack', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bell', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/09995cfd-25f5-546b-b7ed-5cae29d070e0', 'word_count': 173, 'uri': 'nyt://article/09995cfd-25f5-546b-b7ed-5cae29d070e0'}, {'abstract': 'Speaker John A. Boehner rounds up support ahead of House debt limit vote.', 'web_url': 'https://w