ficult emotion. Essentially a study in the varieties of masculine sexual confusion, it travels the circuit from bromance to a kind of Y-chromosome weepie that might be called male-odrama, with a detour into the briar patch of adolescent awkwardness.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/29/arts/29CRAZY-1_SPAN/29CRAZY-1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 340, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/29/arts/29CRAZY-1_SPAN/29CRAZY-1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 340}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/29/arts/29CRAZY-1_SPAN/CRAZY-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 593, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/29/arts/29CRAZY-1_SPAN/29CRAZY-1_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/29/arts/29CRAZY-1_SPAN/29CRAZY-1_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'What’s a Guy to Do if His Wife Cheats on Him? Head to the Mall', 'kicker': "Movie Review | 'Crazy, Stupid, Love'", 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'What’s a Guy to Do If His Wife Cheats on Him? Head to the Mall', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Requa, John', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ficarra, Glenn', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Carell, Steve', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gosling, Ryan', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 