t://article/44747abd-ca2d-5791-a5f4-bf1e0368ef54'}, {'abstract': 'Many Tibetans are looking to a young lama to assume the mantle of the Dalai Lama when the elder lama dies, and take on the role as shepherd of the Tibetan people.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/29/us/29lama.html', 'snippet': 'Many Tibetans are looking to a young lama to assume the mantle of the Dalai Lama when the elder lama dies, and take on the role as shepherd of the Tibetan people.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WOODSTOCK, N.Y. — At the age of 7, he was deemed to be the 17th reincarnation of the Karmapa — one of the most revered figures in Tibetan Buddhism — and whisked from the yak-hair tent of his nomad family in the Himalayas to be groomed in a monastery for leadership.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/29/us/LAMA/LAMA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/29/us/LAMA/LAMA-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/29/us/LAMA/LAMA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 669, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/29/us/LAMA/LAMA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/29/us/LAMA/LAMA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Young Tibetan Lama Prepares for a Greater Role', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Young Tibetan Lama Prepares for a Greater Role', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': '