artment.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/29/sports/review-shows-title-ix-is-not-significantly-enforced.html', 'snippet': 'While a college or university in violation of Title IX risks losing its federal funds, that penalty has never been used, and there are no examples of cases being referred to the justice department.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In 1998, the University of Southern California was accused of denying its female students a fair chance at participating in sports. Thirteen years later, the federal agency charged with investigating sex discrimination in schools has not completed its inquiry of U.S.C.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/29/sports/sub-jp-title-9/sub-jp-title-9-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 359, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/29/sports/sub-jp-title-9/sub-jp-title-9-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 359}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/29/sports/sub-jp-title-9/sub-jp-title-9-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 605, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/29/sports/sub-jp-title-9/sub-jp-title-9-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/29/sports/sub-jp-title-9/sub-jp-title-9-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Long Fights for Sports Equity, Even With a Law', 'kicker': 'Gender Games', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Long Fights for Sports Equity, Even With a Law', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject