essed scorn at resistance to compromise and raising tax revenues.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/29/us/politics/29demdistrict.html', 'snippet': 'Democrats and some Republicans in Brookline, Mass., represented in the House by Barney Frank, expressed scorn at resistance to compromise and raising tax revenues.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BROOKLINE, Mass. — Arthur May, a laid-off computer programmer in this proudly liberal suburb of Boston, has been watching the showdown over the federal debt ceiling with growing revulsion — aimed mostly at Republicans.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/29/us/DEMDISTRICT/DEMDISTRICT-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 819, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/29/us/DEMDISTRICT/DEMDISTRICT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/29/us/DEMDISTRICT/DEMDISTRICT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'In Stronghold of Liberals, a Call to Levy More Taxes', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In Stronghold Of Liberals, A Call to Levy More Taxes', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'National Debt (US)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Democratic Party', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Massachusetts', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-29T02:59:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Abby Goodnough', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Abby', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Goodnough', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8a76fadf-0095-50ac-855f-a7c9a5d32cc7', 'word_count': 732, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8a76fadf-0095-50ac-855f-a7c9a5d32cc7'}, {'abstract': 'Hideki Irabu’s arrival in the United States foretold a rocky career ahead.', 'web_url': 'https://bats.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/07/28/irabus-arrival-came-with-signs-of-trouble/', 'snippet': 'Hideki Irabu’s arrival in the United States foretold a rocky career ahead.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Back in 1997, the arrival of Hideki Irabu to the major leagues was big news. Irabu was not the first or the best pitcher to come from Japan, but he had made a bit of a spectacle of demanding to play for the Yankees even though the San Diego Padres had purchased his contract from the Chiba Lotte Marines.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Irabu’s Arrival Came With Signs of Trouble', 'kicker': 'Bats', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Irabu, Hideki', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Chiba Lotte Marines', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-29T03:17:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lynn Zinser', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lynn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Zinser', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5a1f0776-2c54-5ab0-91d7-e83a3bd1c66b', 'word_