, and it comes with some controversy.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/07/29/breast-feeding-doll-is-coming-to-america/', 'snippet': 'The Breast Milk Baby is entering the American toy market, and it comes with some controversy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There’s a new doll entering the American toy market called the Breast Milk Baby. In addition to the doll, little girls (and boys) get a halter top that they can wear, with two flowers that symbolize breasts.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Breast-Feeding Doll Is Coming to America', 'kicker': 'Well', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Babies and Infants', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Breastfeeding', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Children and Youth', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dolls', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicine and Health', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-29T12:52:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sindya N. Bhanoo', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sindya', 'middlename': 'N.', 'lastname': 'Bhanoo', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/908e9531-f327-5b30-954c-c65a9bbf87da', 'word_count': 694, 'uri': 'nyt://article/908e9531-f327-5b30-954c-c65a9bbf87da'}, {'abstract': 'Philadelphia’s bar scene is flourishing thanks to a focus on local brews and a community of excellent taprooms, pubs and bars.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/07/29/drink-up-north-philly-beer-part-2/', 'snippet': 'Philadelphia’s bar scene is flourishing thanks to a focus on local brews and a community of excellent taprooms, pubs and bars.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Here is the second installment of our bar-hopping guide. When it comes to beer in Philadelphia, Anders Larson, a bartender at the groundbreaking Northern Liberties pub 700 Club, puts it best: “It’s a happy time to be a Philadelphian. You can rarely say that!” This installment takes a look at the Fishtown neighborhood.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Drink Up | North Philly Beer, Part 2', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-07-29T13:00:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jordan Michelman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jordan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Michelman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c61caad0-01b5-5915-860b-14338290e362', 'word_count': 1236, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c61caad0-01b5-5915-860b-14338290e362'}, {'abstract': 'A top scientific group said the system that examines the safety of devices like artificial hips should be replaced.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/30/business/study-calls-approval-process-for-medical-devices-flawed.html', 'snippet': 'A top scientific group said the system that examines the safety of devices like artificial hips should be replaced.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The government’s system for regulating many medical devices like artificial hips should be abandoned and replaced because it fails to examine their safety and effectiveness before sale, according to a report released Friday by one of the nation’s top scientific groups. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subty