ong the participants, you’d espy Britain’s foremost nature writer, Richard Mabey, the author, most recently, of “Weeds: In Defense of Nature’s Most Unloved Plants.”', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/31/books/review/bkr-Royte-t_CA0/bkr-Royte-t_CA0-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 242, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/31/books/review/bkr-Royte-t_CA0/bkr-Royte-t_CA0-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 242}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/31/books/review/bkr-Royte-t_CA0/bkr-Royte-t_CA0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 525, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/31/books/review/bkr-Royte-t_CA0/bkr-Royte-t_CA0-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/31/books/review/bkr-Royte-t_CA0/bkr-Royte-t_CA0-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Impressed by Weeds', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Overgrown', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weeds', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Flowers and Plants', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gardens and Gardening', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Environment', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'AGRICULTURE', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-29T16:24:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'n