article/860f6615-2d03-5b85-8366-be3c0c8f3eca'}, {'abstract': 'Many analysts saw the move as a failed effort by a beleaguered institution to exert what is left of its political power.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/30/world/europe/30turkey.html', 'snippet': 'Many analysts saw the move as a failed effort by a beleaguered institution to exert what is left of its political power.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ISTANBUL — Turkey’s top military commanders resigned en masse on Friday, a move without precedent in Turkish history that many analysts saw as a failed effort by a beleaguered institution to exert what is left of its dwindling political power. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/30/world/30turkey/30turkey-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 762, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/30/world/30turkey/30turkey-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/30/world/30turkey/30turkey-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Top Generals Quit in Group, Stunning Turks', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Top Generals Quit in Group, Stunning Turks', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Turkey', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kosaner, Isik', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Erdogan, Recep Tayyip', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Susp