ly 4,800 square feet of space, four bedrooms and five and a half baths. It has Jay-Z as a former tenant, too.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A penthouse at the Time Warner Center that closed for $30.55 million was the highest sale of the week, according to city property records.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Big Deal | Sold for $30.55 million', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Housing and Real Estate', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-29T19:43:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sarah Kershaw', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sarah', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kershaw', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b11533a1-7799-50c0-a360-5c48243efcce', 'word_count': 151, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b11533a1-7799-50c0-a360-5c48243efcce'}, {'abstract': 'A federal appeals court ruled on Friday that genes can be patented, overturning a lower court decision that had shocked the biotechnology industry.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/30/business/gene-patent-in-cancer-test-upheld-by-appeals-panel.html', 'snippet': 'A federal appeals court ruled on Friday that genes can be patented, overturning a lower court decision that had shocked the biotechnology industry.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In a closely watched case, a federal appeals court ruled on Friday that genes can be patented, overturning a lower court decision that had shocked the biotechnology industry.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Ruling Upholds Gene Patent in Cancer Test', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Ruling Upholds Gene Patent in Cancer Test', 'nam