eystrokes.', 'web_url': 'https://gadgetwise.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/07/29/tip-of-the-week-shortcuts-into-offices-ribbon/', 'snippet': 'The KeyTips feature, built into all the programs in the Office 2010 and Office 2007 suites, lets you jump into Ribbon menus with just a few keystrokes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Hate having to grab the mouse to navigate the Ribbon in Microsoft Office? The KeyTips feature, built into all the programs in the Office 2010 and Office 2007 suites, lets you jump into Ribbon menus with just a few keystrokes so you can leave the mouse on its pad. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Tip of the Week: Shortcuts into Office’s Ribbon', 'kicker': 'Gadgetwise', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Software', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Microsoft Corporation', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-29T19:47:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'subsection_name': 'Personal Tech', 'byline': {'original': 'By J.d. Biersdorfer', 'person': [{'firstname': '', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c35604a3-28d7-5742-b8e0-1bc8b4e6f537', 'word_count': 186, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c35604a3-28d7-5742-b8e0-1bc8b4e6f537'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Hess says their shared affinity for cocktails is just a “small piece” of what makes them made for each other.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/31/fashion/weddings/audrey-saunders-and-robert-hess-vows.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Hess says their shared affinity for cocktails is just a “small piece” of what makes them made for each other.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THE couple’s first face-to-face meeting in 2002 took place exactly where it should have — at a bar.