oner of civil marriages by San Diego County for the event, officiated. ', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/31/fashion/weddings/31ONCINAjpg/31ONCINAjpg-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/31/fashion/weddings/31ONCINAjpg/31ONCINAjpg-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/31/fashion/weddings/31ONCINAjpg/31ONCINAjpg-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Nicole Oncina, Jeffrey Bernstein', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Nicole Oncina, Jeffrey Bernstein', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weddings and Engagements', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-29T21:19:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Society', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'subsection_name': 'Weddings', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rosalie R. Radomsky', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rosalie', 'middlename': 'R.', 'lastname': 'Radomsky', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fccf2faf-4317-5d8b-90a0-0972986cbc7b', 'word_count': 512, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fccf2faf-4317-5d8b-90a0-0972986cbc7b'}, {'abstract': 'A Manhattan wedding for a surgeon in the trauma and surgical critical-care division of a Brooklyn hospital and a lawyer who provides legal help to prisoners who may have been wrongly convicted.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/31/fashion/weddings/nina-morrison-carina-biggs-weddings.html', 'snippet'