rs later.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/31/fashion/weddings/christopher-lockwood-john-boone-weddings.html', 'snippet': 'The couple met aboard a train in summer 1986, leaving Grand Central Terminal, bound for Hudson, N.Y. — and a wedding 25 years later.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Christopher Lockwood and John Boone were married Monday in Hillsdale, N.Y. The Rev. Galen Guengerich, a Unitarian Universalist minister, officiated at the couple’s country home, where he also led a commitment ceremony on July 23. ', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/24/fashion/weddings/24LOCKWOODjpg/24LOCKWOODjpg-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 819, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/24/fashion/weddings/24LOCKWOODjpg/24LOCKWOODjpg-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/24/fashion/weddings/24LOCKWOODjpg/24LOCKWOODjpg-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Christopher Lockwood, John Boone', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Christopher Lockwood, John Boone', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weddings and Engagements', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-29T21:19:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Society', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'subsection_name': 'Weddings', 'byline': {'original': 'By Vincent M. Mallozzi', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Vincent', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://a