0/nyregion/at-tribeca-bar-the-biggest-star-was-stuck-outside.html', 'snippet': 'Minnie, an Asian elephant, was forced to wait outside at a celebration at a TriBeCa bar, though she was far beyond drinking age.', 'lead_paragraph': 'No one could ignore the elephant in the room, or rather at the corner of Franklin and Church Streets in TriBeCa on Thursday night. Minnie, a 5,000-pound Asian elephant, ambled down the street at 10 p.m. to the Theater Bar, where she spent the night outside snorting up fish-shaped candy and causing a minor traffic jam.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/30/nyregion/NOCTURNALIST1/NOCTURNALIST1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/30/nyregion/NOCTURNALIST1/NOCTURNALIST1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/30/nyregion/NOCTURNALIST1/NOCTURNALIST1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/30/nyregion/NOCTURNALIST1/NOCTURNALIST1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/30/nyregion/NOCTURNALIST1/NOCTURNALIST1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Huge Star Was Stuck Outside, Stamping Her Feet', 'kicker': 'Nocturnalist', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Huge Star Was Stuck Outside, Stamping Her Feet', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'v