Savage', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/676822a9-a4b8-5cd0-9401-a0b23a9c0cfe', 'word_count': 729, 'uri': 'nyt://article/676822a9-a4b8-5cd0-9401-a0b23a9c0cfe'}, {'abstract': 'Pfc. Naser Jason Abdo had shown regret for putting the military before his religion, an officer said.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/30/us/30awol.html', 'snippet': 'Pfc. Naser Jason Abdo had shown regret for putting the military before his religion, an officer said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'KILLEEN, Tex. — The 21-year-old Army private arrested here this week made his first appearance in federal court on Friday, two days after telling investigators he planned to detonate explosive devices at a restaurant frequented by soldiers from nearby Fort Hood, the culmination of a series of disputes between the private and the military over his Muslim beliefs and his pending deployment to Afghanistan.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/30/us/AWOL/AWOL-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 936, 'width': 733, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/30/us/AWOL/AWOL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/30/us/AWOL/AWOL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Soldier Arrested in Suspected Bomb Plot Had Series of Disputes With Army', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Soldier Arrested in Suspected Bomb Plot Had Series of Disputes With Army', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United State