/arts/television/jersey-shore-goes-to-florence-italy.html', 'snippet': 'For six weeks the cast members of “Jersey Shore,” which returns on Thursday, brought their special blend of binge drinking, promiscuity, complicated hair and spray-on tans to Florence.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FLORENCE, Italy', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/31/arts/31JERSEY1/31JERSEY1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/31/arts/31JERSEY1/31JERSEY1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/31/arts/31JERSEY1/31JERSEY1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 819, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/31/arts/31JERSEY1/31JERSEY1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/31/arts/31JERSEY1/31JERSEY1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Like Seaside Heights, but With a Duomo', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Like Seaside Heights, but With a Duomo', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'MTV Networks', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Florence (Italy)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-30T04:01:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Arts&Leisure', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gaia Pianigiani and Rachel Donadio', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gaia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pianigiani', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Rachel', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Donadio', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/686602d6-a03a-53b7-829c-5dd5fb56a900', 'word_count': 1293, 'uri': 'nyt://article/686602d6-a03a-53b7-829c-5dd5fb56a900'}, {'abstract': 'The pitcher’s lawyers contend the prosecution sabotaged its case to force a mistrial.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/30/sports/baseball/lawyers-for-clemens-ask-judge-to-dismiss-charges.html', 'snippet': 'The pitcher’s lawyers contend the prosecution sabotaged its case to force a mistrial.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The lawyers for Roger Clemens have asked a federal judge to dismiss the charges against him, accusing the prosecutors at Clemens’s perjury trial earlier this month of sabotaging the government’s case to elicit a mistrial because the proceedings were going badly for them.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Lawyers for Clemens Ask Judge to Dismiss Charges', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Lawyers for Clemens Ask Judge to Dismiss Charges', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clemens, Roger', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Decisions and Verdicts', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Courts and the Judiciary', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-30T04:04:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Juliet Macur', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Juliet', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Macur', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/78edb1a2-520c-56c0-8aca-1f6625232740', 'word_count': 420, 'uri': 'nyt://article/78edb1a2-520c-56c0-8aca-1f6625232740'}, {'abstract': 'A. J. Burnett completed eight innings for the first time in more than three months, but the Orioles chipped out a victory against the Yankees.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/30/sports/burnett-has-staying-power-for-yanks-but-orioles-starter-is-better.html', 'snippet': 'A. J. Burnett completed eight innings for the first time in more than three months, but the Orioles chipped out a victory against the Yankees.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Yankees right-hander A. J. Burnett retired the Baltimore Orioles on 10 first-inning pitches Friday, but one was hit so hard that Nick Swisher slammed into the wall making a running catch. Soon, the Orioles smacked just enough pitches to open spots, dooming Burnett again.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/30/sports/YANKS/YANKS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 737, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/30/sports/YANKS/YANKS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/30/sports/YANKS/YANKS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Burnett Goes 8 Innings, but Gives Up More Than Yanks Can Afford', 'kicker': 'Orioles 4, Yankees 2 ', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Burnett Goes 8 Innings, but Gives Up More Than Yanks Can Afford', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Burnett, A J', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organiza