1/07/31/sports/football/the-jets-tannenbaum-this-is-your-captain-speaking.html', 'snippet': 'Despite missing out on the shutdown cornerback Nnamdi Asomugha, who chose the Eagles, general manager Mike Tannenbaum’s aggressive style has transformed the Jets.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Examine Mike Tannenbaum’s transaction history as the Jets’ general manager, and an obvious pattern emerges. He trades up, he trades down, he trades sideways. He deconstructs, he rebuilds. He acquires players with checkered pasts, hazy presents and promising futures.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/31/sports/tannenbaum-3/tannenbaum-3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 386, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/31/sports/tannenbaum-3/tannenbaum-3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 386}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/31/sports/tannenbaum-3/tannenbaum-3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/31/sports/tannenbaum-3/tannenbaum-3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/31/sports/tannenbaum-3/tannenbaum-3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'With Tannenbaum, Jets Show Audacity From the Top Down', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'With Tannenbaum, Jets Show Audacity From the Top Down', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ryan, Rex', 'ran