f knowledge are a must. But there’s more, much more.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/31/sports/golf/heavy-bags-for-caddies-theres-more-to-it-than-just-schlepping-a-bag-for-18-holes.html', 'snippet': 'What does it take to be a caddie on the PGA Tour? A strong back, strong legs and strong golf knowledge are a must. But there’s more, much more.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WHITE SULPHUR SPRINGS, W.Va. — Stepping inside the ropes at a PGA Tour event is not for the faint of heart. It requires physical strength, mental toughness, resiliency, good golf course management, accuracy, a lot of nerve and a thick skin.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/31/sports/YCADDY/YCADDY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 949, 'width': 767, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/31/sports/YCADDY/YCADDY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/31/sports/YCADDY/YCADDY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'For Caddies, There’s More Than Just Schlepping a Bag', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Burden To Carry', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Golf', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Professional Golfers Assn', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bell, Bryon', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Williams, Steve', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Woods, Tiger', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-30T16:55:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 's