', 'snippet': 'Johnny Cueto had a 1.88 earned run average through his first 15 starts, in the last several of which he has used Luis Tiant-style mechanics.', 'lead_paragraph': 'By the time Johnny Cueto was born, in the Dominican Republic in 1986, Luis Tiant was a decade removed from his heyday as a twirling contortionist of a right-hander for the Boston Red Sox. Tiant had a singular flair, with a spinning, gyrating delivery, but if any pitcher comes close today, it is Cueto.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Style Points for Reds’ Cueto', 'kicker': 'Bats', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cueto, Johnny', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tiant, Luis', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Cincinnati Reds', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-30T19:36:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tyler Kepner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tyler', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kepner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/44a0a938-7f7d-55db-8d79-a1d517c081d7', 'word_count': 290, 'uri': 'nyt://article/44a0a938-7f7d-55db-8d79-a1d517c081d7'}, {'abstract': 'Only insiders failed to see the truth', 'web_url': 'https://krugman.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/07/30/very-serious-suckers/', 'snippet': 'Only insiders failed to see the truth', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jonathan Chait has an excellent piece documenting the way in which what he calls the establishment, and I call Very Serious People, misjudged the way the debt ceiling thing would play out:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main':