-a896bf41ff0b', 'word_count': 1645, 'uri': 'nyt://article/55834b2c-1edd-5981-8c90-a896bf41ff0b'}, {'abstract': 'The Liberty are playing the first of three seasons at Prudential Center in Newark while Madison Square Garden undergoes summertime renovations.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/31/sports/basketball/wnbas-liberty-getting-comfortable-in-newark.html', 'snippet': 'The Liberty are playing the first of three seasons at Prudential Center in Newark while Madison Square Garden undergoes summertime renovations.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NEWARK — The organ that led the crowd in the two-note chant of DEE-fense sounded the same. The squeal of the girls and boys hoping for the mascot Maddie to aim a T-shirt launcher their way sounded the same. And the Liberty filled the same home white uniforms.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/31/sports/LIBERTY/LIBERTY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 686, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/31/sports/LIBERTY/LIBERTY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/31/sports/LIBERTY/LIBERTY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Like the Liberty, Their Home in Newark Is a Work in Progress', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Liberty Try to Put Down Roots at Temporary Home', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Weatherspoon, Teresa', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prudential Center (Newark)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pondexter, Cappie', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': '