ed by Washington.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/31/opinion/sunday/us-delays-entry-of-iraqis-who-risked-their-lives.html', 'snippet': 'Displaced Iraqis, who risked their lives on America’s behalf, should not be abandoned by Washington.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Iraq war, thankfully, is nearly over for this country. Not so for thousands of Iraqis who have worked with American troops and diplomats since the 2003 invasion as interpreters, drivers and fixers. They have long been targeted by militants. As American troops depart — the last are due to leave the country by the end of December — they are increasingly on their own. ', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'They Risked Their Lives', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'They Risked Their Lives: Washington must not abandon Iraqis who worked alongside Americans', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iraq', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Iraq War (2003- )', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Refugees and Displaced Persons', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration and Emigration', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Visas', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-30T19:49:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'subsection_name': 'Sunday Review', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/f98efaa5-a457-5f4c-be14-49768a64eb2a', 'word_count': 492, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f98efaa5-a457-5f4c-be14-49768a64eb2a'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Stein was a former chief of the Dreyfus Corporation who, as one of the fathers of the mutual fund industry, introduced innovation