ter R. A. Dickey allowed a three-run homer to Jayson Werth in the first inning and gave up nothing after that, but he still took the loss to fall to 5-9.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/31/sports/baseball/mets-loss-to-nationals-ends-5-game-winning-streak.html', 'snippet': 'Starter R. A. Dickey allowed a three-run homer to Jayson Werth in the first inning and gave up nothing after that, but he still took the loss to fall to 5-9.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — After scoring 34 runs in their previous four games, including at least eight in each of those contests, the Mets could not even get a runner to third base until there were two outs in the ninth inning Saturday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/31/sports/mets/mets-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 375, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/31/sports/mets/mets-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 375}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/31/sports/mets/mets-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 679, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/31/sports/mets/mets-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/31/sports/mets/mets-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Mets’ Loss to Nationals Ends 5-Game Winning Streak', 'kicker': 'Nationals 3, Mets 0', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Mets’ Loss to Nationals Ends 5-Game Winning Streak', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': '