rize amateur cooks for the benefit of an audience. Either that or he could look into the camera and patiently explain how you too could make food that would knock people out of their chairs.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2010/04/12/business/media/carr-50/carr-50-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2010/04/12/business/media/carr-50/carr-50-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Bringing Comfort Food to Print Fans', 'kicker': 'The Media Equation', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Bringing Comfort Food To Print Fans', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Magazines', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mobile Applications', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Chang, David (Chef)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-07-31T23:38:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Carr', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Carr', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1f37356b-8457-5311-9c25-3adfc6a7cde5', 'word_count': 1156, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1f37356b-8457-5311-9c25-3adfc6a7cde5'}, {'abstract': 'Florida’s leaders have rejected grants and sought deferrals in carrying out the 2010 health care law.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/08/01/us/01florida.html', 'snippet': 'Florida’s leaders have rejected grants and sought deferrals in carrying out the 2010 health care law.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TALLAHASSEE, Fla. — When it comes to pursuing federal largess, most of the states that oppose the 2010 health care law have refused to let either principle or politics block their paths to the trough. If Washington is doling out dollars, Republican governors and legislators typically figure they might as well get their share. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/08/01/us/FLORIDA-1/FLORIDA-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 326, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/08/01/us/FLORIDA-1/FLORIDA-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 326}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/08/01/us/FLORIDA-1/FLORIDA-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/08/01/us/FLORIDA-1/FLORIDA-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/08/01/us/FLORIDA-1/FLORIDA-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Opposing the Health Law, Florida Refuses Millions', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Opposing the Health Law, Florida Refuses Millions of Dollars', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Patient Protection and Affordable Care Act (2010)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Health Insurance and Managed Care', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Scott, Richard L', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': '